<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">MHB- Bible Kiyaka</book>
  <para style="h">MIHANGU</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mhb</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mihangu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wa Mihangu mya Bathumwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mihangu mya Bathumwa</para>
  <para style="imt">Khotidi ya mukanda</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda wa Mihangu mya Bathumwa wena khosikidi ya Musamu wa Bukheti wa Luka. Wubati menika phila yina bámwangina musamu Bathumwa kondilo bambambala ba Yesu. Bayandikila kulongawa, theti kuna Yelusalemi, amana kunima benda mu tsi za bela-bela, amana bátula yi muna tsi zina zazyeta yanga dya Meditelaneye. Bwabuna bálungisila "kituma" kina kábaheka Yesu (Luk 24:47-48 yi Mihangu 1:8).</para>
  <para style="io1">Ku luyandiku lwa mukanda wa Mihangu, Yesu wutombuki kuna zilu kwena Nzambi (1:9). Buthwena, kenahoku hika phila mosi, kaasi wuhitiki kwena bathumwa Kitembu Kyatoma kina kitukini kwena Nzambi (khaphu 2). Kitembu meni kabati basadisa mu kusamuna mambu ma mbuta mana kisi lungisa Nzambi. Tukidila ku tsosu yi ndamba ya mukanda wa Mihangu, Kitembu Kyatoma kabati lundika bakwikidi bahika bapha kwena Yesu.</para>
  <para style="io1">Tii yi kuna khaphu ya 12, Thumwa Phetelu kenina mutu wa mupfunu wa lawu muna meni dya mukanda wa Mihangu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Balonguki ba Yesu benina Bayuta. Babati kwenda kaka ku nzu ya Nzambi ya Yelusalemi amana babati zonzila Pfumu wa bawu. Kaasi bwosu hanga Yesu, munyanga wa lawu benina wawu ku thwala ya malemba (khaphu ya 3 yi kuna 8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Bakwikidi hanga bendi ndambu muma mwosu muna Yuteya, muna Samadiya yi muna tsi za kyana. Babati samuna Musamu wa Bukheti phila mosi yi kwena bana bakondi kala Bayuta (khaphu ya 8 yi kuna ya 12). Dyadina dyenina dyambu dya mbuta dya pha. Muna tangwa meni dyadina, Bayuta lwesi bakala sambila Nzambi yandi mosi. Bakala banza ni batu ba dibundu dyahika báfwanaku kumuzaya. Kaasi Yesu Kidisitu kabati tela batu boosu mu kukala mu kithwadi yi Nzambi. Mangumba ma bakidisitu, kondi loni Mabundu, mabutukini. Mayaluki lawu amana muna kati dya bawu mwenina yi Bayuta yi Baphani.</para>
  <para style="io1">Tukidila ku khaphu ya 13, "thumwa Pholu" wákituka mutu wa mupfunu lawu hanga Phetelu muna meni dya mukanda wa Mihangu. Pholu, bámutela kwena Yesu Kidisitu (khaphu ya 9). Dibundu dya Atyoki wa Sidiya dimusodini ha kimosi yi bakhunda bahika kikuma kya kusamuna Musamu wa Bukheti wa Yesu Kidisitu kuna tsi za kyana. Tukidila ku khaphu ya 13 yi kuna 28 mabati menika bitambu bya kisalu kyandi. Mabati menika mutindu wuna wáyalanganina Musamu wa Bukheti muna kinzunga kya Meditelaneye yi kuna mbanza ya Loma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musamu wa Bukheti wa Yesu Kidisitu bwosu kásonikawa Luka wubati zonzila tangwa dya Yesu. Ha kimosi yi mukanda wa Mihangu mya Bathumwa, "tangwa dya Dibundu diyandikini. Dyenina tangwa dina bisi samuna, bakwikidi ba bakidisitu kosu tangwa yi muma mwosu malongi ma Yesu, Kidisitu. Babatima samuna kwena batu ba khadidi zoosu yi mangumba mosu, kwena bambuta yi baleki, kwena baphutu yi bamvwama.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Lusilu lwa Kitembu Kyatoma kwena Bathumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1"/>
    <note caller="a" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Mukanda wawu, Luka kásonikawa mu khumbu ya mukidisitu mosi wa luzitu, Thyofila, yi kikuma kya bakidisitu bahika. </char>
    </note>Muzitu Thyofila,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:1">Muna mukanda wama wuna watheti, yízonzila moosu mana káhanga Yesu yi mana kálonga tukidila ku luyandiku <verse eid="ACT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2"/>yi kuna kilumbu kina kátombwakila ku zilu. Ku thwala ya kunyokuka kwandi ku zilu, wáhana milongi, mu ngolu za Kitembu Kyatoma, kwena bathumwa bana kásola. <verse eid="ACT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3"/>Kwena bawu phi kámonika wamoya, ku manima ma lufwa lwandi, yi mitindu mya lawu mina kádisongila, mu bilumbu makumaya ndangu kabasongila ni mukyedika, mu luzingu kenina: kakala monika yi kubazonzilaka mambu matadidi Kipfumu kya Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4"/>Kilumbu kimosi kakala dya ha kimosi yi bawu, wábaheka mulongi wawu: «Lwendaku kyana yi Yelusalemi, kaasi hingilenu kilangi kina kásila Tata, bwosu yílumenikinabwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5"/>Yowani kábotika yi mamba, kaasi benu, mu bilumbu bya khunda, lwabótama<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mhb 2:1-4. Babati tendula mana bámona bakwikidi mu kilumbu kya kukulumuka kwa Kitembu Kyatoma, ha «kábabotika» Kitembu Kyatoma. </char></note> yi Kitembu Kyatoma.»<verse eid="ACT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thombuka ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6"/>Bana bakala bakutakana bámuyufula bwabu: «Pfumu, buthwena wavutulula Kipfumu kya Kiseledi?»<verse eid="ACT 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7"/>Yandi wábavutwala: «Malutadiku mu kuzaya tangwa holo kilumbu kina kázenga tata mu hamu dyandi. <verse eid="ACT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8"/>Kaasi tangwa kalúkulwamukina Kitembu Kyatoma, lwatámbula ngolu zandi<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu kázola kazimbula ni ka thama ku, Kitembu Kyatoma kalúnga mu kukwisa kwena bawu ndangu kabaheka ngolu za kumuzonzila kwena batu bahika.</char></note> amana lwakítuka bambangi bama mu Yelusalemi yi mu Yuteya dyosu yi mu Samadiya yi kuna tsuka ya tsi.» <verse eid="ACT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9"/>Buna kázonza ndinga meni zina, bwosu bakala tala, Yandi wátombuka ku zilu, tuti dimosi dyámufídinga amana bámumonaku hika. <verse eid="ACT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10"/>Bwosu bakala tala ku zilu kuna kénda yandi, batala bwabu, batu bodi, mu miledi mya phembi<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna Masonuku, mbala za lawu bisi zonzila banzyo muna phila meni yina: "Batu mu miledi mya phembi".</char></note>, bábatelamina <verse eid="ACT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11"/>bazonzi phi: «Bisi Ngadidi, kikuma kya biki lutelaminiki haka mu kutala ku zilu? Yesu wuna dihambudi yi benu, wendi ku zilu, kakwisa vutuka kaka bwosu lumumoni kendi ku zilu.»<verse eid="ACT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Matyasi wuhingani ha kifulu kya Yutasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12"/>Hanga bavutuki ku Yelusalemi, buna bátuka ku mongu wa Olive. Wuna wakala bela-bela yi Yelusalemi, muna nzila yina bákangala kitesu kya kilometele dimosi. <verse eid="ACT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13"/>Amana tangwa bákota, bazanza ku mwanza wambuta wa ku zilu kuna bakala kutakanina theti. Kwákala: Phetelu, Yowani, Zyaki, Andele, Fidiphu, Toma, Batolomi, Mathayi, Zyaki mwana wa Alufwe, Simoni wuna wákala theti mu dingumba dya bana bisi nwanina diphandasi, yi Yuta mwana wa Zyaki. <verse eid="ACT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14"/>Bawu boosu bákwamina mu kimvuka mu kulombilaka homa ha mosi, kumosi yi bakhetu, yi Madiya ngudi wa Yesu, yi baphangi ba Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15"/>Kilumbu kimosi muna bilumbu meni bina, Phetelu wátelama hana kati dya bakwikidi, thalu ya batu bana bákala mu kimvuka yakala kitesu kya khama mosi yi makumodi hanga wuzimbudi: <verse eid="ACT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16"/>«Baphangi bama, bwáfwana malungila Masonuku ma Kitembu Kyatoma, muna munwa wa Tavidi, mana katekila zonza kikuma kya Yutasi, wuna wásongila nzila kwena batu bana bamukwata Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17"/>Mukuma kákala mosi mu kati dya betu, amana wátambula kiyeka kyandi mu kisalu meni kyaki.» <verse eid="ACT 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18"/>Kunima kusumba kilanga kimosi yi mbongu zina bámufuta kikuma kya mbi yandi, wabwa wabukama, kundu dyámuyatuka ha kati-kati, mitsyobu myosu mimulubuki. <verse eid="ACT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19"/>Amana tsangu záyalangana kwena bisi Yelusalemi, tii yi kuna bátedilakya kilanga meni kina mu ndinga ya bawu ni «Hakheditama», disongidila: «Kilanga kya menga». <verse eid="ACT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20"/>Amana Phetelu wávutwakila hika: "Kinga básonika mu mukanda wa mikunga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">nzu yamúkituka yamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">amana keti mutu kazíngilahoku."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:20">Amana:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">"Ni mutu wa hika katambula kiyeka kyandi."<verse eid="ACT 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21"/>«Bulungi ni mu kati dya batu bana bisi tusindikila tangwa dyosu dina kakala kwenda yi kukwisa, Pfumu Yesu ha kati dya betu, <verse eid="ACT 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22"/>tuka ku mbotika ya Yowani tii yi kuna kilumbu kina kátombwakila ha kati dya betu, mosi wa batu meni bana kakituka mbangi wa lufutumuku lwandi ha kimosi yi betu.»<verse eid="ACT 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23"/>Amana bálubula bayakala bodi: Yozefu wuna bakala tela Badisaba, bakala mutela hika ni Yusitusi, yi Matyasi. <verse eid="ACT 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24"/>Kunima balombidi bwabu: «Pfumu, ngeyi wisi zaya mbundu za batu boosu, songila keti nati, ha kati dya bawu bodi, wusodi ngeyi, <verse eid="ACT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25"/>ndangu kahingana mu kisalu kyaki, kya kithumwa kina kásisa Yutasi mu kukwenda kuna kwámufwana.» <verse eid="ACT 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26"/>Bahanga babeti zeki hana kati dya bawu bodi, amana zeki dyábwila kwena Matyasi, wuna báyika kwena bathumwa kumi yi mosi.<verse eid="ACT 1:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Kukwisa kwa Kitembu Kyatoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1"/>Tangwa kyáfwana kilumbu kya Phandikoti<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Phandikoti: Mukinzi wumosi hana kati dya mitatu muna mvula ya bisi Kiseledi. Wenina mukinzi wa kubambukisa kabu dya mitsiku. Muhowu wawu wubati zonzila "makumatanu muna ndonga" kikuma mukinzi bisiwa ta kunima dya bilumbu makumatanu bya Phaki (khaphu ya 12:4). Bisi Yuta bisi kutakana kuna Yelusalemi muna tangwa dya mukinzi meni wuna. Mukinzi bisiwa ta muna tangwa dina balungi mu kukangala konda khakalakanu, amana wisi tela batu balawu. </char></note>, boosu bákala mu kimvuka homa hamosi. <verse eid="ACT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2"/>Mu kithulumukina, malokosi mamosi mátuka ku zilu, hanga pfunzi ya ngolu yibasisi phi nzu yosu yina bákala bazakala. <verse eid="ACT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3"/>Kutala mileku mibamonikini hanga mina mya mbawu; midihambudi amana myábwila hana thandu ya kosu mutu wa bawu. <verse eid="ACT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4"/>Boosu bábasa yi Kitembu Kyatoma amana báyandika kuzonza mu ndinga za hika, bwosu buna kakala batwadisila Kitembu Kyatoma mu kuzonza.<verse eid="ACT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5"/>Kinga Bayuta bakwikama, ba makanda moosu menina mu tsya zilu<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuzimbula ni "ba makanda moosu" yena nzonzidi yibati tendula ni muma mwa lawu holo mu tsi za lawu bátuka. "Tsya zilu" yenina phila ya kuzonzila phi ni mu tsi yosu bátuka. </char></note> bakala zingila ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6"/>Amana muna malokosi mana máyukalakana, mulumba-lumba wa batu wisa thinu amana bákala mabanza vwalanganu, kikuma kosu mutu kakala bayuka kuzonza muna ndinga yandi. <verse eid="ACT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7"/>Báyituka lawu, básaluka phi, bakala zimbula: «Batu bana babati zonza, boosu beku bisi Ngadidi? <verse eid="ACT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8"/>Abweti ni kosu mutu, mu kati dya betu, kabati bayuka muna ndinga yandi ya kisina? <verse eid="ACT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9"/>Ha kati dya betu henina yi batu batukini ku tsi ya Phaditi, ya Mediya yi ya Elami. Henina yi bana bisi zingila ku Mezophotamiya, ku Yuteya yi ku Kaphatosi, ku Phoni yi kuna mulambu wa Aziya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10"/>bátuka ku Fizi yi ku Phafidiya, dya ku Ngiphiti yi kinzunga kya Sileni mu Dibya; henina yi bana bátuka ku Loma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11"/>Bayuta yi Bakwa-kwisa bana bákwikila mu malongi ma bayuta, Bakheleti yi Bisi Alabiya; tubati bayuka kuzimbula muna ndinga zetu, mihangu mya mbuta mya Nzambi!» <verse eid="ACT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12"/>Amana boosu báyituka, bámonaku hika kima kya kuzonza; bakala dizimbwala: "Biki disongidila dya bwabubu?" <verse eid="ACT 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13"/>Kaasi bahika bakala baseya mu kuzimbula: «Malafu ma pha mabazedini!»<verse eid="ACT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Malongi ma Phetelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14"/>Hanga Phetelu wátelama yi bawu Kumi yi mosi; wáthuta ndinga amana wázimbula bwabu kwena mulumba-lumba wa batu: «Batu ba mu Yuteya yi benu boosu lwisi zingila mu Yelusalemi, hinikinenu ndinga zama, zayenu bwabu: <verse eid="ACT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15"/>batu baba bazediku malafu bwosu lubatibwa banza benu, mukuma mu tangwa dya vwa dya mu suka thwenina. <verse eid="ACT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16"/>Kaasi buthwena, malungidi mana kázimbula mbikudi Yowedi:<verse eid="ACT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17"/>"Tala mu bilumbu bya tsuka, kázimbula Nzambi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">yimwánga Kitembu kyama kwena mutu wosu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">bana benu ba bakhetu yi ba bayakala babíkula,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">bangunza benu bamóna mbona mesu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">amana binunu byenu balóta ndosi<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndosi zazi babati zonzila haha zenina mbona mesu zina kisi songila Nzambi kwena batu mu mesu ma thona, konda kukala ku kilu. Ndosi zenina mambu mana kisi hangila Nzambi batu kuna tsya kilu.</char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18"/>Mukyedika, yimwanga Kitembu kyama mwena basadi bama ba bakhetu yi basadi bama ba bayakala muna bilumbu meni bina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">amana babíkula.<verse eid="ACT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19"/>Amana yihána bidimbu bya khumbwa mu londi dya zilu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">yi biphadi muna banda dya ha tsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">yi menga yi mbawu yi kyungila kya mwisi;<verse eid="ACT 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20"/>tangwa kabáluka mu phipha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">amana ngondi kabénga hanga menga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">ku thwala kukwisa kwa kilumbu kya Pfumu, kilumbu meni kina kya mbuta yi kya khembu.<verse eid="ACT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21"/>Hanga wosu wuna watéla khumbu ya Pfumu, kahúluka."<verse eid="ACT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22"/>«Bisi Kiseledi, hinikikenu ndinga zazi: Yesu mwisi Nazaleti, mutu wuna kásikununa Nzambi kwena benu mu biphadi yi bidimbu bya khumbwa yi bidimbu bina kásala mu nzila ya yandi ha kati dya benu, bwosu luzayibwa benu-benu, <verse eid="ACT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23"/>mutu wuna, bámulambula bwosu bwádikadila kedi mu luzolu lwa Nzambi, lwámuhondisa mu kumukhoka ha kitakani kwena bandwandwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24"/>Yandi wuna káfutumuna Nzambi, mu kumukatula mu phasi za lufwa, kikuma lufwa lwáfwanaku ni lwamukwata. <verse eid="ACT 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25"/>Mukuma Tavidi bwabu kázimbula kikuma kya yandi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">"Yikala mona Pfumu tangwa dyosu ku thwala ya meni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">kikuma ku kitata kyama kena ndangu yinikanaku.<verse eid="ACT 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26"/>Ihana ni mbundu yama yenina mu kyesi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">amana ndinga zama zabasa mu kyesi kya lawu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">lutu lwama phi lwazíngila mu kivuvu,<verse eid="ACT 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27"/>mukuma wayámbwadilaku moya wama mu kalunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:27">wayámbulaku lutu lwa musadi waku watoma lwavunda.<verse eid="ACT 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28"/>Wátsongila nzila za luzingu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:28">yimóna mamboti ma lawu bwosu wakwataha kadiki ngeyi.<verse eid="ACT 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29"/>«Baphangi bama, yena yi muswa wa kuluzimbwala yi tsikiningi, mu mambu matadidi khaka wa betu Tavidi: yandi wáfwa, bámuzika; amana mazyamu mandi, yi lelu dyadi menina kwena betu. <verse eid="ACT 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30"/>Bwosu kákala mbikudi, wázaya phi ni Nzambi wázenga ndefi mu kuyadika mosi wa butuka dyandi ha kiti kya kipfumu kyandi. <verse eid="ACT 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31"/>Watekilalwa lota lufutumuku lwa Masiya amana wázonzilabwa, mu kuzimbula:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">"Bámuyambwadilaku mu kalunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">amana lutu lwandi lwávundaku."»<verse eid="ACT 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32"/>«Nzambi wámufutumuna ku lufwa, Yesu wuna yibati zonzila, amana betu boosu thwenina bambangi ba lufutumuku lwandi. <verse eid="ACT 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33"/>Bámutombula kuna koku dya kitata dya Nzambi, wátambula kwena Tata Kitembu Kyatoma kina kásila, amana wututyakidi mana lubati mona yi mana lubati yuka. <verse eid="ACT 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34"/>Mukuma yandi meni Tavidi kátombukaku ku zilu, kaasi kázonza bwabu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">"Pfumu kázimbula kwena Pfumu wama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">sikuka ku kitata kyama<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"Pfumu" kenina Nzambi. Amana "Pfumu wama" kenina Yesu Kidisitu.</char></note>,<verse eid="ACT 2:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35"/>kilumbu yikuna yikitwala bambeni baku</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:35">kidyatilu kya bitambi byaku."<verse eid="ACT 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36"/>Batu boosu ba Kiseledi bafweti zayabwa mboti-mboti ni Nzambi wámukitula Pfumu yi Masiya, Yesu wuna lwákhoka ha kitakani!»<verse eid="ACT 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37"/>Amana ku nima dya kuyuka bwabuna, mbundu zábalwala, bázimbula phi kwena Phetelu yi kwena bathumwa bahika: «Baphangi, biki twahanga si?» <verse eid="ACT 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38"/>Phetelu wubavutwadi: «Sobenu bikalulu, amana kosu mutu mu kati dya benu katambula mbotika mu khumbu ya Yesu Kidisitu, kikuma kya ndoluka ya masumu menu. Amana lwátambula kabu dya Kitembu Kyatoma. <verse eid="ACT 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39"/>Mukuma lusilu lwena kikuma kya benu yi kikuma kya bana benu yi kikuma kya boosu bana bena ku kyana, boosu bana katéla Pfumu Nzambi wetu.»<verse eid="ACT 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40"/>Amana Phetelu, mu ndinga za hika za lawu, kakala ta kimbangi yi kubaheka kikesa, mu kuzonza: «Dihululenu<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"Dihululenu" disongidila ni "Dikengenu"</char></note> kwena mbandu yayi yátota nzila!» <verse eid="ACT 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41"/>Bana bakala kwikila mu ndinga zandi, bakala tambula mbotika. Muna kilumbu meni kina, batu, bela-bela yi mafunda ma tatu báyikama.<verse eid="ACT 2:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Luzingu lwa kimvuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42"/>Boosu bakala sya ngolu mu kuhinikinaka malongi ma bathumwa, kuzingilaka mu kiphangi, mu kudyaka homa ha mosi yi kusambilaka homa hamosi. <verse eid="ACT 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43"/>Bweya bwakala mukwata kosu mutu, amana bidimbu bya khumbwa bya lwawu yi biphadi byákala hangama muna nzila ya bathumwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44"/>Batu boosu bákala yi lukwikilu, bakala zingila mu kimvuka, bima byosu phi bákala byawu mu kimvuka. <verse eid="ACT 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45"/>Bakala tekisa mafu yi bima bya bawu amana bakala dikabisila mbongu mu kati dya bawu boosu, bwosu buna wena mupfunu wa kosu mutu. <verse eid="ACT 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46"/>Kosu kilumbu, bakala vukana kuna nzu ya Nzambi, mu kimosi yi kudyaka mapha muna nzu, amana bakala dya bima bya bawu yi kyesi yi ngemba kuna mbundu. <verse eid="ACT 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47"/>Bakala kumisa Nzambi, batu boosu phi bákala yi kitya kikuma kya bawu. Amana kosu kilumbu, Pfumu, kakala yika batu muna kimvuka kya bawu, bana kakala hulula.<verse eid="ACT 2:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Kubeluka kwa mukwa khonzu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1"/>Amana Phetelu yi Yowani bakala tombuka ku nzu ya Nzambi mu tangwa dya bisambu (dyakala tangwa dya tatu dya masikidika). <verse eid="ACT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2"/>Kinga bakala nata mutu mosi wákala yi khonzu tuka lubutuku lwandi, kakala wasikuka bilumbu byosu muna mwelu wa nzu ya Nzambi wuna bakala tela: «Mwelu wa kitoku», ndangu kalombaka kabu dya khenda kwena bana bakala kota mu nzu ya Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3"/>Buna kámona Phetelu yi Yowani bakala kota mu nzu ya Nzambi, wábalomba kabu dya khenda. <verse eid="ACT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4"/>Phetelu yi Yowani bámutala amana Phetelu wumuzimbwadi: «Tutala.» <verse eid="ACT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5"/>Amana yandi wábatala yi kivuvu ni kima katambula kima kwena bawu. <verse eid="ACT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6"/>Hanga Phetelu wumuzimbwadi: «Yeku yi phalata, keti wolu; kaasi kina yenina kyawu, yikuhekikya: mu khumbu ya Yesu Kidisitu mwisi Nazaleti, telama amana kangala!» <verse eid="ACT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7"/>Amana buna kámusimba kuna koku dya kitata, wámutelamisa. Muna mbala mosi kaka, bitambi byandi yi tsingini byázyama. <verse eid="ACT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8"/>Wádithumba mbala mosi phi wekina mutendendi, wáyandika phi kukangala. Wákota kuna nzu ya Nzambi nzila mosi yi bawu. Kakala kangala, weka sotuka yi kuzatulaka Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9"/>Batu boosu bámumona mu kukangala yi mu kuzatulaka Nzambi; <verse eid="ACT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10"/>bakala muzaya ni yandi wuna wakala wasikuka ha Mwelu wa Kitoku wa nzu ya Nzambi, wakala lomba phi makabu ma khenda. Batu báyituka lawu, kikuma kya mana mámubwila.<verse eid="ACT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Malongi ma Phetelu ku nzu ya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11"/>Bwosu kányanginina kwena Phetelu yi Yowani, hanga batu boosu báyituki lawu, bénda thinu kuna bákala bawu, muna mbalanda yina bakala tela: «Mbalanda ya Solumoni.» <verse eid="ACT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12"/>Tangwa kámona bwabuna, Phetelu wázimbula kwena batu bana: «Bisi Kiseledi, kikuma kya biki lubati yitwakila mu mambu mana? Biki lubati tutadila, hangambe ti betu tumukangadisi mutu yandu mu ngolu za betu-betu holo mu kukangama kwetu kwena Nzambi? <verse eid="ACT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13"/>Nzambi wa Bulahami, Nzambi wa Yizaki, Nzambi wa Yakobi, Nzambi wa batata betu, yandi wuzatudi musadi wandi Yesu, wuna lwálambula, lwátuna phi benu-benu yi kuna thwala ya Philatu, kinga yandi mboti kázenga ni kamusula. <verse eid="ACT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14"/>Benu lwámutuna wuna Watoma yi Wamasonga, hanga lulombini ni baluyambwadila ndwandwa mosi. <verse eid="ACT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15"/>Amana wuna wáyandika luzingu, benu lwámuhondisa, kaasi Nzambi wámufutumuna ku bafwa; betu thwena bambangi ba mambu mana. <verse eid="ACT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16"/>Amana mu lukwikilu lwa khumbu ya yandi meni, khumbu yandi yivutudi ngolu kwena mutu yandu lubati mona, luzayi phi; mu lukwikilu, mu khumbu ya Yesu, lumukodisi kimakulu ku thwala benu boosu.»<verse eid="ACT 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17"/>«Amana buthwena, baphangi bama, nzayi ni mu kukonda kwa kuzaya lwahangila mambu mana, phila mosi yi bapfumu benu. <verse eid="ACT 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18"/>Kaasi muna phila meni yina, yi mwamuna kálungisila, Nzambi, mambu mana kátekila samuna mu munwa wa bambikudi boosu ni Masiya wandi kanyókuka. <verse eid="ACT 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19"/>Ihana ni sobenu bikalulu byenu, bulukenu kwena Nzambi, ndangu masumu menu makumuka. <verse eid="ACT 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20"/>Yi bwana kalúhitikila, Pfumu, matangwa ma kulembwa, amana kahítika Yesu, Masiya wuna katekila sola ku thwala benu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21"/>Yandi, wuna wáfwana ku kuzingila ku zilu tii yi kuna tangwa dina kayílulula Nzambi moosu mana kázimbula, tukidila thama, kwena bambikudi bandi ba Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22"/>Moyize kázimbula bwabu: "Pfumu, Nzambi wenu, katélamisa kikuma kya benu, mbikudi mosi hanga meni, hana kati dya baphangi benu; lwamuyukidiki mu mambu moosu mana kakala luzimbwala. <verse eid="ACT 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23"/>Kaasi wuna wakonda mulemvukila mbikudi wuna, bamúzanga amana bamúkatula mu ndonga ya batu ba Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24"/>Bambikudi boosu, yandikila kwena Samwela, yi bilandi byandi, bázonzila bilumbu bina amana básamunabya phi. <verse eid="ACT 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25"/>Benu, lwenina bana ba bambikudi yi muna bulunda buna káta Nzambi mu nzila ya batata benu mu kuzonza kwena Bulahami: "Mwena mosi wa butuka dyaku mwasákumukina bikanda byosu bya ha tsi." <verse eid="ACT 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26"/>Nzambi, kunima dya kulubula musadi wandi, kwena benu katekila muhitika, kikuma kya kulusakumuna, mu kukatula mosi-mosi wa benu ku mabanza mandi mambi.»<verse eid="ACT 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Phetelu yi Yowani ku thwala kimvuka kya mbuta kya Bayuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1"/>Tangwa bakala zonza, Phetelu yi Yowani, kwena batu, banganga Nzambi yi kaphita wa batsinzidi ba nzu ya Nzambi yi Basadise<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Basadise: kibuka kimosi muna nzu ya Nzambi ya bayuta kina kyakala tala mambu ma nzu ya Nzambi yi nzu ya kisalu ya mbuta wa banganga Nzambi muna tangwa meni dina. Basadise bakalaku kwikila mwena banzyo, bakalaku kwikila phi ni Nzambi wufwani kuzingisa hika batu bafwa. Amana phi, bawu bakalaku kwikila mwena Masiya wuna wa mukyedika. </char></note> bátula. <verse eid="ACT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2"/>Básidika mu kubamona, bathumwa bawu bodi, mu kulonga kwena batu yi mu kubasamwana kikuma kya Yesu, lufutumuku lwandi ha kati dya bafwa, mu kusongila ni kilumbu kimosi batu bafútumuka. <verse eid="ACT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3"/>Hanga babakwati, babakotisi phi mu boloku muna phipa meni yana yi kuna kilumbu kyalanda, mukuma kuma kwayila kwákala<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mitsiku mya bayuta myákalaku hana muswa kwena bazusi ni bazenga mukanu mu phipha. Batwadisi ba nzu ya Nzambi báhana muswa kwena batsinzidi ndangu babasya mu boloku yi kuna kilumbu kyálanda. Bwabuna bwálunga kikuma kya bawu ku thwala ya kubafungwasa bathumwa bawu bodi.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4"/>Amana batu lawu hana kati dya bana bayuka malongi, hanga bakituki bakwikidi; amana thalu ya bayakala yátombuka bela-bela yi mafunda ma tanu.<verse eid="ACT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5"/>Amana kilumbu kyalanda, bapfumu ba bawu yi bathwadisi ba nzu ya Nzambi yi balongi ba mitsiku bákutakana kuna Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6"/>Hákala hika yi nganga Nzambi wa mbuta Ana yi Khayifu yi Yowani<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yowani yandi bazonzidi haka kena mosi hana kati dya batu bana bakala mu kikanda ya banganga-Nzambi. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Keku mutu mosi yi Yowani wa thumwa. </char></note> yi Lekizandi yi boosu bana bákala mu kikanda kya bambuta ba banganga Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7"/>Amana buna bábanata Phetelu yi Yowani ku thwala ya bawu, bábahyula phi bwabu: «Mu ngolu za nati yi mu khumbu ya nati wuluhangidi bwabuna?» <verse eid="ACT 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8"/>Hanga Phetelu, wabasa yi Kitembu Kyatoma, wubazimbwadi: «Balemba yi bathwadisi ba nzu ya Nzambi: <verse eid="ACT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9"/>batufundisidi lelu kikuma kya dyambu dya mboti dimosi tusadi kwena mukwa khonzu yi buna kabelukidi. <verse eid="ACT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10"/>Zayenubwoku mboti, benu boosu, yi bisi Kiseledi ni mu khumbu ya Yesu Kidisitu mwisi Nazaleti, wuna lwákhoka ha kitakani, amana Nzambi wámufutumuna ha kati dya bafwa, mwena yandi katelamini mutu yandu yi lutu lwa kitoku ku thwala ya benu.» <verse eid="ACT 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11"/>«Yandi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">"Yi tadi dina lwálosa benu batungi ba nzu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">amana dyákituka tadi dya sina dya mupfundila<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayuta básadila lawu matadi mu kutunga nzu za bawu. </char></note>."»<verse eid="ACT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12"/>«Luhulusu lweku mwena mutu wahika yuka ka mwena Yandi ku, mukuma mweku khumbu ya hika, mu sina dya zilu, yina bahana kwena batu yina tufwani twahulukila.»<verse eid="ACT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13"/>Mu kumona kikumbwala kya Phetelu yi Yowani, báyituka lawu, mukuma bakala bazayila ni bawu batu bakonda longuka, bábakula phi ni babana bázinga yi Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14"/>Kaasi bwosu bakala mona, hana kabeta ka bawu, mutu wuna wábeluka, wutelamiki, bámonaku hika kima kya kuzonza. <verse eid="ACT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15"/>Bábasenda batelama ha mbasi, amana báyandika kutendana bawu yi bawu, <verse eid="ACT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16"/>yi kuzimbulaka: «Biki twabáhanga batu baba? Kikuma, batu boosu ba Yelusalemi bazayi ni kiphadi kyaki kya mbuta, mu nzila ya bawu kisalamini amana twalendakyoku mu kutuna. <verse eid="ACT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17"/>Kaasi tubakandisenu ndangu dyambu dina diyalanganaku lawu ha kati dya batu, bazonziladyoku keti kwena mutu mosi mu khumbu yina.»<verse eid="ACT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18"/>Amana bábatela, bábakandisa phi mu kuzonzila keti kulonga hika mu khumbu ya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19"/>Kaasi Phetelu yi Yowani babavutwadi: «Bwalunga bwenina ku mesu ma Nzambi yukani twalemvukila benu hana tufwani kulemvukila Nzambi? Zengenu benu-benu. <verse eid="ACT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20"/>Mukuma betu, tufwaniku kubusa kuzonzila mambu mana twámona yi mana twáyuka.» <verse eid="ACT 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21"/>Malemba bábayangisa hika kunima bábayambwadila, bámonaku phila ya kubahekila ndola; kikuma batu boosu Nzambi bakala zatula mu kumona mambu mana máluta. <verse eid="ACT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22"/>Mukuma mutu wuna wábeluka mu kiphadi kina kákala yi mvula ziluti makumaya.<verse eid="ACT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lombilu lwa bakwikidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23"/>Kunima dya kubasula, Phetelu yi Yowani benda menika kwena banduku ba bawu mambu mana moosu bábazimbwala kwena malemba yi banganga Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24"/>Buna báyuka bwabuna, boosu báthuta ndinga mu kimosi, kwena Nzambi amana bázimbula: «Mulongi, ngeyi wáhanga tsi yi zilu yi mayanga yi bina byosu byenamwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25"/>Ngeyi wázonza, mu ngolu za Kitembu Kyatoma, mu munwa wa khaka wetu Tavidi musadi waku:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">"Kikuma kya biki bibati vwalanganina bikanda byosu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">Amana kikuma kya biki batu bakasi mafwongu makonda kima?<verse eid="ACT 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26"/>Bakyamvu ba tsi batelami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">amana bapfumu phi bakutakani</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">kikuma kya kunwanisa Pfumu yi Kidisitu wandi."<verse eid="ACT 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27"/>Mukuma, mu kyedika, ni kikuma kya kunwanisa musadi waku watoma wuna wáyadika Yesu bakasidi fwongu Eloti yi Phosi Philatu mu mbanza yayi, kumosi yi makanda yi batu ba Kiseledi. <verse eid="ACT 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28"/>Kikuma kya kulungisa lwesi byosu bina wátekila zola mu ngolu zaku. <verse eid="ACT 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29"/>Amana buthwena, Pfumu, tala tsokisila za bawu amana hana ngolu kwena basadi baku mu kulonga malongi maku yi kikumbwala. <verse eid="ACT 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30"/>Lambula koku dyaku ndangu kubeluka kwakala, bidimbu bya khumbwa yi biphadi bya phila yi phila byamónika mu khumbu ya musadi waku watoma Yesu.» <verse eid="ACT 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31"/>Tangwa bálombila, homa hana bákala, háningana. Boosu bábasa yi Kitembu kyatoma, bakala longa phi ndinga ya Nzambi yi kikumbwala.<verse eid="ACT 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakwikidi babundikisi bima homa ha mosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32"/>Kibuka kya batu bana bákwikila kyákala yi mbundu mosi yi moya mosi. Hákalaku mutu wakala zimbula ni bima byandi kikuma kya yandi buhika; kaasi kosu kima kyákala mu kimvuka. <verse eid="ACT 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33"/>Amana yi ngolu za lawu, bathumwa, bakala ta kimbangi kya lufutumuku lwa Pfumu Yesu; amana phi khenda za lawu zákala bawu boosu. <verse eid="ACT 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34"/>Amana ha kati dya bawu, ka mutu ku wákala yi mupfunu wa kima. Mukuma boosu bana bákala yi bilanga holo yi nzu, bakalabya tekisa, banati thalu yina bátekisila, <verse eid="ACT 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35"/>bazesibya muna malu ma bathumwa; amana bawu bakala kabisa kwena kosu mutu, bwosu bwákala mupfunu wandi. <verse eid="ACT 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36"/>Bwabuna Yozefu, wuna bakala tela Balanabasi kwena bathumwa, disongidila: «Mutu wisi hana kikesa», mulefi, mwisi Siphe, <verse eid="ACT 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37"/>wátekisa mafu mamosi mana kavwa, wánata makuta amana wásikulama muna malu ma bathumwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Ananiya yi Safila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1"/>Kinga mutu mosi khumbu yandi Ananiya, yi Safila mukhetu wandi, wátekisa mafu ma bawu. <verse eid="ACT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2"/>Wásweka ndambu yandi ya makuta, buna báyukana yi mukhetu wandi, amana wenda nata ndambu yina yásala, wásikulaya phi muna malu ma bathumwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3"/>Hanga Phetelu wumuhyudi: «Ananiya, kikuma kya biki kabasisidi Satana mbundu yaku ndangu wahuna Kitembu Kyatoma mu kusweka ndambu ya hika ya makuta mana wutekisidi kilanga<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ananiya tangwa kisa nata ndambu ya makuta mana katekila kilanga, hanga wuhunikisi ni yi mamana makuta mosu katekilakya kinga ndambu lwesi kahana. Wadi kákala yi masonga, kátendula ni ndambu yisi yawu holo phánizoku, wadi Nzambi kákhanaku muheka ndola. </char></note>? <verse eid="ACT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4"/>Tangwa wúkadiki mawu, wufwanikiku waswekama? Ata tangwa mátekamiki, thalu ya makuta ma mawu yikadikiku mu hamu dya ngeyi? Kikuma kya biki wubanzidiki dyambu dya phila yina muna mbundu yaku? Wuhuniku kwena batu kaasi kwena Nzambi.» <verse eid="ACT 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5"/>Tangwa káyuka Ananiya bwabuna, wábwa, wáfwa phi. Amana bweya bwa lawu bwábakwata boosu bana báyukabwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6"/>Bangunza bátelama, bávungaya mvumbi ha muledi amana bámunata, bámuzika phi.<verse eid="ACT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7"/>Kitesu kya matangwa matatu máhita, mukhetu wandi wákota, konda kuzaya mana mábwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8"/>Phetelu wumuhyudi: «Nzimbwala, mu thalu meni yina lutekisidiki kilanga?» Amana yandi wuvutudi: «Mu kyedika, muna thalu meni yina.» <verse eid="ACT 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9"/>Hanga Phetelu wumuzimbwadi: «Abweti lufwaniki kuyukana ndangu lwasokisila Kitembu kya Pfumu? Zayabwa ni bana bamuziki yakala dyaku, mu mwelu benina; bakúnata ngeyi phi.» <verse eid="ACT 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, wábwa muna malu mandi wátabula phi. Mu kukota kwa bangunza, bámuwana watabula; bámunata, bámuzika phi hana kabeta ka yakala dyandi. <verse eid="ACT 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11"/>Amana Dibundu dyosu bweya bwábakwata lawu boosu bana báyuka mana maluta.<verse eid="ACT 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Biphadi bya lawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12"/>Biphadi yi bidimbu bya khumbwa bya lawu byákala hangama kwena batu ku moku ma bathumwa. Bakwikidi bakala kutakana boosu, yi mbundu yimosi muna mbalanda ya Solumoni. <verse eid="ACT 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13"/>Amana muna kati dya batu bahika, keti mosi kanyotaku kukhundakana kwena bawu; kaasi batu bakala bazola lawu. <verse eid="ACT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14"/>Kaasi kosu tangwa batu bakala kwikila mwena Pfumu, lawu dya bakhetu yi bayakala bakala yikama ku dingumba. <verse eid="ACT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15"/>Bakala nata bambefu muna mabala-bala; bakala balubula ha biphoyu yi thangi za bawu, ndangu Phetelu ha kahita, kininga kyandi kyafidinga ndambu batu hana kati dya bawu. <verse eid="ACT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16"/>Batu lawu bátuka mu mbanza zina zákala bela-bela yi Yelusalemi, mu kunata bambefu yi batu bana bakala yangisa kwena bitembu bya mbi, boosu phi bakala beluka.<verse eid="ACT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lombu dya Bathumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17"/>Amana bwosu bábasa yi kiphala, mbuta wa banganga Nzambi yi boosu bana bákala kumosi yi yandi, disongidila kibuka kya basadusi, bazodi bawakula. <verse eid="ACT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18"/>Babakwatisi bathumwa, babakotisi phi mu boloku dya batu boosu. <verse eid="ACT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19"/>Kaasi muna phipha, wanzyo mosi wa Pfumu wáyafulula mwelu mya boloku amana wábalubula, wubazimbwadi: <verse eid="ACT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20"/>«Alwenda, telamenu kuna nzu ya Nzambi, amana zimbulenu kwena batu mambu moosu mana matadidi luzingu lwalu lwa pha.» <verse eid="ACT 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21"/>Buna báyuka bwabuna, benda ku nzu ya Nzambi muna kati kya suka, báyandika phi kulonga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Mbuta wa banganga Nzambi yi bana bákala kumosi yi yandi bátula; bákutikisa malemba yi kimvuka kyosu kya bambuta ba bisi Kiseledi amana babatumi kusosa bathumwa muna boloku. <verse eid="ACT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22"/>Kaasi batsinzidi mu kutula kwa bawu, bábawanamwoku mu boloku. Hanga bavutuki kwabawu, bahani phi meni dya bawu mu kuzimbula: <verse eid="ACT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23"/>«Tuwani boloku dya kuphata buna bufwani; amana batsinzidi bazakala phi muna bifulu bya bawu kuna thwala mwelu. Kaasi tangwa tuyafuludi, tuwaniku keti mutu mosi mu kati.» <verse eid="ACT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24"/>Buna báyuka bwabuna, bapfumu ba batsinzidi ba nzu ya Nzambi yi bambuta ba banganga Nzambi báyituka lawu kikuma kya dyambu dina, bakala dihyula keti bweti máhwila mambu mana. <verse eid="ACT 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, mutu mosi wisa bazimbwala: «Batu bana lusiki mu boloku, kuna nzu ya Nzambi benina, babati longa phi batu.»<verse eid="ACT 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26"/>Hanga pfumu wa batsinzidi yi batsinzidi bendi basanda bathumwa. Bábanata konda kubayangisa, mukuma bweya bakala bwawu ni babahonda nana ku matadi kwena batu. <verse eid="ACT 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27"/>Tangwa bábanata, bábasya ku thwala kimvuka, amana mbuta wa banganga Nzambi wábasambisa. <verse eid="ACT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28"/>Wuzimbudi: «Aketi tulukandisiki ni lulongilaku hika mu khumbu meni yina? Amana talenu buna lubasisi Yelusalemi mu malongi menu! Luzodi hika lwanokisina ha thandu ya betu, menga ma mutu wuna.» <verse eid="ACT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29"/>Phetelu wávutula, kumosi yi bathumwa bahika: «Bulungi kulemvuka kwena Nzambi kaasi ka batu ku. <verse eid="ACT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30"/>Nzambi wa batata betu wámufutumuna Yesu wuna lwáhondisa benu, mu kumukhoka ha kitakani. <verse eid="ACT 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31"/>Nzambi wámutombula kuna kitata kyandi, kakala Pfumu yi Muhuludi, ndangu kahana kwena Kiseledi kubalula kwa mbundu yi kuloluka kwa masumu. <verse eid="ACT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32"/>Betu thwenina bambangi ba mambu mana, kumosi yi Kitembu Kyatoma kina kahana Nzambi kwena bana bisi mulemvukila.»<verse eid="ACT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33"/>Amana bawu buna báyuka bwabuna, khabu zábakwata, bázola phi babahondisa. <verse eid="ACT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34"/>Kaasi Mufwadisi mosi khumbu yandi Ngamadyedi, mulongi wa mitsiku wuna bakala zitisa lawu kwena batu, wátelama hana kati dya kimvuka, wásenda ni babalubula koma bathumwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35"/>Kunima wuzimbudi phi: «Bisi Kiseledi, kebenu kikuma kya mambu mana lwahánga kwena batu bana. <verse eid="ACT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36"/>Mukuma mu mvula zilutuki, kátelamiki mutu mosi wukaditsikisa ni yandi lwesi, Thetasi; amana batu bela-bela yi khama ya bakotiki mu dingumba dyandi. Kaasi bamuhondikini, batu bana bakamulandaka, boosu bamwangalakani, keti kima kisadikihoku hika. <verse eid="ACT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37"/>Ku manima ma yandi kutelamiki hika Yutasi mwisi<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yutasi wuna mwisi Ngadidi wuswaswani yi wuna wálambula Yesu. Yutasi meni wuna wa kinzunga kya Ngadidi, yandi wáyidika dingumba dya batu bana bakala nwanina diphanda. Kázimbula kwena batu ni bweku mboti mu kufuta phaku kwena leta wa ku Loma, mukuma Nzambi yandi wázayakana lwesi mu kukala kyamvu wa bayuta. Wábakwikisa batu bahika ndangu bavwalangana kwena bisi Loma mu mvula ya sambanu kunima lubutuku lwa Yesu, buna bámuhonda kwena baphumbulu ba ku Loma, hanga balemvudikya kibuka kyandi. Kaasi kunima dya lufwa lwandi, bakwa kibuka kya bayuta bana bakala nwanina diphanda bálanda kaka mu kubwisa yi bapfumu ba ku Loma. </char></note> Ngadidi, mu tangwa dya kusonikisa khumbu, amana batu ba lawu bamulandiki ku manima kaasi yandi phi wufwiki, batu boosu phi hangi bamwangalakaniki. <verse eid="ACT 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38"/>Amana buthwena, yibatibwa luzimbwala, lulandaku hika batu baba, bayambulenu phi benda. Yukani mu lukanu lwa batu holo tsadidi ya batu, lwatóta. <verse eid="ACT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39"/>Kaasi yuka ni kwena Nzambi matuki mamana, lwalendaku kubatotisa. Kebenu, lwakota nana mu mvita yi Nzambi.» Bátambwasa dibanza dyandi. <verse eid="ACT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40"/>Bábatela bathumwa, bababetisi<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu kikalulu kya bayuta kina kya kuzyatula batu, batsinzidi bakala sadila tsibu za kuvunga mu kubetila bathumwa. Amana bakala babeta mafimbu makumatatu yi vwa mwena kosu thumwa. Batsinzidi báfwana kubazyatula ndambu yimosi, muna bitini bitatu bya mafimbu, ku thulu ya kikhonga amana ndambu zodi zikwawu, muna tatu za mafimbu, ku kunda dya kikhonga. </char></note> phi, amana bababwisisi ni bazonzilaku hika mu khumbu ya Yesu, kunima bábasula. <verse eid="ACT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41"/>Bathumwa bálubuka mu kimvuka kya mbuta, yi kyesi kyosu mu kumona ni Nzambi wubatambwasi ni bawu balungidi mu kulewuka kikuma kya Khumbu ya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42"/>Kosu kilumbu, kuna nzu ya Nzambi yi kuna nzu za batu, bakalaku lembwa mu kulonga yi kusamuna Musamu wa Bukheti wa Yesu wuna wenina Kidisitu.<verse eid="ACT 5:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Basodi batu tsambwadya mu kusadisa bathumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1"/>Muna bilumbu bina, bwosu bakala vula balonguki<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Balonguki: muhowu wawu, bisiwa zonzila kikuma kya balonguki batheti ba Yesu, kaasi haka, wubati zonzila bakidisitu. </char></note>, bayuta bana bakala zonza ndinga ya ngeleti bakala nyengalakana kikuma kya bayuta ba tsi yina<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayuta bana bakala zonza ndinga ya ngeleti benina bakidisitu ba bayuta bana bisi sadila ndinga ya ngeleti muna mambu ma bawu mana matadidi Dibundu. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Bayuta ba tsi benina bakidisitu ba bayuta bana bisi sadila ndinga ya hebelu muna mambu ma bawu mana matadidi Dibundu.</char></note>: bakala zimbula ni kosu kilumbu, mu tangwa dya kukabisa madya, bafwidi ba bawu bakala balewula. <verse eid="ACT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2"/>Hanga bawu Kumi yi bodi batedisi balonguki boosu, babazimbwadi: «Bulungiku ni twayambula kulonga ndinga ya Nzambi kikuma kya kusadila ku mesa. <verse eid="ACT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3"/>Yihana ni, ba phangi, solenu bayakala tsambwadi hana kati dya benu, bisi tila kimbangi kya bukheti, bábasa yi Kitembu Kyatoma yi mudimu, amana twabáhekakya kina. <verse eid="ACT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4"/>Amana betu twadihana lwesi mu lombilu yi kisalu kya Ndinga ya Nzambi.» <verse eid="ACT 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5"/>Dibanza dina dyásephidisa kibuka kyosu. Hanga basodi Kitsyeni, mutu wabasa yi lukwikilu yi Kitembu Kyatoma, Fidiphu<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fidiphu yandu, wuswaswani yi wuna wákala thumwa. </char></note>, Phokolu, Nikanolu, Timoni, Phadimenasi yi Nikolasi wuna mwisi Atyoki wuna wákota mu dingumba dya Bayuta. <verse eid="ACT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6"/>Benda basongila ku mesu ma bathumwa, bawu, kunima kulombila, bábasya moku. <verse eid="ACT 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7"/>Amana ndinga ya Nzambi yáyalangana kosu tangwa, thalu ya balonguki yakala vula tswasu ku Yelusalemi, amana mulumba-lumba wa banganga Nzambi ba bayuta bakala lemvuka ku lukwikilu mwena Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bamukwati Kitsyeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8"/>Kitsyeni wábasa yi makabu yi ngolu, kakala sala bidimbu bya khumbwa yi biphadi bya mbuta ha kati dya batu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9"/>Kaasi bayakala bahika, bana bakala mu nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta yina bisi tela: «Ya bana balubuka mu kihika», yi bayuta ba mbanza za Sileni yi Alekizandi, yi bisi Sidisi yi bisi kinzunga kya Aziya báyandika kuyumana yi Kitsyeni. <verse eid="ACT 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10"/>Kaasi balendaku mu kumubedisa mukuma kakala zonza yi mudimu yi Kitembu. <verse eid="ACT 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11"/>Hanga bafuti batu bazimbula: «Tumuyukiki mu kuzonzila mambu mabati tukwana Moyize yi Nzambi!» <verse eid="ACT 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12"/>Babalundiki batu yi malemba yi balongi ba mitsiku; kunima bátula kuna kakala, bámukwata, bámunata phi mu kimvuka kya mbuta. <verse eid="ACT 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13"/>Amana báfwonda bambangi ba bukamvi bakala zimbula: «Mutu yandu kisiku yambula mu kuzonza ndinga zibati tukwana homa haha hatoma yi mitsiku mya Moyize. <verse eid="ACT 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14"/>Mukuma tumuyukiki kuzimbula ni Yesu, mwisi Nazaleti, kazánga homa haha, amana kabálumuna mikuku mina twatambula kwena Moyize.» <verse eid="ACT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15"/>Hanga boosu bana bákala bazakala ha mbasi bakala mutala, bámona mbunzu yandi hanga yina ya wanzyo.<verse eid="ACT 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Malongi ma Kitsyeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1"/>Mbuta wa banganga Nzambi wuzimbudi: «Buna babati zimbula kikuma kya ngeyi, bwa kyedika bwenina?» <verse eid="ACT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2"/>Kitsyeni wávutula: «Baphangi bama yi batata bama hinikinenu! Nzambi wa khembu kádimonikisa kwena Bulahami, tata wetu, tangwa kákala ku Mezophotamiya, hana khaku kenda zakala ku Halani, <verse eid="ACT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3"/>amana kámuzimbwala: "Katuka ku tsi yaku yi kikanda kyaku, awenda ku tsi yina yikúsongila." <verse eid="ACT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4"/>Hanga wulubuki mu tsi ya bisi Kaditeni, wendi kala ku Halani. Kwakuna, kunima lufwa lwa tata wandi, Nzambi wamuhitisa mu tsi yayi lwisi kala buthwena. <verse eid="ACT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5"/>Kámuhekaku keti kuvwa kumosi muna tsi meni yina, keti mafu ma kuthetika bitambi; kaasi kásila ni kamúhekama mafu yi kwena batekulu bandi kinga, muna tangwa meni dina, kákalaku kedi yi mwana. <verse eid="ACT 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6"/>Nzambi kázonza bwabu: "Kanda dyandi dyakádila mu kinzenza mu tsi ya kinzenza, bakwátadya mu kihika amana banyókunadya mu mvula khama ya. <verse eid="ACT 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7"/>Kaasi muna tsi yina yabákwata mu kihika, meni yifúndisaya, ku manima ma bwabuna, balúbuka amana bakwata tsambila ha kati dya homa haha." <verse eid="ACT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8"/>Kunima Nzambi wáta bulunda yi Bulahami, amana mukhanda wenina kidimbu kya kuyukana; yihana kabutila Yizaki amana wámuyotisa mukhanda mu kilumbu kya nana; bwabuna káhanga Yizaki kwena Yakobi, amana Yakobi phi kwena bana bandi kumi yi bodi, bakhaka ba bikanda byetu.<verse eid="ACT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9"/>Bakhaka betu, bana ba Yakobi, bámuyukila kiphala phangi wa bawu Yozefu amana bámutekisa ndangu bamunata ku Ngiphiti. Kaasi Nzambi kákala kumosi yi yandi; <verse eid="ACT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10"/>amana wámutabula mu biwayi byandi kyosu, wámuheka phi khenda yi mudimu ku thwala Fwalawo kyamvu wa Ngiphiti, wuna wámuyadika pfumu mu Ngiphiti yi muna nzu yandi yosu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"Pfumu mu Ngiphiti" disongidila ni Yozefu kakala yala bisi Ngiphiti. "Nzu yandi yosu" hangambe ti bima byosu bina byákala mu nzu Fwalawo. Yozefu wásenda kwena batu boosu mu kulumbika ngenza mu mvula tsambwadi. Kunima wátekisa ngenza zina bálubula batu mu khila. </char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11"/>Hanga nzala yifwebuki lawu mu Ngiphiti yosu yi muna tsi ya Kanana. Kiwayi lawu kyákala, amana bakhaka betu bakalaku mona keti kima kya kudya. <verse eid="ACT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12"/>Yakobi, buna kayuka ni ngenza za bule zákala mu Ngiphiti, wátuma bakhaka betu mu mbala ya theti. <verse eid="ACT 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13"/>Amana mu mbala ya zodi<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuy 42-45 mwamuna babati zonzila yi tsikiningi mbala meni zina zodi benda bana ba bayakala ba Yakobi mu Ngiphiti mu kusumba ngenza za bule. </char></note>, Yozefu wádizayikisa kwena baphangi bandi, kisina kya Yozefu phi kyázayakana kwena Fwalawo. <verse eid="ACT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14"/>Kunima Yozefu wátuma benda musanda tata wandi Yakobi yi kikanda kyandi kyosu; batu makumi tsambwadi yi tanu bákala. <verse eid="ACT 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15"/>Yakobi wákulumuka ku Ngiphiti. Yi kwakuna káfwila yandi yi bakhaka betu. <verse eid="ACT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16"/>Bábanata ku Sikemi amana bábazika muna mazyamu mana kásumba Bulahami yi mbongu kwena bana ba Amoni kuna Sikemi<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Batu ba Kitsyeni bakala zayila ni muna mafu mana kásumba Bulahami yi mbongu, mwamuna bámuzika Yakobi (Kuy 50:13) amana bahika ni ku Sikemi bázika mifufwa myandi (Yos 24:32). Batu bahika bázimbula ni baphangi ba Yozefu ku Sikemi bábazikila, kaasi muyuta mosi wálonguka mambu mana máluta, khumbu yandi Yosefwati, kázimbula ni ku Heboni bábazika. Fwani bwakala ni batu babazika baphangi ba Yozefu bela-bela yi Heboni holo ku Sikemi. </char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17"/>«Bwosu dyakala bwesuka tangwa dya lusilu luna kásila Nzambi kwena Bulahami, kanda dyávula lawu mu Ngiphiti, <verse eid="ACT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18"/>yi kuna tangwa dina kisa yadila kyamvu wahika, mu Ngiphiti, wuna wakonda muzaya Yozefu. <verse eid="ACT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19"/>Kyamvu meni wuna kakala huna kanda dyetu mu mayedi mambi, wábanyokuna bakhaka betu, wábadindamisa mu kulosa bana ba bawu ba lubutu ndangu bazingaku. <verse eid="ACT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20"/>Muna tangwa meni dina yi mwamuna kábutuka Moyize, wuna wákala kitoku ku mesu ma Nzambi. Kátsatsuka ngonda tatu muna nzu ya tata wandi. <verse eid="ACT 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21"/>Buna bámuyanika, mwana ndumba wa Fwalawo wámutonguna, amana wámutsasa phi hanga mwana wandi. <verse eid="ACT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22"/>Moyize katsasukila muna mudimu wosu za bisi Ngiphiti. Kákala yi hamu dya kuzonza yi muna mihangu myandi. <verse eid="ACT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23"/>Buna kalungisa mvula makumaya, wábonga lukanu lwa kwenda kinda biwutu byandi, bisi kiseledi. <verse eid="ACT 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24"/>Buna kámona mutu mosi bakala yangisa, Moyize wámunwanina amana wávutula mbela ya mutu wuna bánwanisa; wámuhondyanga mwisi Ngiphiti. <verse eid="ACT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25"/>Kabanza ni biwutu byandi babákula ni Nzambi wuzodi kabaheka luhulusu mu nzila ya yandi; kaasi bábakulabwoku. <verse eid="ACT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26"/>Kilumbu kyalanda, wádimonikisa kwena bana bákala nwana, wuzodi ni kavutula ngemba ha kati kya bawu mu kuzimbula: "Lwenina baphangi, biki lubati nwanina benu yi benu?" <verse eid="ACT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27"/>Kaasi wuna wakala yangisa mukwawu, hanga wumununguni Moyize amana wuzimbudi: "Nati wukusi pfumu yi zusi kwena betu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28"/>Wuzodi waphonda bwosu wuhondiki mukolu mwisi Ngiphiti?" <verse eid="ACT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29"/>Buna káyuka bwabuna, Moyize watina, wenda mu kinzenza muna tsi ya Madyani. Kwakuna, wabuta bana ba bayakala bodi.<verse eid="ACT 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30"/>«Buna zalunga mvula makumaya, wanzyo mosi wámumonikina, muna nganga yina ya mongu wa Sinayi, muna muleku wa mbawu hana kivunza. <verse eid="ACT 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31"/>Mu kumona bwabuna, Moyize wáyituka kikuma kya mbona mesu yina. Amana bwosu kakala bwesuka mu kutala, ndinga ya Pfumu yáyukalakana: <verse eid="ACT 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32"/>"Meni yenina Nzambi wa bakhaka baku, Bulahami, Yizaki yi Yakobi". Moyize kuna yi tsula, kálendaku mu kutala. <verse eid="ACT 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33"/>Pfumu wumuzimbwadi: "Womuna tsabatu<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzambi kámusenda Moyize mu kuwomuna tsabatu zandi kikuma kya kuta kimbangi kya luzitu.</char></note> zaku, mukuma homa haka wutelamiki, mena mafu matoma. <verse eid="ACT 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34"/>Mboni phasi za kanda dyama dyenina mu Ngiphiti, ngyuki bibimu bya bawu, khulumukini ndangu yibahulula. Buthwena awisa, yikútuma ku Ngiphiti."<verse eid="ACT 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35"/>«Moyize yandu básuwangana, mu kuzimbula: "Nati wukuyadikini pfumu yi zusi?", yandi wuna kátuma Nzambi hanga pfumu yi muhuludi<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kitsyeni kámuzonzila Moyize hanga muhuludi, mu kusadila muhowu wumosi yi wuna kázonzila mu khaphu ya 7:27b. Muhowu meni wuna wa muhuludi, wawuna phi kásadila Luka mu mambu matadidi Yesu muna Mukanda wa Luk 24:21. Disongidila ni mutu mosi wubati lubula batu ku mambu ma phasi mu kufuta thalu ya lawu ndangu kabonga kiphwanza kya bawu. Tuzayi, konda keti-keti ni Kitsyeni wámufwanikisa Moyize yi Yesu. Bwosu káhitisa Moyize luzingu lwandi ndangu bisi Kiseledi balubuka mu kihika kya bawu, bwabuna phi kálambula Pfumu Yesu luzingu lwandi mu kulubula batu mu kihika ndangu Nzambi kabahekaku ndola kikuma kya masumu ma bawu. </char></note>, mu lusadisu lwa wanzyo wuna wámulubwakila ha kivunza kya mbawu. <verse eid="ACT 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36"/>Yandi wábalubula, wásala phi biphadi yi bidimbu bya phila yi phila mu tsi ya Ngiphiti, ku yanga dya Kabengi yi mu nganga, mu mvula makumaya. <verse eid="ACT 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37"/>Moyize meni wuna wázimbula kwena bisi Kiseledi: "Nzambi kalúhitika hana kati dya baphangi benu, mbikudi mosi hanga meni. <verse eid="ACT 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38"/>Mu lukutakanu, yandi wákala hakimosi yi wanzyo wuna wakala muzonzila ha mongu wa Sinayi yi bakhaka betu; kátambula ndinga za luzingu ndangu katuhekaza. <verse eid="ACT 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39"/>Bakhaka betu bábwisa kumulemvukila; kaasi bámusuwangana, yi sunga dya kuvutuka ku Ngiphiti. <verse eid="ACT 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40"/>Bazimbudi kwena Loni: "Tuyidikila banzambi bana bakala kwenda ku thwala betu, mukuma Moyize meni wawuna wátulubula mu tsi ya Ngiphiti, tuzayiku mana mamubwidi." <verse eid="ACT 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41"/>Muna bilumbu meni bina, báhala nzambi wa kiteki kya mwana wa ngombi, bámunatina phi mukhayilu wumosi amana báta mukinzi yi kihangwa kya moku ma bawu. <verse eid="ACT 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42"/>Kaasi Nzambi wábafwila kunda, wábayambula ni bafukamina bihangwa bya ku zilu, bwosu básonika mu mikanda mya bambikudi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">"Kanda dya Kiseledi, kwena meni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">lwátambika bibulu yi makabu mahika</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">mu mvula makumaya muna nganga?<verse eid="ACT 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43"/>Loni, kaasi sombolu dya nzambi wenu wa kiteki Moloki<note caller="h" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Moloki: khumbu ya nzambi wa zilu yi tangwa wuna bakala fukamina kwena bisi Kana yi bisi Fenisi. Muna kati dya sombolu mwakala yi nzambi wa kiteki mosi wuna wakala hanga nzambi wa bawu. </char></note> lwázangula</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">yi katumbwa ka nzambi wenu wa kiteki Lefwani<note caller="i" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Katumbwa kabati songila kidimbu kimosi kondilo nzambi wa kiteki wuna bakala nata bisi Kiseledi. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Lefwani: khumbu ya katumbwa, yibati songila tsi ya Satudine yina bakala fukamina hanga pfumu kwena bisi Ngiphiti yi bisi Kiseledi bahika. </char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">bifwanisu meni bina lwáhala mu kubafukamina.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Ihana ni yisenda ni balunata kyana kuluta mbanza ya Babiloni."»<verse eid="ACT 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44"/>«Muna nganga, bakhaka betu, bákala yi sombolu dya kimbangi, hanga dina kásongila Nzambi wuna wázonza kwena Moyize ni kayidika, bwosu kifwanisu kina kámona. <verse eid="ACT 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45"/>Sombolu meni dina báhanadya kwena bakhaka betu bana bálanda ku manima yi Yosuwe bákotisadya muna tsi ya makanda mana kákukwasa Nzambi ku thwala ya bawu. Dyásala hana tii yi kuna tangwa dya Tavidi. <verse eid="ACT 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46"/>Tavidi wámona khenda za Nzambi amana wálomba homa hamosi ndangu katungila nzu kikuma kya Nzambi wa Yakobi. <verse eid="ACT 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47"/>Kaasi Salomoni wámutungisila nzu. <verse eid="ACT 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48"/>Kaasi Kahungu kisiku zingila mu nzu zina bátunga mu moku ma batu. Bwosu kazonza mbikudi:<verse eid="ACT 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49"/>"Zilu dyenina kiti kya luyalu lwama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">amana mafu menina kidyatilu kya bitambi byama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Khi nzu lwathúngila, kázimbula Pfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">holo khi homa pfwani yilémbwila?<verse eid="ACT 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50"/>Ka koku dyama ku dyáhanga mana moosu?"<verse eid="ACT 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51"/>«Benu batu ba mutwa ngolu yi mbundu za matadi yi bizika matu, lwisi bwisa kaka Kitembu Kyatoma! Lwenina hanga bakhaka benu. <verse eid="ACT 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52"/>Khi mbikudi bákonda nyokuna bakhaka benu? Báhonda bana batekila samuna kukwisa kwa mutu wa masonga; wuna lwalambudi, buthwena, benu amana lumuhondi. <verse eid="ACT 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53"/>Benu lwátambula mitsiku mina báluheka banzyo kaasi, lwázitisamyoku!»<verse eid="ACT 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufwa lwa Kitsyeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54"/>Buna bayuka mambu mana, bafunga khabu yi kukwekisaka menu kikuma kya Kitsyeni. <verse eid="ACT 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55"/>Kaasi yandi, wabasa yi Kitembu kyatoma, buna katala ku zilu, wámona khembu ya Nzambi; amana Yesu watelama kuna koku dya kitata dya Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56"/>Wuzimbudi: «Mbati mona zilu dya kukangula yi Mwana wa mutu watelema kuna koku dya kitata dya Nzambi.» <verse eid="ACT 7:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57"/>Hanga bakalungi ngolu, baziki matu ma bawu, boosu bamubwidi; <verse eid="ACT 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58"/>bámubulumuna ku phenza ya mbanza amana báyandika kumuta matadi. Bambangi básisa miledi mya bawu kwena ngunza mosi, bakala tela Sawulu ndangu kasimbululakamya. <verse eid="ACT 7:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59"/>Kuna yi kumutimbwalaka matadi, Kitsyeni kakala lombila mu kuzimbula: «Pfumu Yesu, yamba moya wama!» <verse eid="ACT 7:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60"/>Kunima wábwa muna makungulu amana wákalunga: «Pfumu, wubafutisaku disumu dyadi!» Buna kázimbula bwabuna, wátabula.<verse eid="ACT 7:60"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1"/>Sawulu wátambwasa ni bamuhonda Kitsyeni.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 8:1">Sawulu wunyokuni Dibundu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Yandika kilumbu meni kina, báyandika kunyokuna batu mu Dibundu dina dyákala ku Yelusalemi. Bakwikidi boosu bámwangana muna binzunga bya Yuteya yi Samadiya, katula lwesi bathumwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2"/>Kaasi batu bakwikama bámuzika Kitsyeni, bawu phi bámudila lawu.<verse eid="ACT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3"/>Sawulu, yandi, kakala sanda kuzanga Dibundu; kakala kota muna nzu, mu kukwata bakhetu yi bayakala yi kubakotisaka mu boloku.<verse eid="ACT 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fidiphu wusamuni Musamu wa Bukheti mu Samadiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4"/>Batu bana bámwangana, bakala kwenda muma mwa phila yi phila yi kusamunaka Musamu wa Bukheti wa Ndinga ya Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5"/>Fidiphu, yandi wákulunga ku mbanza ya Samadiya, wásamuna kwakuna Kidisitu. <verse eid="ACT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6"/>Milumba-lumba mya batu, bázitama mu kuhinikinaka mana kakala zonza Fidiphu, mu kulonguka yi mu kumona bidimbu bya khumbwa bina kakala sala. <verse eid="ACT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7"/>Mukuma bitembu bya mbi byákala lubuka mwena batu ba lawu yi kukalungaka, amana bakwa khonzu yi babana bawokumuka bákola. <verse eid="ACT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8"/>Kyesi kya lawu kyákala muna mbanza meni yina.<verse eid="ACT 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9"/>Tuka thama, mutu mosi wákala muna mbanza meni yina, khumbu yandi Simoni. Kakala nika mikisi; kakala yitwakisa batu ku Samadiya amana yi kuditombulaka, <verse eid="ACT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10"/>tukidila kwena bambuta yi kuna baleki, boosu bakala khundakana kwena yandi, yi kuzimbulaka: «Mutu yandu kenina ngolu za Nzambi, zina bisi tela: "Za mukwandi".» <verse eid="ACT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11"/>Bakala bandakana kwena yandi kikuma kya buna kakala bayitwakisa, tuka thama, ku mikisi myandi. <verse eid="ACT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12"/>Kaasi tangwa bákwikila mwena Fidiphu, wuna wakala basamwana Musamu wa Bukheti wa Kipfumu kya Nzambi yi mu khumbu ya Yesu Kidisitu, yi bakhetu yi bayakala bátambula mbotika. <verse eid="ACT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13"/>Simoni, yandi-meni wákwikila amana wátambula mbotika; kákala tangwa dyosu bela-bela yi Fidiphu amana kakala yituka lawu kikuma kya bidimbu bya khumbwa yi biphadi bya mbuta bina byákala hangama.<verse eid="ACT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14"/>Bathumwa bana bakala ku Yelusalemi, tangwa báyuka ni bisi Samadiya batambwasiya ndinga ya Nzambi, hanga babahitiki Phetelu yi Yowani. <verse eid="ACT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15"/>Phetelu yi Yowani buna bátula kwena bawu, bálombila kikuma kya bawu ndangu batambula Kitembu Kyatoma. <verse eid="ACT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16"/>Mukuma yandu-yandu kabwilaku kedi keti mosi hana kati dya bawu; bátambula lwesi mbotika mu khumbu ya Pfumu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17"/>Hanga Phetelu yi Yowani wubasi moku, amana bátambula Kitembu Kyatoma. <verse eid="ACT 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18"/>Tangwa kámona Simoni ni Kitembu kihanami kwena bakhidisitu, mu kusya kwa moku kwena bathumwa, kahanga wubanatini sunga dya mbongu <verse eid="ACT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19"/>amana wuzimbudi: «Phekenu bawu hamu meni dyadi, ndangu kwena bana yisya moku, batambula Kitembu Kyatoma.» <verse eid="ACT 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20"/>Kaasi Phetelu wumuzimbwadi: «Mbongu zaku zazangana kumosi yi ngeyi meni, kikuma wubanzi ni wufwani kusumba kabu dya Nzambi yi mbongu! <verse eid="ACT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21"/>Weku keti homa, keti muswa mu dyambu dyadi dyenina haha, mukuma mbundu yaku yeku yasungama ku thwala ya Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22"/>Talulula hika dibanza dyaku dya mbi amana lombila Pfumu ndangu, yukani kazola, kalolula sunga dyaku dina dya mbi dyenina ku mbundu yaku. <verse eid="ACT 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23"/>Mukuma meni mboni ni ngeyi wenina wabasa yi mbundu ya kiphala amana wenina muhika wa masumu.» <verse eid="ACT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24"/>Hanga Simoni wuzimbudi kwena Phetelu yi Yowani: «Bokwadilenu Pfumu kikuma kya meni, ndangu, muna mana luzimbudini, dimbwilaku keti dyambu dimosi.» <verse eid="ACT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25"/>Ku manima ma kuta kimbangi yi kulonga ndinga ya Pfumu, bávutuka ku Yelusalemi, mu kusamuna Musamu wa Bukheti muna mahata ma lawu ma Samadiya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fidiphu yi mwisi Etsyophi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26"/>Wanzyo mosi wa Pfumu wázimbula kwena Fidiphu: «Telama amana wenda ku banda, muna nzila yina yakulumuka tuka ku Yelusalemi yi kuna Ngaza.» Nzila meni yina bisiyoku lutila lawu. <verse eid="ACT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27"/>Buna káyuka bwabuna, Phidiphu wátelama amana wenda. Muna nzila, wátundakana mutu mosi, mwisi Etsyophi, mutu meni wuna, yandi wákala pfumu wa mbuta, wisi sweka phi mbongu yi bima byosu bya Kandasi pfumu wa mukhetu wa Etsyophi; hana khaku kedi batundakana yi Fidiphu, kátekila kwisa ku Yelusalemi kikuma kya kufukamina Nzambi, <verse eid="ACT 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28"/>amana kakala vutuka ku nzu yandi, wazakala hana thandu ya mutukumbila wa phunda, yikutangaka mukanda wa mbikudi Yesaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29"/>Kitembu Kyatoma wázimbudi kwena Fidiphu: «Bwesuka amana wátundakana yi mutukumbila wa phunda wuna.» <verse eid="ACT 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30"/>Fidiphu wenda thinu amana wámuyuka mwisi Etsyophi buna kakala tanga mukanda wa mbikudi Yesaya. Yandi wumuzimbwadi: «Wubati bakisa mana wubati tanga?» <verse eid="ACT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31"/>Yandi wuvutudi: «Abweti yilenda bakisa, yuka ni heku mutu wathendwadilawa?» Kahanga wumubokwadidi Fidiphu ni kazanza ndangu kazakala kumosi yi yandi. <verse eid="ACT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32"/>Nzila ya Masonuku kakala tanga, yákala yayi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">«Bakala munata hanga mukoku banati homa hana bisi bakila mbisi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">hanga mwana wa mukoku kisiku meka ku thwala ya wuna wisi mukulula mwika.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">Kayakudiku keti ndinga.<verse eid="ACT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33"/>Muna kulewuka kwandi, bábwisa kumunungisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Nati wálenda mu zonzila kilumbu butuka dyandi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Kikuma luzingu lwandi bákatulalwa ha tsi.»<verse eid="ACT 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34"/>Mwisi Etsyophi wáhyula kwena Fidiphu: «Yikubokwadidi, nzimbwala bawu: kikuma kya nati kabati zonzila mbikudi bwabuna? Kikuma kya yandi meni ho kikuma kya mutu wahika?» <verse eid="ACT 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35"/>Fidiphu wátambula ndinga amana, muna nzila meni yayina ya Masonuku, wáyandika mu kumusamwana Musamu wa Bukheti wa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36"/>Kinzila-kinzila, bátula homa hamosi hakala yi mamba, mutu wuna wázimbula kwena Fidiphu: «Tala mama mamba; biki bikhwati mu kubotama?» [<verse eid="ACT 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37"/>Fidiphu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndambu ya mikanda mina mya theti yáyika nzila yayi ya 37.» </char></note> wumuzimbwadini: «Yukani wakwikila yi mbundu yaku yosu, wufwani mu kubotama.» Yandi wuvutudini: «Khwikidini ni Yesu Kidisitu, Mwana wa Nzambi.»] <verse eid="ACT 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38"/>Wásenda mu kutelamisa mutukumbila wa phunda, bákulumuka bawu bodi muna mamba, Fidiphu yi mwisi Etsyophi, amana wámubotika. <verse eid="ACT 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39"/>Ha bálubuka mu mamba, Kitembu kya Pfumu kyámutombula Fidiphu. Mwisi Etsyophi wuna kamumonaku hika, kahanga wusimbi nzila wenda yi kyesi kyosu. <verse eid="ACT 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40"/>Fidiphu, yandi, wisa monikina mu mbanza ya Azoti, kakala samuna Musamu wa Bukheti muna mbanza zoosu muna kakala luta, yi kuna katudila ku Sezale.<verse eid="ACT 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Sawulu wubalumuni mbundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Mhb 22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, Sawulu kakalaku lembwa mu kuheyisa balonguki ba Pfumu. Wenda kwena mbuta wa banganga Nzambi, <verse eid="ACT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2"/>amana wámulomba mikanda kikuma kya nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta muna mbanza ya Tamasi, kinga kawanakwa ndambu ya batu, bayakala holoni bakhetu, bana bakala landa nzila ya Pfumu, kamana bakwata amana kabanata ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3"/>Buna kakala muna nzila ya Tamasi, hana wekatula bela-bela yi mbanza meni yina, muna kithulumukina, mutsyenzya wumosi wátuka ku zilu, wákenzula hosu hana kákala yandi. <verse eid="ACT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4"/>Wábwa ha tsi amana wáyuka ndinga yimosi yakala muzimbwala: «Sawulu, Sawulu, biki wubati ngyangisila?» <verse eid="ACT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5"/>Yandi wávutula: «Nati wenina, Pfumu?» Yandi wuvutudi: «Meni, yenina Yesu wuna wubati yangisa. <verse eid="ACT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6"/>Kaasi telama, kota muna mbanza amana bakúzimbwala buna wufwani mu kuhanga.» <verse eid="ACT 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7"/>Batu bana kakala kangala bawu, bátelama konda kuyakula; bakala yuka ndinga kaasi bakalaku mona mutu. <verse eid="ACT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8"/>Sawulu wávumbuka mu mafu, mbatanana kákala ku mesu watemuna, kakalaku mona keti kima. Hanga bamusimbi kuna koku, bámunata ku mbanza Tamasi. <verse eid="ACT 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9"/>Kánanga bilumbu bitatu konda kumona, konda kudya keti kunwa kima.<verse eid="ACT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10"/>Kinga kuna Tamasi kwákala yi mulonguki mosi khumbu yandi Ananiya. Pfumu kámulubwakila muna mbona mesu amana kámuzimbwala: «Ananiya!» Yandi wávutula: «Awu meni, Pfumu.» <verse eid="ACT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11"/>Pfumu wumuzimbwadi: «Ndawenda muna mukhidi wuna bisi tela ni Wasingama, amana sanda muna nzu ya Yutasi, mutu mosi, khumbu yandi Sawulu mwisi Talasi. Mukuma mu kulombila kenina <verse eid="ACT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12"/>amana kámoniki muna mbona mesu, mutu mosi khumbu yandi Ananiya wákota amana wámuthetika moku ndangu kamona hika.» <verse eid="ACT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13"/>Ananiya wávutula: «A Pfumu, batu balawu yíyuka kuzonzila mutu wuna, bánzimbwala mbi yosu yina káhanga kwena batu ba Nzambi baku kuna Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14"/>Amana kisini kwaku yi muswa wa bambuta ba banganga Nzambi mu kukwata batu boosu bana batéla khumbu yaku.» <verse eid="ACT 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15"/>Kaasi Pfumu wumuzimbwadi: «Awenda, mukuma, mutu wuna, yimusodi hanga kilekwa mu kunata khumbu yama kwena makanda, kwena bakyamvu yi kwena bisi Kiseledi. <verse eid="ACT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16"/>Yimúsongila meni-meni moosu mana kafwani kunyokwakina mu khumbu yama.» <verse eid="ACT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17"/>Hanga Ananiya wendi, wákota muna nzu, wámusya moku amana wázimbula: «Phangi wama Sawulu, Pfumu Yesu, wuna wukulubwakidiki mu nzila yina wukakwisilaka, káthumini ndangu wamona hika, amana wabasa yi Kitembu Kyatoma.» <verse eid="ACT 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18"/>Muna mbala mosi, mwábwa, muna mesu mandi, bima hanga bibalaka, amana wáyandulula mu kumona. Wátelama, wátambula phi mbotika. <verse eid="ACT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19"/>Amana ku manima ma kubotama, wádya, wávutwakila phi ngolu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 9:19">Malongi ma Sawulu ku Tamasi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Sawulu wánanga hika ndambu ya bilumbu kumosi yi balonguki bana bakala ku Tamasi. <verse eid="ACT 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20"/>Amana muna mbala mosi wándika mu kusamuna muna nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta ni Yesu kenina Mwana wa Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21"/>Boosu bana bakala muyuka, báyituka, bakala zimbula: «Ka yandi ku wuna wakala nyokuna batu, ku Yelusalemi, bana bakala tela khumbu yina? Amana, kisiku haka kikuma kya kubakwata amana kabanata ku thwala ya bambuta ba banganga Nzambi?» <verse eid="ACT 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22"/>Kaasi Sawulu, yandi, hamu dyámulutakana kuluta Bayuta bana bakala zingila ku Tamasi kikuma bamonaku kima kya kumuvutwala, kakala basongila yi ngolu ni Yesu kenina Kidisitu.<verse eid="ACT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23"/>Kunima ya ndambu ya bilumbu, Bayuta báyukana mu kumuhondisa, <verse eid="ACT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24"/>hanga Sawulu yandi bamulukisi mu kifwandu kya bawu. Phipha, mwini, bawu bakala kengila mwelu myosu mina bakala kotila yi kulubwakila ku mbanza ndangu balenga muhondisila Sawulu. <verse eid="ACT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25"/>Kaasi, muna phipha, balonguki bandi bámusya mu kitunga amana bámukulumuna yi kuna phenza ya kibaka kya luphangu.<verse eid="ACT 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sawulu ku Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26"/>Buna kátula ku Yelusalemi, Sawulu kameka kukota mu ndonga ya balonguki, kaasi boosu bweya bakala bwawu kikuma kya yandi, kikuma bákwikilaku ni yandi phi mu kyedika mulonguki kakala. <verse eid="ACT 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27"/>Hanga Balanabasi wumubongi, wámunata kwena bathumwa amana wábatendwala buna kámona, Sawulu, Pfumu muna nzila yi mana kámuzimbwala Pfumu. Wubatendwadi hika phila yina kalongila yi tsikiningi yosu malongi mu khumbu ya Yesu, ku Tamasi. <verse eid="ACT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28"/>Tukidila tangwa meni dina, Sawulu kakala kwenda yi kuvutuka ku Yelusalemi kumosi yi bawu mu kulonga yi tsikiningi khumbu ya Pfumu. <verse eid="ACT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29"/>Kakala solula phi yi bayuta bana bakala zonza ndinga ya ngeleti, kufindaka phaka yi bawu; kaasi bawu bakala sanda ni bamuhondisa. <verse eid="ACT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30"/>Baphangi buna báyuka bwabuna, bámusindikila yi kuna Sezale amana bámuhitika ku Talasi.<verse eid="ACT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31"/>Dibundu mu ngemba dyákala mu Yuteya dyosu, mu Ngadidi yi mu Samadiya; dyakala tungama yi kuzingila mu bweya bwa Pfumu amana dyakala vula mu lusadisu lwa Kitembu Kyatoma.<verse eid="ACT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubeluka kwa Eneyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32"/>Phetelu yandi kakala kangala mu binzunga byosu. Kilumbu kimosi, wákulumuka phi kwena bakwikidi bana bakala ku mbanza ya Dita. <verse eid="ACT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33"/>Káwana kwakuna mutu mosi, khumbu yandi Eneyi, wakala walandalala hana thangi tukidila mvula nana mukuma kikata kákala. <verse eid="ACT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34"/>Phetelu wumuzimbwadi: «Eneyi, Yesu Kidisitu wukubeludi! Telama amana yidika ngeyi-meni thangi yaku.» Muna mbala mosi, wátelama. <verse eid="ACT 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35"/>Boosu bana bákala ku Dita yi Salo bámona amana bábalumuna mbundu za bawu kwena Pfumu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tabita wuvutuki mu luzingu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36"/>Mulonguki wa mukhetu mosi wakala ku Zophe, khumbu yandi Tabita, disongidila: «Tolukasi,» disongidila: «tsetsi». Kakala sala mihangu mya mboti lawu yi lusadisu kwena baphutu. <verse eid="ACT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37"/>Muna bilumbu meni bina, kahanga wubedi amana wufini. Ku nima kusukula lutu lwandi, basikulalwa kuna mwanza wa ku zilu dya nzu. <verse eid="ACT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38"/>Balonguki ba ku Zophe, bwosu báyuka ni Phetelu ku Dita kenina, dyenina bela-bela yi Zophe, hanga batumini batu bodi benda mubokwadila bwabu: «Wuzingidilaku mu kukwenda kwena betu.» <verse eid="ACT 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39"/>Phetelu wátelama amana wenda yi bawu. Buna kátula, bámuzanzisa yi kuna mwanza wa ku zilu. Bafwidi boosu bábwesuka kwena yandi mu kudila; bakala musongila miledi yi mizaka mina kakala tunga Tolukasi tangwa kákala kumosi yi bawu. <verse eid="ACT 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40"/>Phetelu wálubula batu boosu, kunima wafukama amana wálombila. Ku nima wabaluka kuna kwakala lutu amana wuzonzi: «Tabita telama!» Hanga mukhetu wutemuni mesu, amana buna kamona Phetelu, wasikuka. <verse eid="ACT 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41"/>Yandi wámulambwala koku amana wámutelamisa. Ku manima wátela bakwikidi yi bafwidi, wábasongila yandi, Tabita, yi moya. <verse eid="ACT 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42"/>Tsangu záyalangana mu Zophe dyosu, batu lawu phi bákwikila mwena Pfumu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43"/>Wánangakwa hika kuna Zophe ndambu ya bilumbu, kwena mutu mosi, Simoni muyidiki wa mikanda mya bambisi.<verse eid="ACT 9:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Nzambi wuzonzi kwena Kodineyi yi Phetelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1"/>Kwákala kuna mbanza ya Sezale, yi mutu mosi khumbu yandi Kodineyi, satudiyoni<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Satudiyoni disongidila ni pfumu wuna wakala twadisa baphumbulu khama ba Loma</char></note>, muna kibuka kina bakala tela: «baphumbulu ba Kitadi.» <verse eid="ACT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2"/>Mutu meni wuna kákala mutu wakwikama. Yandi yi nzu yandi yosu kakala zitisa Nzambi. Kakala hana makabu ma kihomba lawu kikuma kya batu yi kulombilaka Nzambi kosu tangwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3"/>Kilumbu kimosi, muna tangwa dya tatu dya masikidika, hanga mu mbona mesu, kámona wengele. Wanzyo mosi wa Nzambi wákota muna nzu yandi amana wumuzimbwadi: «Kodineyi!» <verse eid="ACT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4"/>Yandi wumutadi swii yi kadingu-dingu kamukwati amana wumuzimbwadi: «Biki, Pfumu?» Wanzyo wumuvutwadi: «Nzambi wutambudi bisambu byaku yi makabu maku ma kihomba kwena baphutu amana kakuzimbakaniku. <verse eid="ACT 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5"/>Buthwena bwabu, tuma bayakala kuna Zophe amana mutedisa mutu mosi, Simoni, bisi tela: Phetelu. <verse eid="ACT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6"/>Yandi kuna nzu ya Simoni mukwawu, muyidiki wa mikanda mya bambisi, kisi nimba, nzu yandi yenina ku kabeta ka yanga.» <verse eid="ACT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7"/>Buna kenda wanzyo wuna wámuzonzisa, Kodineyi wátuma basadi bandi bodi yi phumbulu mosi wuna wakakala zitisa Nzambi hana kati dya baphumbulu bana bakala bela-bela yi yandi. <verse eid="ACT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8"/>Buna kábamenika moosu, wábatuma ku Zophe.<verse eid="ACT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9"/>Kilumbu kyalanda, bwosu bákala muna nzila amana bátula bela-bela yi mbanza, Phetelu wázanza hana mudilu wa nzu, mu kati kya mwini, kikuma kya kulombila. <verse eid="ACT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10"/>Wáyuka nzala amana wásanda kadya. Buna bakala mulambila bima, wámona mbona mesu. <verse eid="ACT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11"/>Kámona zilu dyakanguka amana kima kimosi hanga kitemba kyambuta kya muledi, kyakala tuluka, bázitikila mu tsongi ya, amana kyáthetama yi hana tsi. <verse eid="ACT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12"/>Amana mwamuna, mwákala yi bambisi ba malu maya boosu, yi bina bisi landanda mu mafu yi banuni ba ku zilu. <verse eid="ACT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13"/>Ndinga mosi yimuzimbwadi: «Telama, Phetelu, honda amana wadya!» <verse eid="ACT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14"/>Amana Phetelu wuzimbudi: «Loni, Pfumu, khaku kedi ndya kima kya khengu, keti kya mukuku.» <verse eid="ACT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15"/>Ndinga yáyukalakana hika mu mbala ya zodi: «Kina kasemisi Nzambi, ngeyi wumonakyoku mvindu.» <verse eid="ACT 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16"/>Bwabuna bwásalama mbala tatu, kunima kitemba kyátombuka ku zilu.<verse eid="ACT 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17"/>Phetelu, mabanza mámuvwalangana, wáyandika mu kudihyula keti biki disongidila dya mbona mesu yina kámona. Kutala, batu bana bátuma kwena Kodineyi, bakala hyula nzu ya Simoni, bátula muna mwelu. <verse eid="ACT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18"/>Hanga bátela amana báhyula: «Kwaku kisi nimba, Simoni wuna bisi tela Phetelu» <verse eid="ACT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19"/>Phetelu buna kakala banza hika mbona mesu yina, Kitembu Kyatoma wámuzimbwala: «Tala batu batatu babati kusanda. <verse eid="ACT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20"/>Telama, tuluka amana awenda yi bawu konda keti-keti, mukuma meni yibatumi.» <verse eid="ACT 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21"/>Phetelu wátuluka amana wábazimbwala batu bana: «Meni yandu lubati sanda. Biki lwisidi haka?» <verse eid="ACT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22"/>Bávutula: «Satudiyo Kodineyi, wututumi. Mutu walungila, kisi zitisa Nzambi. Amana kanda dyosu dya Bayuta dyisi mutambwasa. Wanzyo mosi watoma kámuzimbwadiki ni kakutedisa kuna nzu yandi ndangu kayuka buna wenina bwawu mu kumuzimbwala.» <verse eid="ACT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23"/>Phetelu wábakotisa amana wábayamba phipha meni yana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Kilumbu kyalanda, wásimba nzila amana wenda hakimosi yi bawu. Baphangi bahika ba ku Zophe benda basindikila. <verse eid="ACT 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24"/>Kilumbu kyalanda, Phetelu wátula ku Sezale. Kodineyi kakala bahingila amana wátedisa kuna nzu yandi biwutu byandi yi banduku bandi. <verse eid="ACT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25"/>Buna kátula Phetelu, Kodineyi wenda mukhikila, wábwa muna malu mandi amana wámufukamina. <verse eid="ACT 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26"/>Kaasi Phetelu kámutelamisa, mu kuzimbula: «Telama, mukuma meni phi mutu yenina hanga ngeyi.» <verse eid="ACT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27"/>Kuna yi kuyambilaka yi yandi, wákota amana káwana lawu dya batu bana bisa khokana. <verse eid="ACT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28"/>Kábazimbwala: «Luzayi ni mitsiku myetu myisiku tambwasa ni Muyuta mosi kadikasa yi munzenza kondilo kukota mu nzu yandi. Kaasi Nzambi kátsongidiki ni pfwaniku yimona mutu hanga wuna wakonda lunga kondilo wakuhunga. <verse eid="ACT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29"/>Yihana ni tangwa lutumiki mutu mu kuthela, yisiki konda tendu. Nzodi yizaya keti kikuma kya biki luthedisidiki.» <verse eid="ACT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30"/>Kodineyi wuzimbudi: «Bilumbu bitatu kedi bilutini tukidila buna yikala lombila kuna nzu yama, muna tangwa dya tatu dya masikidika, muna mbala mosi, kutala mutu mosi yi miledi mya katoki myakala kedyamina, wuthelamini kuna thwala, <verse eid="ACT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31"/>amana wunzimbwadini: "Kodineyi, Nzambi wutambudi lombilu lwaku yi makabu maku ma kihomba kwena baphutu. <verse eid="ACT 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32"/>Tuma mutu kuna Zophe mu kutedisa Simoni wuna bisi tela Phetelu. Yandi kisi nimba muna nzu ya Simoni, muyidiki wa mikanda mya bambisi, kuna kabeta ka yanga dya mbuta." <verse eid="ACT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33"/>Muna mbala mosi, yikutumini bayakala bamosi, amana wutambwasi mu kukwisa. Buthwena bwabu, ku thwala ya Nzambi thwenina betu boosu, kikuma kya kuyuka moosu mamana kakulongikidi Pfumu mu kutuzimbwala.»<verse eid="ACT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Malongi ma Phetelu kwena Kodineyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34"/>Phetelu wátambula ndinga amana wuzimbudi: «Mu kyedika, mbakudi ni Nzambi kisiku yekula. <verse eid="ACT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35"/>Kaasi muna kanda dyosu, wuna wisi muzitisa yi kusadila masonga, kisi mutambwasa. <verse eid="ACT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36"/>Káhitika ndinga kwena bisi Kiseledi, mu kubasamwana Musamu wa Bukheti wa ngemba mu nzila ya Yesu Kidisitu, yandi wenina Pfumu wa boosu. <verse eid="ACT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37"/>Benu, luzayi mana mábwa mu Yuteya dyosu, tukidila ku luyandiku muna Ngadidi, kunima mbotika yina kásamuna Yowani. <verse eid="ACT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38"/>Luzayi buna káfwebula Nzambi ngolu za Kitembu Kyatoma kwena Yesu mwisi Nazaleti. Mwosu muna kakala hita, kakala hanga makheti yi kubuka boosu bana bákala mu kihika kya kiphidi-mutu, mukuma Nzambi kákala kumosi yi yandi. <verse eid="ACT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39"/>Amana betu, thwenina bambangi ba mambu moosu mana káhanga mu tsi ya Bayuta yi kuna Yelusalemi. Wuna báhonda mu kumukhoka hana kitakani. <verse eid="ACT 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40"/>Kaasi, Nzambi wámufutumuna mu kilumbu kya tatu; yandi wámulubula ndangu bamumona, <verse eid="ACT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41"/>heku ni kwena kanda dyosu, kaasi kwena bambangi bana katekila sola Nzambi yi kwena betu bana twádya amana twánwa kumosi yi yandi ku manima ma kufutumuka kwandi ha kati dya bafwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42"/>Amana wátutuma mu kusamuna kwena kanda yi kuta kimbangi ni yandi wuna katekila sola Nzambi zusi dya batu bana bisi zinga yi bana bafwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43"/>Bambikudi boosu bisi ta kimbangi ni wosu wuna wukwikidi mwena yandi, muna khumbu yandi, wutambudi ndoluka ya masumu.»<verse eid="ACT 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Baphani batambudini Kitembu Kyatoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44"/>Buna kakala zonza Phetelu bwabuna, Kitembu Kyatoma kyábakulumukina batu boosu bana bakala hinikina Ndinga yandi. <verse eid="ACT 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45"/>Bakwikidi boosu ba bayuta bana bísa kumosi yi Phetelu, báyituka lawu mu kumona kabu dya Kitembu Kyatoma kukulumuka kwena baphani. <verse eid="ACT 10:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46"/>Mukuma bakala bayuka batu bana mu kuzonza mu ndinga zina bakondi zaya, yi kuzatulaka kineni kya Nzambi. Hanga Phetelu wuzonzi: <verse eid="ACT 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47"/>«Tufwani mu kukandikisa mbotika kwena batu bana, bawu batu batambudi Kitembu Kyatoma hanga betu?» <verse eid="ACT 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48"/>Wásenda ni babotika mu khumbu ya Yesu Kidisitu. Hanga bamulombi ni kananga hika ndambu ya bilumbu kwakuna.<verse eid="ACT 10:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Meni dya Phetelu ku Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1"/>Bathumwa yi baphangi bana bakala mu Yuteya báyuka ni baphani, bawu phi bátambudiki ndinga ya Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2"/>Buna kátombuka Phetelu ku Yelusalemi, bakwikidi ba bayuta báyandika mu kumuyumanisa: <verse eid="ACT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3"/>mu kuzimbula: «Wúkotiki mu nzu ya batu bana bakonda yotisa amana wúdiki homa hamosi yi bawu!» <verse eid="ACT 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4"/>Hanga Phetelu wuyandiki mu kubatendwadila yi tsikiningi mana máluta. Wubazimbwadi: <verse eid="ACT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5"/>«Meni, ku mbanza ya Zophe yikadi mu kulombila, tangwa mbonikini mbona mesu: kima kimosi kyakala kulumuka, hanga kitemba kyambuta kya muledi, kyakuzitikila muna tsongi ya, kyakala kulumuka tukidila ku zilu amana kyisi yi hana yíkala meni. <verse eid="ACT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6"/>Mu kusimbululakya, mboni ni hákala yi bambisi ba malu maya ba ha tsi yi bambisi ba mu musitu yi bana bisi landanda yi banuni ba ku zilu. <verse eid="ACT 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7"/>Kunima ngyuki ndinga mosi yánzimbwala: "Telama, Phetelu, honda amana dya!" <verse eid="ACT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8"/>Hanga mvutudi: "Yilendaku, Pfumu, khaku kedi mukota kima kyasumuka, keti kya tsiku muna munwa wama." <verse eid="ACT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9"/>Mu mbala yazodi, ndinga yátuka tukidila ku zilu yinzimbwadi: "Kina kasemisi Nzambi, ngeyi wumonakyoku mvindu." <verse eid="ACT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10"/>Bwabuna bwásalama mbala tatu, ku manima byosu byávutuka ku zilu. <verse eid="ACT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, bayakala bamosi batatu bana báthumina ku Sezale, bátula hana thwala ya nzu yina twákala. <verse eid="ACT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12"/>Kitembu kinzimbwadi ni yenda yi bawu konda keti-keti. Baphangi basambanu baba lubati mona benda tsindikila, amana twákota muna nzu ya mutu meni wuna. <verse eid="ACT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13"/>Yandu-yandu wátumenika buna kámonika wanzyo muna nzu yandi, mu kuzimbula: "Tuma mutu kuna Zophe, kenda mutela Simoni wuna bisi tela Phetelu, <verse eid="ACT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14"/>Yandi wakúzimbwala ndinga mwena zina wahúlwakila, ngeyi yi nzu yaku yosu." <verse eid="ACT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15"/>Buna yíyandika mu kuzonza, Kitembu Kyatoma kikulumukini, kwena bawu bwosu kyakulumuka kwena betu ku luyandiku. <verse eid="ACT 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16"/>Hanga ngyubuki ndinga yina kázonza Pfumu: "Yowani kábotika yi mamba, kaasi benu, lwatámbula mbotika ya Kitembu Kyatoma." <verse eid="ACT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17"/>Amana yuka ni Nzambi kabahangila kabu dimosi yi betu kikuma kya buna twákwikila mwena Pfumu Yesu Kidisitu. Nati yenina meni mu kukakidila Nzambi?» <verse eid="ACT 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18"/>Kunima kuyuka bwabuna, bádibata amana bámuzatula Nzambi, mu kuzimbula: «Nzambi wáhana phi kwena Baphani tsobuka ya bikalulu yina yisi nata ku luzingu lwa mukwandi.»<verse eid="ACT 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dibundu dya ku Atyoki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19"/>Bana bámwangalakana kikuma kiwayi kina kyákala kunima lufwa lwa Kitsyeni, báhitila ku Fenisi, ku Siphe yi ku Atyoki, kaasi bakalaku longa batu bahika, kwena Bayuta lwesi. <verse eid="ACT 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20"/>Kinga, hana kati dya bawu, hákala yi bakwikidi bahika bisi Siphe yi bisi Sileni, bisa ku Atyoki amana bakala zonzila kwena baphani ba ndinga ya ngeleti yi kusamuna Musamu wa Bukheti wa Pfumu Yesu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bakwikidi bahika ba bayuta bana bakonda butukila ku Kiseledi báyandika mu kuzonzila Yesu kwena baphani. Sileni yákala mbanza ya mbuta ya kinzunga kya Sileni, kuna londi dya Afwika. Baphani lawu bákala muna tsi meni yina bakala tuka bakwikidi ba bayuta. </char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21"/>Koku dya Pfumu dyákala kumosi yi bawu, amana batu balawu bákwikila, bábalula phi mbundu za bawu kwena Pfumu. <verse eid="ACT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22"/>Musamu wátula kwena Dibundu dya Yelusalemi. Amana bátuma Balanabasi ndangu katula yi kuna Atyosi. <verse eid="ACT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23"/>Mu kutula kwandi, buna kámona mamboti ma Nzambi, wásangwala lawu, wábaheka kikesa boosu ndangu bakangama kwena Nzambi yi mbundu yimosi. <verse eid="ACT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24"/>Mukuma kákala mutu wa bukheti, wabasa yi Kitembu Kyatoma yi lukwikilu. Hanga mulumba-lumba wa batu balawu bákhundakana kwena Pfumu.<verse eid="ACT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25"/>Kunima, wénda sanda Sawulu ku Tadisi. <verse eid="ACT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26"/>Kunima dya kumusengumuna, wámunata ku Atyosi. Banangi kwakuna mvula muthu, mu kuwaphama mu lukutakanu lwa Dibundu amana bakala longa mulumba-lumba wa batu balawu. Balonguki, ku Atyosi bábongilaya khumbu ya bakidisitu, mu mbala ya theti. <verse eid="ACT 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27"/>Muna bilumbu meni bina, bambikudi bamosi bákulumuka tukidila ku Yelusalemi yi kuna Atyosi. <verse eid="ACT 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28"/>Mosi hana kati dya bawu, khumbu yandi Hakabusi, kátelama amana wásamuna mu ngolu za Kitembu Kyatoma ni nzala ya lawu yakóta mu tsi yosu ya bisi Loma. Nzala yákota, muna tangwa dina kákala Koloti pfumu wa mbuta wa mbanza. <verse eid="ACT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29"/>Hanga balonguki babongi dibanza dya kuhitika lusadisu, kosu mutu muna kitesu kya kuvwa kwandi, kwena baphangi bana bakala zingila ku Yuteya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30"/>Bwabuna bahanga amana báhitikalwa kwena bambuta ba dibundu mu nzila ya Balanabasi yi Sawulu.<verse eid="ACT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Lufwa lwa Zyaki yi boloku dya Phetelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, kyamvu Eloti<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyamvu Eloti kenina Eloti Angidipha watheti, wuna wákala mutekulu wa Eloti wuna bázonzila mu mukanda wa Luka 1:5. Pfumu wa mbanza Kodiwusi wámutombula "kyamvu" amana wámuheka muswa wa kuyala mu ndambu yambuta ya Kiseledi. </char></note> wáyandika kuyangisa ndambu ya baphangi ba Dibundu. <verse eid="ACT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2"/>Kamuhondisa Zyaki phangi wa Yowani ku mbedi ya phoku. <verse eid="ACT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3"/>Mu kumona ni mambu mana mábasephidisa Bayuta, wábonga dibanza dya kumukwatisa phi Phetelu. Máluta mu tangwa dya mukinzi wa mapha makonda muvimbu. <verse eid="ACT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4"/>Kunima dya kumukwata yi kumukotisa mu boloku, wámulambula mu moku ma bibuka biya bya baphumbulu ndangu bamukengilaka. Yandi yi mabanza ma kumusambisa ha mesu ma batu ku manima ma mukinzi wa Phaki. <verse eid="ACT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5"/>Amana Phetelu kákala wakukwata muna boloku kaasi dibundu dyakala lombila Nzambi, kikuma kya yandi konda kulembwa.<verse eid="ACT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukutumuka kwa Phetelu mu boloku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6"/>Muna phipha, kinga Eloti kákala yi sunga dya kamusambisa mu mwini, ku mesu ma batu, Phetelu wakukasa mu miyololu myodi, wanimba hana kati dya baphumbulu bodi. Ku mwelu batsinzidi bamosi bakala tanikina boloku. <verse eid="ACT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7"/>Muna mbala mosi, wanzyo wa Pfumu wísa, mitsyenzya mikenzudi suku. Wanzyo mosi wámutokamisa Phetelu mu kumutekula muna luhati ndangu kamutokamisa, amana wumuzimbwadi: «Telama tswatsu!» Miyololu myáwongumuka mu moku mandi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8"/>Wanzyo wámuzimbwala: «Vwata mukaba waku amana zitika tsabatu zaku.» Phetelu wusadi bwabuna, ku manima Wanzyo wumuzimbwadi: «Vwata muzaka waku amana ndanda.» <verse eid="ACT 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9"/>Phetelu wálubuka mu kumulanda. Kakalaku zaya ni lusadisu lwa wanzyo lwa kyedika lwakala; kábanza ni mbona mesu. <verse eid="ACT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10"/>Buna báluta mukanzu watheti yi wazodi, bátula ku mwelu wa bisengu wuna walubwakila ku mbanza. Wádikangwakila wawu-meni kuna thwala ya bawu, bálubuka amana bakala phusana muna balabala dimosi, kutala, wanzyo wutoti.<verse eid="ACT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11"/>Buna kadibakisa, Phetelu wuzimbudi: «Buthwena, nzayi ni mu kyedika Pfumu wutumiki wanzyo wandi amana wundubudi ku moku ma Eloti yi mu moosu mana bakanzodilaka bayuta.»<verse eid="ACT 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12"/>Tangwa kábakula, wénda ku nzu ya Madiya ngudi wa Yowani wuna bakala tela ni Malaku. Kwakuna bákutakanina ndambu ya lawu ya batu yi kulombilaka. <verse eid="ACT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13"/>Tangwa kákhokwatila ku mwelu wa luphangu, musadi wa mukhetu mosi khumbu yandi Lodi wábwesuka mu kuhinikina. <verse eid="ACT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14"/>Buna kábakula ndinga ya Phetelu, sangu-sangu, konda kuyafulula, wátakula thinu mu kusamuna ni Phetelu mu mwelu wa luphangu kenina. <verse eid="ACT 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15"/>Bamuzimbwadini: «Ngeyi wu kilawu!» Kaasi yandi kakala sidingisa ni bwa kyedika. Bawu bakala zimbula: «Wuna wanzyo wandi.»<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndambu ya Bayuta bana bákala muna tangwa meni dina bakala zayila ni Nzambi wáhana wanzyo mosi kwena kanda dyandi kikuma kya kutaninadya, amana wanzyo káfwana kamonikaka mu kimutu, kafwananaka yi wuna wumuvwini. Bakwikidi bana bábanza ngatu ni wanzyo wa Phetelu kisa bazimbwala ni Phetelu wufwi kedi. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16"/>Kuna phi Phetelu yi kukhokwatilaka. Báyafulula amana báyituka lawu mu kumumona. <verse eid="ACT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17"/>Phetelu wásongila kidimbu kuna koku dyandi ni badibata, wábamenika buna kámulubula Pfumu mu boloku amana wuzimbudi: «Menikenubwa kwena Zyaki<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zyaki yandu kenina phangi wa yakala wa Pfumu.</char></note> yi kwena baphangi.» Kunima wálubuka, amana wénda kuma kwahika. <verse eid="ACT 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18"/>Tangwa kwakhyela kuma, baphumbulu tsula yabakwata: bekadihyula keti biki byámubwila Phetelu. <verse eid="ACT 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19"/>Eloti wátuma ni bamusanda, kaasi kámumonaku. Kábafungwasisa batsinzidi, amana wáhana nzila ni babazunduna mutwa. Kunima, wákulumuka ku Yuteya ndangu kenda ku Sezale kuna kánangina ndambu ya bilumbu.<verse eid="ACT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufwa lwa Eloti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20"/>Eloti mu kimbeni kákala yi bisi Tidi yi bisi Sitoni. Kaasi bawu báyukana mu kwenda mutala amana bisa. Bátundakana yi Balasitusi tsinzidi wa mwanza wa kyamvu, ndangu kabasadisa amana bálomba ngemba mukuma madya ma bawu makala tuka ku tsi yina ya kyamvu. <verse eid="ACT 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21"/>Báyukana, kilumbu kimosi amana Eloti wávwata mukonzu wandi, wázakala hana kiti kya luyalu, wáyandika mu kuzonza ku thwala ya batu boosu, <verse eid="ACT 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22"/>batu bakala mutsikisa mu kukalunga: «Yeku ndinga ya mutu kaasi yina ya nzambi mosi!» <verse eid="ACT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23"/>Kaasi muna tangwa medina, wanzyo mosi wa Pfumu wámubeta, kikuma kahanaku lukumu kwena Nzambi, hanga bamudi kwena mimvidya amana wáfwa.<verse eid="ACT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24"/>Kaasi ndinga ya Nzambi yámwangana amana yáyalangana. <verse eid="ACT 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25"/>Balanabasi yi Sawulu, kunima kulungisa kisalu kya bawu ku Yelusalemi, bávutuka, bámunata Yowani wuna bakala tela ni Malaku.<verse eid="ACT 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Balanabasi yi Sawulu babatumi mu kitambu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1"/>Muna Dibundu dina dyákala ku Atyosi, mwákala yi bambikudi yi balongi bwosu: Balanabasi, Simeyoni wuna bakala tela Kaphindi, Lukyusi mwisi Sileni, Manayena wuna wakola kumosi yi Eloti<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yandu-yandu kákala Eloti Atiphasi wuna wásenda kwena phumbulu mosi mu kumuhonda Yowani Mubotiki (Luk 9:7-9)</char></note> wuna wakala yala ku Ngadidi yi Sawulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2"/>Muna tangwa dina bakala zatula Pfumu yi kuzila madya, Kitembu Kyatoma wuzimbudini: «Ngyekwalenu Balanabasi yi Sawulu kikuma kya kisalu kina yíbatedila.» <verse eid="ACT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3"/>Hanga ku manima ma kuzila madya yi kulombila, babasya moku amana bábasula ni benda.<verse eid="ACT 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Balanabasi yi Sawulu ku Siphe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4"/>Disongidila, bawu bátuma kwena Kitembu Kyatoma, bákulumuka ku Selesi; amana kwakuna, bákota mu masuwa ndangu benda ku zawala dya Siphele. <verse eid="ACT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5"/>Buna bátula ku Salamini, básamuna ndinga ya Nzambi muna nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta. Bákala yi Yowani-Malaku wuna wákala waphamu dya bawu. <verse eid="ACT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6"/>Kunima dya kulabuka zawala dyosu yi kuna Phafwosi, báwana nganga-ngombu mosi, Muyuta mosi khumbu yandi Badi-Yesu wakala dimonikisa hanga mbikudi. <verse eid="ACT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7"/>Kakala zingila mu mukombu wa pfumu wa zawala Seluyusi Phawulusi, mutu mosi wa mayedi. Yandi wátedisa Balanabasi yi Sawulu, mu kusanda kayuka Ndinga ya Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8"/>Kaasi nganga-ngombu Edimasi (bwosu buna bakala mutela mu ngeleti), kakala batendisa amana kakala sanda mu kumuhukumuna pfumu wa zawala mu lukwikilu. <verse eid="ACT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9"/>Hanga Sawulu (wuna bisi tela hika Pholu), wábasa yi Kitembu Kyatoma, wámutala Edimasi <verse eid="ACT 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10"/>amana wuzimbudi: «Ngeyi mutu yandu wabasa yi bukamvi yi mayedi mambi, mwana wa kiphidi-mutu, mbeni wa masonga! Wayambulaku kuzanga nzila za bukheti za Pfumu? <verse eid="ACT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11"/>Buthwena, koku dya Pfumu dyakúzyatula ngeyi: wakítuka phofu, amana mu tangwa dimosi, wamónaku hika mwini wa tangwa.» Muna tangwa meni dina, phipha yámubwila, wáyandika mu kubabata ndangu kasanda mutu wamúsimba. <verse eid="ACT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12"/>Tangwa kámona, pfumu wa zawala mana mabwa, wákwikila, wáyuka tsambu lawu kikuma kya malongi ma Pfumu.<verse eid="ACT 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu yi Balanabasi ku Atyosi wa Phisidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13"/>Pholu yi banduku bandi bákota mu masuwa ma Phafosi, bénda phi ku mbanza ya Pheleze dya Phafidiya. Yowani-Malaku yandi wádihambula yi bawu amana wávutuka ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14"/>Tuka ku mbanza Pheleze, bálanda nzila ya bawu amana bátula ku Atyosi wa Phisidi. Kilumbu kya sabata, bákota mu nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta amana bázakala. <verse eid="ACT 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15"/>Ku manima ma kutanga Mitsiku yi Bambikudi mu ndinga ya ngolu, bapfumu ba nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta bátuma benda bazimbwala: «Baphangi, yukani ndinga lwenina yawu kikuma kya kusyamisa batu, zonzenu.» <verse eid="ACT 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16"/>Pholu wátelama, wusongidi kidimbu ku koku amana wuzimbudi: «Bisi Kiseledi yi benu lwisi muzitisa Nzambi, yukenu! <verse eid="ACT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17"/>Nzambi wa kikanda kyaki, Nzambi wa Kiseledi kásola batata betu amana wávudisa kikanda mu tangwa dina kyákala mu kinzenza ku tsi ya Ngiphiti, kunima wálubulakya mu ngolu za koku dyandi. <verse eid="ACT 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18"/>Wábadisa kitesu kya mvula makumaya muna nganga. <verse eid="ACT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19"/>Amana ku manima kuzilula makanda tsambwadi muna tsi ya Kanana, wábaheka tsi ya bawu hanga kimvwama <verse eid="ACT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20"/>moosu mana másalama mu kitesu kya mvula khama ya yi makumatanu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">«Ku manima ma bwabuna, wábaheka bazusi tii yi kuna tangwa dya mbikudi Samwela. <verse eid="ACT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21"/>Ku manima, bálomba kyamvu, Nzambi wábaheka Sawulu, mwana Kisi, wuna wábayala mu mvula makumaya. Mukwa kikanda kya Benzyame kákala. <verse eid="ACT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22"/>Ku manima ma kumukatula, wábasodila kyamvu Tavidi ndangu kakala pfumu wa bawu. Wáta kimbangi kikuma kya yandi: "Yimusodi Tavidi mwana wa Yese: mutu yandu wufwanani yi mabanza mama, kalúngisa bwosu buna nzodi." <verse eid="ACT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23"/>Muna kikanda kyandi, Nzambi, muna lusilu lwandi kátedisila Yesu hanga muhuludi kikuma kya Kiseledi. <verse eid="ACT 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24"/>Ku thwala kukwisa kwandi, Yowani wábekitila kikuma kya mbotika ya tsobuka ya bikalulu ya kanda dyosu dya Kiseledi. <verse eid="ACT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25"/>Amana Yowani buna kákala manisa kisalu kyandi, kákala zimbula: "Kwena benu, nati yenina meni? Meni yenabwoku! Ku manima ma meni kabati kwisila wuna yiléndaku mu kutumuna tsabatu zandi."<verse eid="ACT 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26"/>«Baphangi bama ba kikanda kya Bulahami yi benu lwisi muzitisa Nzambi, Musamu wa luhulusu wuna, kwena betu báhitikawa. <verse eid="ACT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27"/>Mukuma, bisi Yelusalemi yi bapfumu ba bawu bámubakulaku Yesu, bábakisaku phi ndinga za bambikudi zina bisi tanga mu kosu kilumbu kya sabata. Kaasi bálungisaza mu kumusambisa. <verse eid="ACT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28"/>Mbatanana bakonda mona kikuma kya kumuzengila lufwa, bálomba kwena Philatu ni kamuhondisa. <verse eid="ACT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29"/>Ku manima ma kulungisa moosu mana básonika mu Masonuku kikuma kya yandi, bámukulumuna ha kitakani amana bámuzesa muna mazyamu. <verse eid="ACT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30"/>Kaasi Nzambi wámufutumuna ha kati dya bafwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31"/>Kádimonikisa bilumbu bya lawu kwena bana bámusindikila tuka ku Ngadidi yi kuna Yelusalemi, amana buthwena bákituka bambangi bandi ku thwala ya bisi Kiseledi. <verse eid="ACT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32"/>Amana betu, tulusamwani Musamu wa Bukheti wawu: lusilu luna kásila kwena batata betu, <verse eid="ACT 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33"/>Nzambi wulungisima buthwena kikuma kya betu bana ba bawu, mu kufutumuna Yesu. Bwosu buna básonika mu mukanda wazodi wa mikunga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">"Wenina Mwana wama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">meni, khituki tata waku lelu.<verse eid="ACT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34"/>Nzambi kázimbula: kamúfutumuna ku bafwa ndangu kavutukaku hika mu bivundisila. Bwabuna kázonzila:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">"Yilúheka bima byatoma bya Tavidi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">bina bilungini mu lukwikilu."<verse eid="ACT 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35"/>Ihana kázonzila muna mukunga wahika:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">"Wayámbwadilaku ni Watoma waku kavundila mu mazyamu."<verse eid="ACT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36"/>Kinga, ku manima ma kusadisa mu makula mandi bwosu buna kázola Nzambi; Tavidi wáfwa, bámuzika hana kabeta ka batata bandi amana wávunda. <verse eid="ACT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37"/>Kaasi wuna káfutumuna Nzambi, kávundaku. <verse eid="ACT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38"/>Zayenubwoku, baphangi bama: mwena yandi bisi lulongila ndoluka ya masumu; muna moosu mana myáfwanaku kululolula mitsiku mya Moyize, <verse eid="ACT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39"/>muna moosu meni mamana, wosu wuna wukwikidi mwena yandi kakútumuka. <verse eid="ACT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40"/>Disongidila ni kebenu, malubwilaku mana básonika Bambikudi:<verse eid="ACT 13:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41"/>"Talenu, benu lwabasa yi kilenza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">yitukenu amana totenu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Mukuma meni, yilúngisa muhangu wumosi muna tangwa dyenu, muhangu wumosi wuna lwakonda kwikila, yuka ni balumenikawa!»<verse eid="ACT 13:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42"/>Mu kulubuka kwa Pholu yi Balanabasi, bábabokwadila mu kuzonzila hika dyambu dina mu kilumbu kya sabata kina kyálanda. <verse eid="ACT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43"/>Tangwa kyámwangana kimvuka, Bayuta balawu yi baphani bana bakwikila mu malongi ma Bayuta bana bisi kumisa Nzambi, bálanda Pholu yi Balanabasi. Baba-baba, muna ngyambila za bawu kumosi yi bawu, bakala basyamisa mu kukangama ku khenda za Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44"/>Sabata dina dyálanda, mbanza yosu kwandi bákutakana mu kuyuka ndinga ya Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 13:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45"/>Mu kumona milumba-lumba mya batu, Bayuta bahika báyuka kiphala; bákala mufindisa phaka Pholu yi ngusi. <verse eid="ACT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46"/>Hanga Pholu yi Balanabasi bakala bazimbwala yi kikumbwala kyosu: «Bwálunga ni baluzimbwalaya, ndinga ya Nzambi, theti kwena benu. Kaasi bwosu lulewudiya amana lumoniki ni lufwaniku mu kutambula luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula, tubaluki kwetu kwena Baphani. <verse eid="ACT 13:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47"/>Mukuma Pfumu wátuheka muswa wawu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">"Yíkukitula, ngeyi, mwini wa makanda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">ndangu, mu lusadisu lwa ngeyi, luhulusu lwatula</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">tii yi muna mwatsukila tsi!"»<verse eid="ACT 13:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48"/>Buna báyuka bwabuna, Baphani básangwala lawu, bázatula Pfumu kikuma kya ndinga yandi. Amana boosu bana káyidika Nzambi kikuma kya luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula bákwikila. <verse eid="ACT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49"/>Ndinga ya Pfumu yámwangana mu mulambu wosu. <verse eid="ACT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50"/>Kaasi Bayuta bábalundika bakhetu ba luzitu bana bakala kumisa Nzambi yi bambuta ba mbanza amana bábasosila munyanga Pholu yi Balanabasi amana bábakukwasa mu mulambu wa bawu. <verse eid="ACT 13:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51"/>Bawu, bábakhukwamina fusyangeni dya bitambi bya bawu<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu kukhukumuna fusyangeni dya bitambi bya bawu, kyákala kidimbu mu kusongila ni batu bana babwisiwa musamu. Mambu mana matadiku hika bamwangi tsangu, kaasi matadi batu meni bana. </char></note> amana bénda ku Kikonyumi. <verse eid="ACT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52"/>Kaasi balonguki ba ku Atyoki wa Phisidi, bawu, bábasa yi kyesi yi Kitembu Kyatoma.<verse eid="ACT 13:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Pholu yi Balanabasi ku Kikonyumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1"/>Ku Kikonyumi, Pholu yi Balanabasi bakala kota phi mu nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta yi kuzonzilaka mu phila yimosi ni Bayuta balawu yi bisi Ngeleti bákwikila. <verse eid="ACT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2"/>Kaasi Bayuta bana bábwisa mu kukwikila, bakala sanda ni bavwadingisa mbundu za Baphani tii yikuna kuyenguna baphangi. <verse eid="ACT 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3"/>Mbatanana buna, Pholu yi Balanabasi báyika bilumbu bya bawu ku Kikonyumi. Bakala zonza yi kikumbwala kikuma bakala yekamina mwena Pfumu, yandi wuna wakala ta kimbangi kya ndinga ya mamboti mandi mu kuhana bidimbu yi biphadi muna moku ma bawu. <verse eid="ACT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4"/>Muna mbanza, batu bádikabisa; bahika kikuma kya Bayuta, bakwawu kikuma kya bathumwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5"/>Kaasi bwosu bakala yilama, Baphani yi Bayuta yi bapfumu ba bawu, mu kubanyokuna yi kubahondila ku matadi, <verse eid="ACT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6"/>bawu buna bábakulabwa, bátina ku mbanza ya Lisiti yi Delebi muna nzunga za kinzunga kya Dikawoni. <verse eid="ACT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7"/>Kwakuna, báyandika kulonga Musamu wa Bukheti.<verse eid="ACT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu yi Balanabasi ku Lisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8"/>Kwákala, kuna Lisiti, yi mutu mosi wawokumuka malu; tuka lubutuku lwandi, kákangalaku keti mbala mosi. Wazakala kákala. <verse eid="ACT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9"/>Kakala yuka mana kakala zonza Pholu. Yandu-yandu wumutadi amana bwosu kámona ni kákala yi lukwikilu lwalenda mubelula, <verse eid="ACT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10"/>hanga wuzimbudi mu ndinga ya ngolu: «Telama, singika bitambi byaku!» Mutu wuna wásotuka amana wáyandika mu kukangala. <verse eid="ACT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11"/>Bwosu bámona mambu mana kásala Pholu, milumba-lumba mya batu báthuta ndinga amana bázimbula mu ndinga ya bawu ya Dikawonye: «Banzambi bavwati lutu lwa kimutu amana bakulungi kwena betu!»<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu ndinga ya Dikawonye yi muna tsi za hika za ngeleti, mwákala yi mikhenda lawu myakala zonzila banzambi bana bisi kituka batu. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12"/>Balanabasi bakala mutela: «Zewusi» amana Pholu: «Helemesi», kikuma yandi wákala ngenzi<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zewusi kenina pfumu wa banzambi ba bisi ngeleti. Bakala mutela phi «tata wa banzambi yi batu» </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Helemesi kenina ngenzi wa Zewusi. </char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13"/>Kikumbu kya nzambi Zewusi kyákala kuna fula dya mbanza amana nganga wa kikumbu mekina, kumosi yi mulumba-lumba wa batu, wánata miluma mya bangombi yi bithundu bya kunenga, kázola ni katambikabya kimenga kwena Pholu yi Balanabasi. <verse eid="ACT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14"/>Tangwa báyukabwa bathumwa, Pholu yi Balanabasi, báyata miledi<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Báyata miledi mya bawu: yina yenina tsadidi ya Bayuta mu kusongila ni khabu bisi yuka tangwa bisi yuka ngusi zina bisi mutukwana Nzambi. </char></note> mya bawu amana bénda thinu mu mulumba-lumba mu kukalunga: <verse eid="ACT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15"/>«Bakwetu, biki lubati hangila bwabuna? Betu phi thwenina batu hanga benu. Yuka ni tubati lusamwana Musamu wa Bukheti, ndangu lwayambula mambu makonda mupfunu amana lwabaluka kwena Nzambi wa moya wuna wáhanga zilu yi tsi yi yanga dya mbuta, yi bima byosu bina bisimwa zingila. <verse eid="ACT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16"/>Muna makula máluta, yandi wáhana nzila kwena makanda moosu mu kulanda nzila za bawu-meni. <verse eid="ACT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17"/>Kaasi kálembwaku mu kuta kimbangi, mu kuhangaka mambu ma mamboti; mu kulunokisinaka mvula tukidila ku zilu, amana lwisi hela phi bibundu muna tangwa dya byawu, mu kuluhekaka madya yi kyesi kya ku mbundu.» <verse eid="ACT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18"/>Mbatanana bakala zonza bwabuna, phasi bámona mu kukandikisa kwena milumba-lumba mya batu mu kubatambikila kimenga.<verse eid="ACT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19"/>Kunima, Bayuta bana bátuka ku Atyosi yi ku Kikonyumi bábalongisila milumba-lumba mya batu. Hanga bamutimbwadi matadi Pholu amana bámubulumuna ku phenza ya mbanza, bábanza ni wafwa kákala. <verse eid="ACT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20"/>Kaasi tangwa bámuzyeta balonguki, wátokama amana wávutuka mu mbanza. Kilumbu kyalanda, wénda yi Balanabasi ku Delebi.<verse eid="ACT 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvutuka ku Atyoki dya Sidya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21"/>Kunima dya kusamuna Musamu wa Bukheti mu mbanza meni yayina yi kuyika balonguki balawu, Pholu yi Balanabasi mu kuvutuka kwa bawu, báhitila ku Lisiti ku Kikonyumi yi ku Atyosi. <verse eid="ACT 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22"/>Bakala syamisa balonguki yi kubaheka kikesa ndangu bazyama mu lukwikilu, mu kuzimbula: «Bulombi kwena betu, twamona kiwayi kya lawu mu kukota mu Kipfumu kya Nzambi.» <verse eid="ACT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23"/>Muna kosu Dibundu, bakala basodila malemba, amana ku manima ma kulombila yi kuzila kudya, bábatambika kwena Pfumu mwena wuna bakala sila lukwikilu lwa bawu.<verse eid="ACT 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24"/>Kunima, báhyokila ku Phisidiya amana bátula ku Phafidiya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25"/>Ku manima ma kulonga ndinga ya Nzambi ku Phelezi, bákulumuka ku Atadi. <verse eid="ACT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26"/>Tangwa bákatuka kwakuna, bálabuka ku Atyosi wa Sidiya, kuna bábatambikila mu khenda za Nzambi, kikuma kya kisalu kina básala. <verse eid="ACT 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27"/>Buna bátula, bákhundikisa Dibundu amana bátendula mambu moosu mana kábasadila Nzambi, yi buna kákangula mwelu wa lukwikilu kwena Baphani. <verse eid="ACT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28"/>Amana bánanga bilumbu bya lawu kumosi yi balonguki.<verse eid="ACT 14:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Kimvuka kya ku Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1"/>Ndambu ya batu bana bátuka ku Yuteya, bisa ku Atyosi, bwabu bakala longa kwena baphangi: «Yukani ludiyotisiku, bwosu bulombi mu mikuku mya Moyize, lwalendaku huluka.»<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala muna Lev 12:3</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2"/>Pholu yi Balanabasi bátendana lawu yi bawu. Hanga kunima babongi lukanu ni Pholu, Balanabasi yi ndambu ya batu ba bisi Atyosi batombuka ku Yelusalemi, ku thwala ya bathumwa yi malemba ndangu benda zonzila dyambu dina. <verse eid="ACT 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3"/>Dibundu bábaheka bina bákalabyawu mupfunu kikuma kya mu nzila<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna mikanda myahika, básonika ni benda basindikila. Dibundu dyadi babati zonzila haha, dyadina dya Atyosi wa Sidiya. </char></note>. Bwosu bakala hitila mu nzila ya Fenisi yi ya Samadiya, yi kumenikaka buna bábalwamina mbundu Baphani; amana bwakala hana kyesi kya lawu kwena baphangi. <verse eid="ACT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4"/>Mu kutula kwa bawu ku Yelusalemi, bathumwa yi bambuta ba dibundu, bábayamba ku Dibundu amana bábatendwala moosu mana káhanga Nzambi mu nzila ya bawu. <verse eid="ACT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5"/>Ndambu ya batu bana bákala mu kibuka kya bafwadisi amana bákituka phi bakwikidi, hanga batelami mu kuzimbula: «Bulungi ni babayotisa bakwikidi bana ba Baphani amana babatuma ndangu balemvuka mu mitsiku mya Moyize.» <verse eid="ACT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6"/>Bathumwa yi malemba bákutakana ndangu bazonzila dyambu dina. <verse eid="ACT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7"/>Tangwa dya lawu kyábonga kinzonzi. Kunima, Phetelu wátelama amana wubazimbwadi: «Baphangi bama, luzayibwa ni tuka thama, Nzambi wasola ha kati dya benu, ndangu mu munwa wa meni Baphani bayuka ndinga ya Musamu wa Bukheti amana bakwikila. <verse eid="ACT 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8"/>Amana Nzambi, yandi wuzayi mbundu, wubatidi kimbangi mu kubaheka Kitembu Kyatoma hanga kwena betu<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Khaphu ya 10:44; 11:15</char></note>; <verse eid="ACT 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9"/>kásyaku keti diswaswanu dimosi ha kati kya betu yi bawu, mukuma wásemisa mbundu za bawu mu lukwikilu. <verse eid="ACT 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10"/>Buthwena bwabu, kikuma kya biki lubati musokila Nzambi mu kubanatisa balonguki zitu dina bakonda lenda bakhaka betu yi betu-betu mu kunata? <verse eid="ACT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11"/>Thwisi kwikila ni mu khenda za Pfumu Yesu twáhulwakila betu yi bawu.»<verse eid="ACT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12"/>Kibuka kyosu kyahwena talala, amana bakala hinikina Balanabasi yi Pholu kutendula bidimbu byosu yi biphadi bina kásala Nzambi, mu nzila ya bawu, ha kati dya Baphani. <verse eid="ACT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13"/>Buna bámanisa kuzonza, Zyaki wábonga ndinga, wázonza: «Baphangi, ngyukenu! <verse eid="ACT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14"/>Simoni<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Simoni yena khumbu yatheti ya Phetelu (Mth 4:18) </char></note> kátendula phila yina kábongila Nzambi, mbala ya theti, hana kati dya makanda, kanda dimosi kikuma kya khumbu yandi. <verse eid="ACT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15"/>Ndinga za bambikudi zifwanakani yi mambu meni mamana, bwosu básonika:<verse eid="ACT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16"/>"Ku manima ma bwabuna yikwisa hika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">mu kutungulula sombolu dya Tavidi dina dyabwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">yitélamisadya hika mu kuzangana kwandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">amana yisúngikadya.<verse eid="ACT 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17"/>Ndangu batu bana basadi balenga sanda Pfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">abwabuna, makanda moosu mana menina yi khumbu yama,<verse eid="ACT 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18"/>mamana kázimbula Pfumu, yandi wuna wázayikisa mabanza mandi, tukidila thama."<verse eid="ACT 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19"/>Yihana, meni mboni ni babayangisaku Baphani bana babaluki kwena Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20"/>Kaasi tubasonikinenu: bayambula mu kudyaka mbisi basadidi mu nzila za biteki, bayambula mbongi<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbongi zitadidi malongu mana, mitsiku mya bayuta myakala kandisa. (Lev 18:6-23) </char></note> yi bambisi bana bisi zeka tsingu yi bana ba khengu. <verse eid="ACT 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21"/>Kikuma, tuka makula ma thama, muna kosu mbanza, mwena yi batu bisi tanga mitsiku mya Moyize yi muna kosu sabata muna nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta.»<verse eid="ACT 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukanda báhitika kwena bakwikidi ba Baphani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22"/>Hanga bathumwa yi malemba yi Dibundu dyosu bamonibwa mboti mu kusola bayala hana kati dya bawu ndangu benda basindikila Pholu yi Balanabasi ku Atyosi. Yuta wuna bakala tela phi Balasabasi, yi Silasi, batu bákala yi kitya mu kati dya baphangi. <verse eid="ACT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23"/>Bábaheka mukanda wawu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">«Bathumwa, malemba yi baphangi bahitiki mboti kwena baphangi Baphani bana benina kuna mbanza ya Atyosi, muna Sidiya yi muna Sidisi! <verse eid="ACT 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24"/>Tuyukikini ni ndambu ya batu batukini kwena betu, bana twakondi senda, baluvwadingisiki mabanza amana baluyukisiki kiwayi muna ndinga za bawu. <verse eid="ACT 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25"/>Ihana, dyambu dina twámonidya bukheti betu boosu mu kusola bayakala amana twabahitika kwena benu ha kimosi yi batya betu Balanabasi yi Pholu, <verse eid="ACT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26"/>bawu bátambika luzingu lwa bawu kikuma kya khumbu ya Pfumu wetu Yesu Kidisitu. <verse eid="ACT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27"/>Tuluhitiki Yuta yi Silasi, bawu báluzimbwala ndinga meni zina muna munwa mya bawu. <verse eid="ACT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28"/>Ihana ni, mboti bwenina kwena Kitembu Kyatoma yi kwena betu-betu ni tuluyekikaku keti kizitu kyahika, kaka mihangu mina miluti mupfunu: <verse eid="ACT 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29"/>kudikenga ku bima bina balambudi kwena biteki yi menga yi bambisi bana ba bithitu, yambulenu kindumba; yuka ni lwazitisa mambu mana mosu, mboti lwahánga. Salenu mboti!»<verse eid="ACT 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30"/>Hanga bawu babasisi amana bakulungi ku Atyosi, kwakuna, bákutikisa kibuka kya bakwikidi amana báhana mukanda. <verse eid="ACT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31"/>Bátangawa amana básangwala kikuma kya kusyamisa kuna. <verse eid="ACT 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32"/>Yuta yi Silasi, bawu meni bakala bambikudi, báhana kikesa kwena baphangi yi kubasyamisa mu ndinga za bawu za lawu . <verse eid="ACT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33"/>Kunima dya ndambu ya tangwa, baphangi bábazodila kuvutuka kwa ngemba kwena bana bábahitika. [<verse eid="ACT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34"/>Kaasi Silasi wámonabwa bukheti mu kusala kuna Atyosi kaasi Yuta wávutuka yandi buhika ku Yelusalemi].<note caller="h" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzila yayi ya 34 yenamwoku mu masonuku mahika mana ma thama. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35"/>Pholu yi Balanabasi, bázinga kuna Atyosi, mu kulonga yi kusamuna Musamu wa Bukheti wa ndinga ya Pfumu, kumosi yi batu bakwawu balawu.<verse eid="ACT 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pholu yi Balanabasi badihambudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36"/>Kunima ndambu ya bilumbu, Pholu wázimbula kwena Balanabasi: «Tuvutukisa mu kutala baphangi muna mbanza zoosu, muna twásamuna ndinga ya Pfumu, ndangu twazaya keti bweti benina.» <verse eid="ACT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37"/>Balanabasi kázola ni bamunata Yowani, wuna bakala tela Malaku; <verse eid="ACT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38"/>Kaasi Pholu kámona ni ka mboti ku banata mutu wuna wábatina kedi tuka ku Phafidiya amana wakonda basindikila mu kisalu kya bawu. <verse eid="ACT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39"/>Bánanama lawu, ku tsuka badihambula. Balanabasi wámubonga Malaku amana bákota mu masuwa ndangu benda ku Siphe, <verse eid="ACT 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40"/>Pholu, yandi, wásola Silasi amana benda, ku manima ma kubasya ha moku ma Pfumu, kwena baphangi. <verse eid="ACT 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41"/>Wálutila ku binzunga bya Sidiya yi Sidisi mu kusyamisa Mabundu.<verse eid="ACT 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Thimoti wusindikidi Pholu yi Silasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1"/>Pholu wátula ku Delebi, kunima wenda ku Disiti. Kinga kwákala kwakuna yi mulonguki mosi khumbu yandi Thimoti; kákala mwana wa Muyuta wa mukhetu mosi wa mukwikidi yi mwisi Ngeleti mosi. <verse eid="ACT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2"/>Baphangi ba bisi Lisiti yi bisi Kikonyumi bakala ta kimbangi kya mboti kikuma kya yandi. <verse eid="ACT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3"/>Pholu kázola ni kamunata kumosi yi yandi, hanga wumubongi amana wumuyotisi kikuma kya Bayuta ba kinzunga mekyana; kikuma boosu bakala zaya ni tata wandi mwisi Ngeleti<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu mitsiku mya bayuta, bana babutuki mwena bangudi ba bayuta, babana lwesi benina Bayuta. Bulungi ni bana ba bayakala babakotisa mukhanda. Kaasi bwákalaku buna kikuma kya Thimoti. </char></note> kákala. <verse eid="ACT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4"/>Muna mbanza zina bakala hitila, bakala samuna mana bázenga<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lukanu meni luna mu khufi bázonzilalwa lawu muna kisyati kina bátumbula muna khaphu ya 15:23-29. </char></note> kwena bathumwa yi bathwadisi kuna Yelusalemi, ndangu balundama. <verse eid="ACT 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5"/>Mabundu makala syama mu lukwikilu yi kukolaka kilumbu muna kilumbu.<verse eid="ACT 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu bamutedisi ku Masetwani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6"/>Kitembu Kyatoma wábakandisa Pholu yi Silasi mu kulonga Ndinga ya Nzambi mu kinzunga kya Aziya, hanga báluta ku Fizi yi tsi ya Ngalati. <verse eid="ACT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7"/>Buna bátula bela-bela yi kinzunga kya Misiya, bámeka mu kukwenda ku kinzunga kya Bitini; kaasi Kitembu kya Yesu kábahekaku nzila. <verse eid="ACT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8"/>Hanga bahitidi ku Misiya amana bákulunga ku mbanza ya Thowasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9"/>Muna phipha, Pholu wámona mbona mesu. Mwisi Masetwani mosi wákala hana, watelama, kakala mubokwadila bwabu: «Luta ku Masetwani, awisa tusadisa!» <verse eid="ACT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10"/>Buna kámonina mbona mesu yina, twásanda mu kukwenda ku Masetwani; kikuma twázaya ni Nzambi kátutela ndangu twasamuna Musamu wa Bukheti kwakuna.<verse eid="ACT 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ku Fidiphu, Didya wukwikidi mwena Pfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11"/>Buna twábonga masuwa tukidila ku Thowasi, hanga thwendi mbala mosi yi kuna zawala dya Samothalasi; kilumbu kyalanda thwénda ku mbanza ya Neyaphodisi. <verse eid="ACT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12"/>Ha twákatuka kwakuna, thwénda ku Fidiphu; mbanza yimosi, muna kinzunga kyatheti kya Masetwani amana bisi Loma bakalamwa zingila. Twánanga ndambu ya bilumbu kwakuna. <verse eid="ACT 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13"/>Mu kilumbu kya sabata, twálubuka mu mwelu wa mbanza, kuna khungu ya mamba mosi, homa hana twakala banzila ni twawana kizika kya lombilu. Twázakala hakana amana twáyambila yi bakhetu bana bisaha kutakana. <verse eid="ACT 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14"/>Hakala yi mukhetu mosi khumbu yandi Didya; kikhita kya miledi mya thalu kakala sala, mwisi mbanza ya Thiyatidi, kakala kumisa Nzambi. Kakala yuka, amana Pfumu wámukangula mbundu ndangu kadihana mu ndinga za Pholu. <verse eid="ACT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15"/>Kunima dya kutambula mbotika yi nzu yandi yosu, wátutedisa kuna nzu yandi, kátubokwadila mu kuzimbula: «Yuka lumoni ni meni yenina wakwikama kwena Pfumu, alwisenu ku nzu yama amana zakalenu kwakuna.» Amana wátubokwadila ndangu twatambwasa.<verse eid="ACT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu yi Silasi mu boloku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16"/>Bwana twákala kwenda ha kizika kya lombilu, musadi wa mukhetu mosi wakala yi mukisi wa nyoka<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mukisi wawu wa nyoka, bakalawa sadila kwena mutu wosu wuna wákala yi hamu dya kutekila zonza mambu mana makwísa ku thwala. Kikuma kya bakidisitu, mukisi wa nyoka, bakalawa bongila hanga kitembu kyambi. </char></note>, wakala mutuma mu kubikula mana mabwa ku thwala, muna phila meni yina, mwamuna bapfumu bandi bakala bongila mbongu, hanga wututundakani. <verse eid="ACT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17"/>Wayandika mu kutulanda, betu yi Pholu, yi kukalungaka: "Batu baba benina basadi ba Nzambi wa phungu! Babati lulonga nzila ya luhulusu!" <verse eid="ACT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18"/>Bwosu kakala sala bwabuna bilumbu bya lawu, ku tsuka, Pholu wávwalangana, amana wábaluka mu kuzonza kwena kitembu kina: «Mu khumbu ya Yesu Kidisitu, yikuheki muswa ni wálubuka mu lutu lwa mukhetu yandi!» Amana kyálubuka muna tangwa medina. <verse eid="ACT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19"/>Buna bamona ni kivuvu kya bawu bakala bongila mbongu kitotini, hanga bapfumu ba mwana mukhetu wuna babakwati Pholu yi Silasi amana bababulumuni hana mbasi, kuna thwala ya bapfumu ba mbanza. <verse eid="ACT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20"/>Babasongidi kwena bazusi ba Loma amana bazimbudi: «Batu baba babati kotisa mvwalangani mu mbanza yetu. Bayuta benina, <verse eid="ACT 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21"/>amana babati longa mikuku mya pha mina batulombiku keti mu ku tambwasa, keti kusadila kwena betu thwenina bisi Loma.» <verse eid="ACT 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22"/>Mulumba-lumba wa batu phi wábabalukila. Hanga bazusi babawomwasi miledi amana bahani muswa ni babadiphula mafimbu. <verse eid="ACT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23"/>Ku manima ma kubadiphula lawu dya mafimbu, bábatimbula mu boloku, balombi kwena tsinzidi ni kabatalaka mboti-mboti. <verse eid="ACT 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24"/>Buna kabonga muswa wuna, wábakotisa mu suku dina dyákala kuna tsuka ya boloku amana wábakotisa malu muna phophu. <verse eid="ACT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25"/>Muna kisuku, Pholu yi Silasi bakala lombila yi kuyimbila kikuma kya kuzatula Nzambi; batu bahika ba boloku bakala bayuka. <verse eid="ACT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26"/>Muna mbala mosi, mafu máningana ngolu, mipfundila mya boloku myáningana. Muna tangwa meni dina, mwelu myosu mya batu ba boloku myákanguka, amana misinga myosu myátabuka. <verse eid="ACT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27"/>Tsinzidi wátokama, amana buna kámona ni mwelu mya boloku mya kukangula, wáhola mbedi ya phoku yandi; kázola ni kadihonda, kikuma kákabanza ni bakwa boloku bátina. <verse eid="ACT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28"/>Kaasi Pholu wákalunga: «Wudihekaku phasi! Hatwenina betu boosu!» <verse eid="ACT 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29"/>Hanga tsinzidi wulombi mwinda, wákota thinu amana wábwa kuna thwala ya Pholu yi Silasi, kuna yi kutekitaka. <verse eid="ACT 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30"/>Wabanata ku nzila amana wuzimbudi: «A bapfumu, biki pfwani yihanga ndangu yihuluka?» <verse eid="ACT 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31"/>Bamuvutwadini: «Kwikila mwena Pfumu Yesu, wahúluka ngeyi yi nzu yaku.» <verse eid="ACT 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32"/>Bámulonga ndinga ya Pfumu, yi kwena boosu bana bákala mu nzu yandi. <verse eid="ACT 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, muna phipha, wábabonga yandi meni amana wásukula phuta za bawu. Wátambula mbotika, yandi yi boosu bana bákala mu nzu yandi<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Phila mosi yi mana básonika mu nzila ya 15 ya khaphu meni dyadi, yi muna khaphu ya 18:8. Disongidila ni wátambula mbotika yandi yi batu bana bakala mu nzu yandi.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34"/>Wábatombula ku nzu yandi, wábaheka bima bya kudya amana wásephila kumosi yi nzu yandi yosu kikuma kya buna bákwikila mwena Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 16:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35"/>Tangwa kwakhya kuma, bazusi ba Loma bátuma basuta benda zimbula kwena tsinzidi: «Bayambwadila batu bana.» <verse eid="ACT 16:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36"/>Tsinzidi wátudisa muluwa kwena Pholu mu kuzimbula: «Bazusi bazimbudi ni balubula; buthwena, lubukenu amana lwenda mu ngemba.» <verse eid="ACT 16:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37"/>Kaasi Pholu kábavutwala bwabu: «Ku manima ma kutubetisa fimbu mu mesu ma batu, konda kutusambisa, betu batu thwena bakwa mbedi ya Loma<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mitsiku mya bisi Loma myakala bwisisa kwena bazusi mu kubetisa fimbu kwena bana ba mbedi. Khaphu ya 22:25-29; 23:27. </char></note>! Batutimbudi mu boloku. Amana buthwena, bazodi ni batukula mu kitsweki? Loni! Bisa tulubula bawu meni!» <verse eid="ACT 16:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38"/>Basuta bánata ndinga zina kwena bazusi ba Loma, bawu, bweya bwábakwata mu kuyuka ni bisi mbedi ya Loma bákala. <verse eid="ACT 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39"/>Bisa babokwadila amana bábasula, yi kubalombaka ni bakatuka mu mbanza. <verse eid="ACT 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40"/>Tangwa bálubuka mu boloku, Pholu yi Silasi, bénda ku nzu ya Didya. Buna bábamona, babasyamisa baphangi amana bénda.<verse eid="ACT 16:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Pholu yi Silasi ku Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1"/>Kunima kulutila mu nzila ya Afiphodisi yi Apholoniya, bátula ku Tesalonika kuna kwákala nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta. <verse eid="ACT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2"/>Pholu wénda kwakuna, bwosu buna kayikana. Kitesu kya masabata matatu kakala zonzila, kumosi yi bawu, mambu mana matadidi Masonuku, <verse eid="ACT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3"/>kákalama babangwamina mu kusongila ni Kidisitu káfwana kunyokuka amana kafutumuka ha kati dya bafwa. Wuzimbudini: «Yesu wuna yibati lusamwana, yandi wuna Kidisitu.» <verse eid="ACT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4"/>Ndambu ya bayuta hana kati dya bawu bátambwasama amana bákhundakana kwena Pholu yi Silasi. Phila mosi yi bisi Ngeleti balawu bana bakala kumisa Nzambi yi bakhetu bahika ba luzitu. <verse eid="ACT 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5"/>Kaasi Bayuta báyuka kiphala, bábonga ndambu ya bayakala bambi, bana bisi telama muna balabala, hanga balubudi mathata muna kibuka yi mvwalangani muna mbanza. Bénda kuna nzu ya Yasoni mu kusanda Pholu yi Silasi ndangu babanata ku mesu ma batu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6"/>Kaasi bábawanaku; hanga babanati Yasoni yi ndambu ya baphangi bahika bakala hana ku thwala ya bazusi ba mbanza, amana báyandika kukalunga: «Batu baba bavwadingisini tsi yosu, buthwena, batudi haka! <verse eid="ACT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7"/>Amana Yasoni wubayambiki kuna nzu yandi! Boosu babati sala mambu mafwananiku yi mitsiku mya Khayisala, mukuma babati zimbula ni henina yi kyamvu wahika, Yesu!» <verse eid="ACT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8"/>Ndinga meni zina zibavwadingisi mulumba-lumba wa batu yi bazusi ba mbanza. <verse eid="ACT 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9"/>Kunima dya kubafutisa mbongu, Yasoni yi batu bahika, bábayambwadila.<verse eid="ACT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu yi Silasi ku Bele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10"/>Buna yabwa phipha, hanga baphangi babahitiki Pholu yi Silasi ku Bele. Mu kutula kwa bawu, bénda ku nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta. <verse eid="ACT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11"/>Baba-baba bákala yi tsambu ya kubayamba kuluta bana bákala ku Tesalonika; báyambaya Ndinga ya Nzambi yi luzolu lwa mboti mu kulongukaka kosu kilumbu Masonuku, ndangu bazaya yukani mambu mana babati balonga ma kyedika menina. <verse eid="ACT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12"/>Balawu hana kati dya bawu, bákituka bakwikidi. Phila mosi yi bisi Ngeleti ba bakhetu ba luzitu yi bayakala balawu. <verse eid="ACT 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13"/>Kaasi tangwa báyuka, Bayuta ba ku Tesalonika, ni Pholu kabati samuna hika ndinga ya Nzambi ku Bele, bísa hika kwakuna, ndangu bavwadingisa milumba-lumba mya batu. <verse eid="ACT 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14"/>Hanga baphangi bámuhitika Pholu ku sabu dya yanga dya mbuta; kaasi Silasi yi Thimoti básala kuna Bele. <verse eid="ACT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15"/>Bana bakala munata Pholu, bénda yandi yi kuna Ateni, kunima dya kuvutuka kwa bawu ku Bele, batu meni babana bisa yi muswa wuna kábaheka Pholu kikuma kya Silasi yi Thimoti ndangu bamulanda tswalu.<verse eid="ACT 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu ku Ateni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16"/>Muna tangwa medina, Pholu kakala bahingila Silasi yi Thimoti kuna Ateni, kámona ni mbanza yina yabasa yi banzambi ba biteki, hanga wuyuki phasi lawu ku mbundu. <verse eid="ACT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17"/>Kakala solula yi Bayuta yi bana bakala kumisa Nzambi mu nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta, amana kosu kilumbu, kakala solula yi bana kakala wana mu mazandu. <verse eid="ACT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18"/>Ndambu ya batu ba mayedi ba ephikidiye yi ba sitoyisye<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bisi kibuka kya Ephikidiye (wáfwa tukidila mvula 270 ku thwala Yesu Kidisitu) Bawu bakala longa ni Nzambi kena mwoku holo Nzambi kisi kuhanga kima mu luzingu lwa batu. Amana kisi hana mupfunu wa lawu ku mambu matadidi byesi. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Sitoyisye: Kenina mutu wuna wisi landa malongi ma mutu wa ngangu Zeno (340-265 ku thwala lubutuku lwa Yesu Kidisitu (Isa-adi-Masi). Basitoyisye bisi hana mupfunu wa lawu ku mambu mamboti muna kosu dyambu.) </char></note> bayandika mu kuyambila yi yandi. Bahika bakala zimbula: «Biki disongidila dya malokosi mama?» Bakwawu bazimbudi: «Ngatu mulongi mosi wa banzambi ba banzenza wubati longa.» Mukuma Pholu kakala samuna Musamu wa Bukheti wa Yesu yi wuna wa lufutumuku<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu yi lufutumuku: batu bana bakala muhinikina Pholu bakala bongila muhowu wawu wa ngeleti, wutadidi lufutumuku, hanga nzambi mosi wa mukhetu wuna bálunga kukhundikisa kwena Yesu. </char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19"/>Hanga bamubongi, bamunati ku Ayelophazi<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mongu wa kimvuka kyambuta: mongu wa ku Ateni, kuna kyakala kutakanina kimvuka kyambuta kya mbanza. Khumbu ya kimvuka meni yásala bwabuna keti buna bisikwoku kutanina hika. </char></note> amana bamuzimbwadini: «Fwani twazaya keti khi mawu malongi mapha mana wubati zonzila? <verse eid="ACT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20"/>Mukuma mambu ma kuyituka wubati zonzila mu matu ma betu. Tuzodi twazaya thendula ya mawu.» <verse eid="ACT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21"/>Kikuma, bisi Ateni yi banzenza bana bakala zingila ha kati dya bawu bakala lutisa tangwa dya bawu dyosu mu kumenika holo kuyuka mambu mana mapha. <verse eid="ACT 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22"/>Pholu wátelama hana kati dya Ayelophazi, wuzimbudi: «Bisi Ateni, mboni ni batu ba kinzambi lwenina muna mambu moosu. <verse eid="ACT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23"/>Kikuma mu kuluta khadikini, mboni bima byenu bya bisambu, amana mboni phi yi mesa ma kimenga básonika bwabu: "Kwena nzambi wuna kazayakaniku." Disongidila ni lwisi mufukamina konda kumuzaya, yandi wuna mbati lusamwana meni. <verse eid="ACT 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24"/>Nzambi wuna wáhanga tsi yi byosu bina byeninamwa, yandi wenina Pfumu wa zilu yi wa tsi, kisiku zingila mu nzu za Nzambi zina bátungila mu moku ma batu; <verse eid="ACT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25"/>bisiku muheka bima bituki mu moku ma batu, hanga wuna wisi konda kima, yandi wisi baheka luzingu kwena boosu, mwela yi bima byosu. <verse eid="ACT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26"/>Muna nzila ya mutu mosi<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu nzila ya mutu mosi: Atamu (Kuy 1:28). </char></note> káhangila makanda moosu ma batu, baba bisi zingila mu tsi yosu, amana wáyidika matangwa yi muma muna bafwani kuzingila, <verse eid="ACT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27"/>ndangu bamusanda Nzambi, ngatu bafwani kumumona mu kubabata. Kinga yandi kisiku kala kyana yi mosi yi mosi wa betu.<verse eid="ACT 17:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28"/>Mukuma: "Mwena yandi thwisi zingila, thwisi ninganina amana thwenina;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">Bwabuna bázimbula phi ndambu ya basoniki benu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">"Betu phi thwenina khuna ya yandi<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pholu kabati zonzila basoniki ba bisi ngeleti kikuma kya kumusola Nzambi hanga kisina kya luzingu lwa kimutu. </char></note>."<verse eid="ACT 17:28"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29"/>Yukani kikanda kya Nzambi thwenina, twalendaku banza ni bunzambi bwenina hanga wolu, hanga ndisu holo hanga matadi mana bisi hala kwena batu yi mabanza ma kimutu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30"/>Kaasi Nzambi, kisiku tala hika tangwa dina dya kukonda mazaya, buthwena, kabati tela batu boosu, muma mwosu, ndangu basoba bikalulu<note caller="h" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kusoba kwa bikalulu: muma mwahika básonika ni kusoba kwa khadidi holo kubalumuna mbundu. </char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31"/>Kikuma wásya kilumbu kina kasámbisa tsi ya batu yosu mu masonga; mu nzila ya mutu wuna kásola, amana wáhana kambangu kwena batu boosu, mu kumufutumuna ha kati dya bafwa!»<verse eid="ACT 17:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32"/>Buna báyuka kuzonzila lufutumuku lwa bafwa, bahika bámuseya, bakwawu bazimbudi: «Mbala yahika nana twayúka mambu mana.» <verse eid="ACT 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33"/>Bwabuna kálubukila Pholu ha kati dya bawu. <verse eid="ACT 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34"/>Mbatanana buna, ndambu ya batu bahika, bákhundakana kwena yandi amana bákituka bakwikidi. Muna kati dya bawu, mwákala yi Tenisi, mukwa kibuka kya Ayelophazi, yi ngudi mosi khumbu yandi Tamadiya yi batu bahika.<verse eid="ACT 17:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Pholu ku Khoditu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1"/>Ku manima ma bwabuna, Pholu wákatuka ku Ateni, wénda ku Khoditu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Khoditu yákala mbanza ya theti ya kinzunga kya Akayi. Mbanza yimosi yákala yi lawu dya batu, yázayakana lawu kikuma kya busafu. </char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2"/>Káwana kwakuna, Muyuta mosi khumbu yandi Akilasi, mwisi kizunga kya Photi<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Photi kyákala kinzunga kimosi kuna londi dya tsi ya kinzunga kya Aziya, muna kabeta ka yanga dya Kaphindi. </char></note>, wisi tula nana tukidila ku Kitadi yi mukhetu wandi Phisikila, kikuma Kodi káhana muswa ni Bayuta boosu bakatuka ku Loma. Hanga Pholu wendi kuna bákala; <verse eid="ACT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3"/>bwosu kakala sala kisalu kimosi yi bawu, wázakala kuna nzu ya bawu mu kusala kisalu: bákala bayidiki ba masombolu. <verse eid="ACT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4"/>Kosu sabata, kakala bonga ndinga muna nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta amana kakala sanda mu kukwikisa Bayuta yi bisi Ngeleti.<verse eid="ACT 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5"/>Kaasi buna bákulumuka, Silasi yi Thimoti tukidila ku Masetwani, Pholu wádihana kimakulu mu kulonga Ndinga ya Nzambi; kakala tendula kwena Bayuta ni Yesu kenina Kidisitu. <verse eid="ACT 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6"/>Kaasi bwosu bakala bwisa Bayuta malongi mandi yi kumutukwanaka, wákhukumuna miledi<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pholu wákhukumuna miledi myandi: bwena phila mosi yi kukhukumuna fusyangeni dya bitambi (khaphu ya 13:51). </char></note> myandi amana wábazimbwala: «Menga menu makala hana thandu ya mutwa myenu! Meni mathadiku! Buthwena bwabu, yikwénda kwena Baphani.» <verse eid="ACT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7"/>Wákatuka kuna amana wénda ku nzu ya mutu mosi, khumbu yandi Titiyusi Yusitusi, wakala kumisa Nzambi, nzu yandi yákala hana kabeta ka nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta. <verse eid="ACT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8"/>Khisiphusi, pfumu wa nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta, wákwikila mwena Pfumu yi nzu yandi yosu. Amana bisi Khoditu lawu bana bakala yuka, bákwikila amana bábotama.<verse eid="ACT 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9"/>Muna phipha mosi, Pfumu kámulubwakila Pholu mu mbona mesu, wumuzimbwadi: «Yukaku bweya! Zonzaka, wudibataku, <verse eid="ACT 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10"/>mukuma meni yenina kumosi yi ngeyi. Ka mutu ku wakúhanga kima, kikuma batu balawu yenina bawu mu mbanza yayi.» <verse eid="ACT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11"/>Kánanga kwakuna, mvula mosi yi ngonda sambanu hana kati dya bawu, mu kulonga ndinga ya Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12"/>Muna tangwa dina kákala Kadiyoni, pfumu wa Loma kuna kinzunga kya Akayi, Bayuta bákutakana, bábonga lukanu lwa mbi kikuma kya Pholu amana bámunata ku nganda ya bazusi, <verse eid="ACT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13"/>bazimbudi: «Mutu yandu, kabati kwikisa batu ndangu bakumisaka Nzambi muna phila yina milombidiku mitsiku.» <verse eid="ACT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14"/>Pholu, buna kázola katambula ndinga, Kadiyoni wázimbula kwena Bayuta: «Wadi ni mutsiku kakuludi kondilo dyambu dyahika diluti kitesu, wadi yiluyukidi buna bufwani, benu Bayuta. <verse eid="ACT 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15"/>Kaasi hadyena dyambu ditadi mihowu, khumbu yi mitsiku mya benu-benu, mana matadi benu-benu. Meni, nzodiku kukala zusi dya mambu mana!» <verse eid="ACT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16"/>Hanga wubakudi ku nganda ya bazusi. <verse eid="ACT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17"/>Hanga boosu bamukwati Sositeni, pfumu wa nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta, amana báyandika kumubeta hana thwala ya nganda ya bazusi, konda bwamuheka phasi Kadiyoni.<verse eid="ACT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu vutuki ku Atyosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18"/>Pholu wázakala hika kwakuna ndambu ya bilumbu. Kunima, wábasisa baphangi amana wákota mu masuwa ndangu kenda ku Sidiya, kumosi yi Phisila yi Akilasi. Wádikulula tsuki ku mutwa, kuna Sakhe, mukuma lusilu kásila. <verse eid="ACT 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19"/>Tangwa bátula ku Efesu, yandi wábasisa Phisila yi Akilasi. Wenda ku nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta amana wáyambila yi Bayuta. <verse eid="ACT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20"/>Bámulomba ni kánanga hika ndambu ya bilumbu kwakuna; kaasi yandi kazolaku. <verse eid="ACT 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21"/>Wábasisa mu kuzimbula: «Yikwisa vutuka kwena benu, yukani Nzambi kazolabwa.» Tukidila ku Efesu, wákota mu masuwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22"/>Amana ha kátula, ku Sezale katulukila, wátombuka theti ku Yelusalemi ndangu kahana mboti ku Dibundu<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndinga ya ngeleti yizonzi lwesi ni "wátombuka ndangu kahana mboti ku dibundu, kaasi bwa kyedika ni fwani dyakala Dibundu dina dya ku Yelusalemi. </char></note>, kunima wákulunga ku Atyosi. <verse eid="ACT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23"/>Ku manima ma ndambu ya tangwa, wénda amana wáhyokila mu nzila ya Ngalati yi Fizi, mu kusyamisa balonguki boosu.<verse eid="ACT 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Apholosi ku Efeso, yi ku Khoditu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24"/>Kinga Muyuta mosi, khumbu yandi Apholosi, mwisi Alekizandi, nganzi wa mbuta kákala amana wátoma zaya mambu matadidi Masonuku, wátula kuna Efesu. <verse eid="ACT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25"/>Yandi, nzila ya pfumu bámulonga, yi ngolu mu kitembu, amana kakala longa yi tsikiningi mambu matadidi Yesu, kaasi mbotika ya Yowani lwesi kázaya. <verse eid="ACT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26"/>Kákala zonza yi tsikiningi yosu muna nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta. Ku manima ma kumuyuka, Phisila yi Akilasi bámubonga mu kwenda musongila mboti-mboti nzila ya Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27"/>Bwosu kákanina mu kuhyokila ku Akayi, baphangi bámuheka kikesa amana bábasonikina balonguki ndangu bamuyamba mboti-mboti. Mu kutula kwandi kuna, mupfunu wa lawu kákala kwena bana bákituka bakwikidi mu khenda za Nzambi, <verse eid="ACT 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28"/>mukuma, kakala batungulula, Bayuta, yi ngolu zoosu hana mesu ma batu, yi kubasongila muna nzila ya Masonuku ni Yesu kenina Kidisitu.<verse eid="ACT 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Pholu ku Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1"/>Tangwa kákala Apholosi ku khoditu, Pholu wálutila ku kinzunga kya myongu, wákulumuka yi kuna Efesu. Káwana kwakuna ndambu ya balonguki, <verse eid="ACT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2"/>amana wubayufudi: «Lwátambula Kitembu Kyatoma tangwa lwákituka bakwikidi?» Bawu bamuvutwadini: «Khaku kedi tuyuka kuzonzila Kitembu Kyatoma». <verse eid="ACT 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3"/>Yandi wábayufula hika: «Amana khi mbotika lwatambula?» Bawu bamuvutwadini: «Mbotika ya Yowani.» <verse eid="ACT 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4"/>Hanga Pholu wuzimbudi: «Yowani kábotika mbotika mosi ya kubalumuna mbundu, kakala zimbula kwena batu ni bakwikila mwena wuna wakala kwisa ku manima ma yandi, disongidila ni Yesu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mth 3:11; Mlk 1:4, 7-8 kusoba kwa bikalulu, bahika ni kubalumuna kwa mbundu. </char></note>.» <verse eid="ACT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5"/>Muna ndinga meni zina, bátambula mbotika mu khumbu ya Pfumu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6"/>Pholu wábathetika moku, amana Kitembu Kyatoma wábakulwamukina. Báyandika kuzonza mu ndinga zina zizayakaniku yi kubikulaka mambu mana kakala bazimbwala Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7"/>Bayakala bana bákala kitesu kya kumi yi boodi.<verse eid="ACT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8"/>Pholu kakala kwenda ku nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta, kwakuna kakala zonzila yi kikumbwala; kitesu kya ngonda tatu kakala zonzila yi kukwikisaka batu bana bakala muyuka mu mana matadidi Kipfumu kya Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9"/>Kaasi batu bahika, bwosu bábwisa mu kuyuka yi mu kukwikila. Bakala lewula Nzila yina, mu mesu ma batu boosu. Hanga Pholu wubasisi, wénda yi balonguki ku kabeta, kakala solula yi bawu kosu kilumbu<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Masonuku mahika másonika yi tsikiningi ni tukidila tangwa dya 11 yi kuna tangwa dya 16. </char></note> muna nzu ya malongi ya Tilanusi. <verse eid="ACT 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10"/>Bwabuna bwázinga mvula zoodi, mu phila ni batu boosu bakala zingila mu kinzunga kya Aziya, keti Bayuta keti bisi Ngeleti, báyuka ndinga ya Pfumu.<verse eid="ACT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bana ba bayakala ba Sevwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11"/>Nzambi kakala sala bidimbu bya kuyituka mu nzila ya Pholu. <verse eid="ACT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12"/>Bwabuna bakala kusilaka kwena bambefu miledi kondilo bitemba bina byákala khundakana ku lutu lwandi; bimbefu byákala beluka amana bitembu bya mbi byákala lubuka. <verse eid="ACT 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13"/>Ndambu ya Bayuta bakala kwenda muma yi muma bakala meka kukula bitembu bya mbi mwena bana bakala byawu, yi kutumbulaka khumbu ya Pfumu Yesu; yi kuzonzaka: «Yiluheki muswa wa kulubuka mu khumbu ya Yesu wuna kabati longila Pholu!» <verse eid="ACT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14"/>Hákala yi bana ba bayakala tsambwadya ba mosi wa bapfumu ba banganga Nzambi ba Bayuta, khumbu yandi Sevwa bakala sala bwabuna, <verse eid="ACT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15"/>kaasi kitembu kya mbi kyábavutwala: «Yesu, yimuzayini, nzayi mboti phi keti nani kena Pholu; kaasi benu, banani lwenina?» <verse eid="ACT 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16"/>Amana mutu wuna wákala yi kitembu kya mbi wubabwidi, ngolu kákala kuluta bawu; watoma babeta boosu, bálubuka mu nzu yina, thinu, kikhonga yi phuta muna lutu. <verse eid="ACT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17"/>Kindanda kiditi kwena boosu bana bisi zingila ku Efesu, Bayuta yi bisi Ngeleti; bweya bwábakwata boosu amana bazimbudi ni khumbu ya Pfumu Yesu yambuta yenina. <verse eid="ACT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18"/>Balawu ha kati dya bana bákituka bakwikidi bakala kwisa mu kufunguna mihangu mya bawu ha mesu ma batu boosu. <verse eid="ACT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19"/>Batu balawu bana bakala sadila mikisi, bakala nata mikanda mya bawu amana bayokimya kuna thwala ya batu boosu. Bátanga thalu ya mbongu ya mikanda meni, yákala makumatanu ma mafunda ma bibendi bya mbongu<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mlk 6:37</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20"/>Bwabuna Ndinga ya Pfumu yakala mwanganina yi ngolu.<verse eid="ACT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvwalangani ya ku Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21"/>Kunima dya kusalama kwa mambu mana, Pholu wábonga lukanu, lwa kukwenda ku Yelusalemi mu kulutila mu nzila ya Masetwani yi Akayi. Kakala zimbula: «Buna yikatuka kuna, bwálunga ni yitula hika ku Loma.» <verse eid="ACT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22"/>Kahanga wutumi bodi ba batu bandi bana bakala musadila ku Masetwani, Thimoti yi Elasiti, kaasi yameni wásala ndambu ya tangwa ku kinzunga kya Aziya. <verse eid="ACT 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23"/>Muna tangwa medina, mvwalangani za lawu zálubuka ku Efeso, kikuma kya Nzila ya Pfumu. <verse eid="ACT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24"/>Mutu mosi, wakala yidika bima bya phalata, khumbu yandi Temethiyusi<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Temethiyusi: kenina nzambi wa mukhetu kikuma kya buyanga yi mata wuna wázayakana mu khumbu ya Dyana. </char></note>. Kakala yidika nzu za Nzambi za khunda-khunda za phalata kikuma kya nzambi wa mukhetu, Atedimisi amana mbongu za lawu kyakala balumbwala, yandi yi basadi bana bakala sala kisalu kimosi yi yandi. <verse eid="ACT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25"/>Kábakhundikisa boosu kumosi yi batu bahika bana bakala sala yandi kisalu kimosi, amana wuzimbudi: «Bakwetu, luzayi ni kimvwama kyetu mu kisalu kyaki kyisi tuka. <verse eid="ACT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26"/>Kinga lubati mona amana lubati yuka mana mabati hita; ka ku Efesu lwesi ku, kaasi mu kinzunga kya Aziya kyosu, Pholu meni wawuna kákwikisikini mulumba-lumba wa batu mu kuzimbula ni banzambi bana bahadi ku moku ma batu beku banzambi ba kyedika. <verse eid="ACT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27"/>Mana mafwaniku lwesi kuzanga kisalu kya betu, kaasi mafwani phi kubebisa mambu ma ngolu ku nzu ya nzambi ya nzambi wa mukhetu Atedimisi yi kukulumuna kipfumu kyandi kina bisi fukamina mu kinzunga kya Aziya yi muna tsi yosu ndangu batu bamufukaminaku hika!» <verse eid="ACT 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28"/>Tangwa báyuka bwabuna, khabu zábakwata lawu amana báyandika mu kukalunga: «Wambuta kenina Atedimisi wa bisi Efeso!» <verse eid="ACT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29"/>Mvalangani yákota muna mbanza yosu. Boosu, mu kimosi, benda ku tsaka amana bábakwata Kayosi yi Adisitadiki, bisi Masetwani bana bisa musindikila Pholu mu nzila amana bababulumuna yi kuna tsaka. <verse eid="ACT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30"/>Pholu wázola kenda lubuka ku mesu ma mulumba-lumba wa batu kaasi balonguki bámukandisa. <verse eid="ACT 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31"/>Amana basadi ba leta bana bakala banduku bandi, bámuhitika ndinga mu kumubokwadila ni kendaku ku tsaka. <verse eid="ACT 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32"/>Bahika bakala kalunga kima kimosi, bakwawu kyahika; kikuma, mvwalangani lawu yakala ha kati dya kibuka. Batu balawu bázayaku kikuma kina báwongamina. <verse eid="ACT 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33"/>Ndambu ya batu, muna kibuka, bámutendwala Alekizande mana makala luta, amana bámulundika ndangu kahyoka ku thwala. Alekizande wáthuta koku ndangu kadikutumuna ku thwala ya kibuka. <verse eid="ACT 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34"/>Kaasi tangwa bámutungulula ni Muyuta kákala, boosu báyandika mu kukalunga mu kimosi, kitesu kya matangwa modi: «Wambuta kenina Atedimisi wa bisi Efeso!»<verse eid="ACT 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35"/>Kaasi musoniki wa pfumu wa mbanza wálenda mu kukandisa mulumba-lumba wa batu amana wuzimbudi: «Bayakala ba ku Efeso, nati wukondi zaya ni mbanza ya Efeso yena tsinzidi wa nzu ya nzambi ya nzambi wa mukhetu Atedimisi yi kiteki kyandi kina kyátuka ku zilu? <verse eid="ACT 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36"/>Mambu mana, heku mutu wufwani kuketyakisama. Bulungi ni lwalembama amana luhangaku dyambu konda kuyindula. <verse eid="ACT 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37"/>Kikuma, bayakala baba lwisi bawu, basawudiku, batukwaniku phi nzambi ya betu wa mukhetu. <verse eid="ACT 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38"/>Yukani Temethiyusi yi banduku bandi ba kisalu benina yi dyambu dya mutu, bazusi benina, nganda phi yenina, ndangu benda funda! <verse eid="ACT 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39"/>Amana yukani dyambu dyahika lwenina dyawu, mboti lwanatadya ku nganda yina yifwani kuzengadya bwosu buna milombini mitsiku. <verse eid="ACT 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40"/>Kikuma, fwani batufunda ni mavwanga tulubudi kikuma kya mambu mana malutini lelu, mukuma heku kima kibati tuheka muswa wa kukhokama kwaku.» <verse eid="ACT 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41"/>Kunima kuzonza bwabuna, wámwangakya kibuka kyosu.<verse eid="ACT 19:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Kitambu kya Pholu ku Masetwani yi ku Ngelesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1"/>Buna yámanisa mvwalangani, Pholu wátedisa balonguki; kunima dya kubasyamisa, wábaheka mboti ya tsuka ndangu kenda ku Masetwani. <verse eid="ACT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2"/>Buna kálutila muna kinzunga meni kina, wátomasyamisa batu kwakuna, kunima wénda ku Ngelesi. <verse eid="ACT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3"/>Kázakala ngonda tatu kwakuna, muna tangwa dina kázola kukota mu masuwa ndangu kalabuka ku Sidiya, wáyuka ni Bayuta bámukasidi kifwandu; amana wábonga lukanu lwa kuvutukila muna nzila ya Masetwani. <verse eid="ACT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4"/>Hákala yi batu benda musindikila<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna masonuku mahika, báyika ni yi kuna Aziya (tsi yakhunda ya Aziya) </char></note>: Sophatela, mwana Philusi, mwisi Bele, Adisitadiki, Sekundusi mwisi Tesalonika, Kayusi mwisi Telebi, Thimoti, Tisiki yi Thofima bisi Aziya. <verse eid="ACT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5"/>Baba-baba batekila kwenda, amana bátuhingila kuna Thowasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6"/>Kwena betu phi, kunima kilumbu kya mapha makonda muvimbu, twálabuka tukidila ku Fidiphu. Kunima bilumbu bitanu, tubawani kuna Thowasi, kwakuna, twánanga bilumbu tsambwadi.<verse eid="ACT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitambu kya tsuka kya Pholu ku Thowasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7"/>Muna kilumbu kyatheti kya phosa<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kikuma kya Bayuta, kilumbu kyákala yandika mu tangwa dya kumi yi nana. Basoniki bahika babati zonzila ni mu "masikidika ma kiphosa"; bahika phi ni mu "masikidika ma lumingu". </char></note>, twákala bakutakana muna masikidika kikuma kya kubukuna dipha. Pholu, yandi mutu wákana ni kenda mu kilumbu kyalanda, kakala yambila yi batu bákala mu kimvuka. Amana wáleyisa kinzonzi tii yi muna kati kya phipha. <verse eid="ACT 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8"/>Mwinda mya lawu myákala ku mwanza wa ku zilu kuna twákala bakutakana. <verse eid="ACT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9"/>Kaasi ngunza mosi wákala hana wazakala hana thandu ya nela, khumbu yandi Etiki. Hanga kilu kyamuluku-luku kimukwati muna tangwa dina kakala zonza Pholu; wáhukumuka ku kilu, wátukidila kuna nzu ya tatu ya ku londi, wudilembini hana tsi. Buna benda ni bamuvumbula, bámuwana wufi kedi. <verse eid="ACT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10"/>Hanga Pholu wukulumukini, wázenzama hana kákala amana wámuzangula muna moku mandi; kunima wuzimbudi: «Lubangaku! Wamoya kenina!» <verse eid="ACT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11"/>Tangwa kátombuka, wábukuna dipha kikuma kya kudya, kunima kázonza hika tangwa dya kaleyi yikuna kwakhyela kuma, kunima dya bwana, wénda. <verse eid="ACT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12"/>Bámunata ngunza wuna wamoya, bwáhana kikesa kya lawu.<verse eid="ACT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Batukini ku Thowasi, bendi ku Mile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13"/>Kikuma kya betu, hanga thwendi theti mu masuwa yi kuna Asosi, kuna twafwana ni twamubongila Pholu. Yibwana káyidika, kikuma kazola ni kendila mu nzila ya mukhidi. <verse eid="ACT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14"/>Buna katuwana ku Asosi, twámukotisa mu masuwa amana thwénda ku Miteleni. <verse eid="ACT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15"/>Tuka kwakuna, twákangala mu yanga dya mbuta amana kilumbu kyálanda, twátula ku thwala Kiyo. Kilumbu kyalanda tutudi ku Samosi, amana ha kilumbu kyálanda<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna masonuku mahika báyika ni kunima munangu wumosi ku Thoziyoni. </char></note>, twátula ku Mile. <verse eid="ACT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16"/>Kikuma, Pholu kákana ni kalutila ku kabeta ka Efesu, ndangu kalutisaku tangwa dyakhatu mu Aziya. Tswalu kakala kwenda ndangu katula ku Yelusalemi mu kilumbu kya Phandikoti.<verse eid="ACT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu wuyambidi yi bambuta ba ku Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17"/>Buna bákala hana Mile, Pholu wátuma ni babatedisa malemba ku Efesu. <verse eid="ACT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18"/>Buna bátula kuna kákala yandi, wubazimbwadi: «Luzayibya mboti, benu, bikalulu byama ku thwala ya benu, tangwa dyosu, tuka kilumbu kyatheti, tangwa yidyata mu kinzunga kya Aziya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19"/>Yímusadila Pfumu, mu kudikulumuna, mu matsanga, ha kati dya bimeka bina byándatina bifwandu bya Bayuta. <verse eid="ACT 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20"/>Konda kusweka kima, yílusamwana amana yílulonga moosu mana menina mupfunu, ku thwala ya batu boosu yi muna nzu zenu. <verse eid="ACT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21"/>Yíbatendwala Bayuta yi Bangeleki ndangu basoba bikalulu, badihana kwena Nzambi amana bakwikila mwena Pfumu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22"/>Buthwena, meni wakukasa yenina kwena Kitembu, yendi ku Yelusalemi, konda kuzaya mana makwenda mbwila kwakuna. <verse eid="ACT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23"/>Kaasi nzayi kwama ni muna kosu mbanza yina, Kitembu kyatoma kisi tekilatsongila ni miyololu yi kiwayi bibati phingila kwakuna. <verse eid="ACT 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24"/>Kaasi meni luzingu lwama luhitiku mupfunu lawu. Kima kingyenina mupfunu lawu kutula yi kuna tsuka ya kisalu kyama yi kiyeka kápheka Pfumu Yesu: mu kuta kimbangi kya Musamu wa Bukheti wa khenda za Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25"/>«Buthwena nzayi mboti ni, meni, lwambonaku hika, benu boosu muna yíhitila mu kulonga Kipfumu kya Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26"/>Ihana ni thambwasibwa lelu kwena benu: wakasemi kwama yenina muna menga ma benu boosu. <verse eid="ACT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27"/>Mukuma yílusamwana moosu mana kázenga Nzambi, konda kuluswekila kima. <verse eid="ACT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28"/>Dikengenu benu-benu yi kwena kibuka kya mikoku<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Disongidila ni kimvuka kya bakidisitu. </char></note> mina káluhekila Kitembu Kyatoma khumbu ya bamvungi ba mikoku. Lundenu Dibundu dya Nzambi, dina kásumba mu menga mandi. <verse eid="ACT 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29"/>Nzayi mboti meni, ni kunima dya kwenda kwama, bakwisa kota hana kati dya benu bambwa-ngongu<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Disongidila ni batu bafwanana yi bambwa-ngongu (bambisi) ba nganzi. Benina balongi bana bisi longa malongi mambi. </char></note> ba nganzi bana banyókuna kibuka kya mikoku. <verse eid="ACT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30"/>Amana mu kati dya benu, batélama batu bahika bakwata zonza mambu ma luvunu ndangu bahungula balonguki kwena bawu. <verse eid="ACT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31"/>Yihana ni kengilenu, lwabambuka phi ni mu mvula tatu, phipha yi mwini, mu matsanga, yikalaku lembwa mu kululwengisa, kosu mutu, mana makwísa ku thwala.<verse eid="ACT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32"/>«Amana buthwena, yilusisi mu moku ma Nzambi yi muna ndinga ya khenda zandi. Yina yenina yi ngolu za kutunga yi kuhana bima bya bukheti kwena bana benina ba yandi. <verse eid="ACT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33"/>Yínekaku keti mbongu, keti wolu keti miledi mya mutu. <verse eid="ACT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34"/>Luzayibwa benu-benu: moku mama matsadisini mu kuvwa bima byosu yíkala byawu mupfunu yi kwena banduku bama. <verse eid="ACT 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35"/>Mu moosu, yílulonga ni mu kusala bwabuna lwabásadisila baphutu, mu kuyindulaka ndinga za Pfumu Yesu, yandi wázimbula yandi meni: "Kyesi kya lawu kyisi kala mu kukaba, keku ni mu kubonga!"» <verse eid="ACT 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36"/>Kunima kuzonza bwabuna, wáfukama kikuma kya kulombila ha kimosi yi bawu boosu. <verse eid="ACT 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37"/>Boosu mu bidilu, bámubumbakana Pholu amana bámuyamba. <verse eid="ACT 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38"/>Kyadi kya lawu bákala kyawu, kikuma kábazimbwala ni bamúmonaku hika. Kunima bénda musindikila yikuna masuwa.<verse eid="ACT 20:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Pholu wendi ku Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1"/>Bwosu twáhambwasana yi bawu, twásabuka, amana twátadisa ku zawala dya Khosi; kilumbu kyalanda, twátula ku Lodi, amana ha twákatuka kwakuna, thwénda ku Phatala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2"/>Buna twáwana kwakuna masuwa mana makala kwenda ku Fenisi; hanga tukoti mwamuna amana thwendi. <verse eid="ACT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3"/>Buna twátula bela-bela yi Siphe, twásisadya ku koku dya kimama, amana twálanda sambwa dya Sidiya, ndangu twatula ku Tidi kuna máfwana masuwa mu kutulula bima. <verse eid="ACT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4"/>Bwosu twáwana balonguki, twánanga kwakuna bilumbu tsambwadi. Baphangi, bálwengisa kwena Kitembu Kyatoma amana bázimbula kwena Pholu ni katombukaku ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5"/>Kaasi tangwa yáhita phosa meni yina, twálanda nzila yetu. Bénda tusindikila boosu yi bakhetu yi bana ba bawu yi kuna phenza ya mbanza; twáfukama kuna kabeta ka yanga dya mbuta amana twásambila. <verse eid="ACT 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6"/>Kunima dya kudiheka mboti za tsuka, twákota mu masuwa, bawu bávutuka kwabawu. <verse eid="ACT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7"/>Amana betu buna twámanisa kitambu kyetu mu mamba, thwénda tuka ku Tidi yikuna Tholemayasi. Kwakuna twábaheka baphangi mboti, hanga tunangi hika kilumbu kimosi yi bawu. <verse eid="ACT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8"/>Kilumbu kyálanda, twákatuka, thwénda ku Sezale. Hanga thwendi ku nzu ya Fidiphu wuna wákala musamuni wa Musamu wa Bukheti, yandi kákala mosi hana kati dya bayakala tsambwadi bana básola ku Yelusalemi, twánanga kuna nzu yandi. <verse eid="ACT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9"/>Kákala yi bandumba baya bana bakala bikula. <verse eid="ACT 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10"/>Bwosu twánanga kuna bilumbu byalawu, mbikudi mosi, khumbu yandi Hakabusi; wátuka ku Yuteya, wisa tula hakana. <verse eid="ACT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11"/>Hanga wisi kuna twákala betu, wubongi mukaba wa Pholu, amana wudikasi malu yi moku, kunima wuzimbudi: «Tala mana kázimbudini Kitembu Kyatoma: Mutu yandu wuvwi mukaba wawu, Bayuta, kuna Yelusalemi, yi bwabubu bamúkasa, ndangu bamulambula kwena baphani.» <verse eid="ACT 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12"/>Buna twáyuka bwabuna, betu yi bana bákala hakana, twámubokwadila Pholu ndangu katombukaku ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13"/>Hanga Pholu wuvutudi: «Kikuma kyabiki lubati didila yi kuphumuna mbundu? Meni yenina wayilama, ka kikuma kya kukhasa ku lwesi kaasi yi kikuma kya kufwila kuna Yelusalemi kikuma kya khumbu ya Pfumu Yesu.» <verse eid="ACT 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14"/>Bwosu kázolaku mu kutambwasa mana twakala muzimbwala betu, twákosikilaku hika ndinga amana tuzimbudini: «Yambula luzolu lwa Pfumu lwahangama!»<verse eid="ACT 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15"/>Ku manima ma kulutisa ndambu ya bilumbu kwakuna, twáyilama amana thwénda ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16"/>Ndambu ya balonguki ba ku Sezale bisa tusindikila yi kuna twafwana kuleka, kuna nzu ya Nasoni mwisi Siphe; wákala mukwikidi tukidila thama.<verse eid="ACT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu ku Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17"/>Mu kutula kwetu ku Yelusalemi, baphangi bátuyamba yi kyesi. <verse eid="ACT 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18"/>Kilumbu kyálanda, Pholu wátunata ku nzu ya Zyaki; amana malemba moosu mísa kwakuna. <verse eid="ACT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19"/>Wábaheka mboti amana wáyandika mu kutangumuna moosu mana káhanga Nzambi, mu nzila kisalu kyandi, ha kati dya baphani. <verse eid="ACT 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20"/>Ku manima ma kumuyuka, bámuzatula Nzambi. Hanga bamuzimbwadini: «Wumoni, phangi, keti makumi ma mafunda makwa ma Bayuta bakitukini bakwikidi; boosu babasi yi tsambu ya kuzitisa mitsiku. <verse eid="ACT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21"/>Kamba báyuka ni muna malongi maku, ngeyi wubati tuma Bayuta boosu bana bisi zingila mu kati dya makanda ndangu babwisa mitsiku mya Moyize; kamba bayótisaku hika bana, balundaku phi hika mikuku mya kikanda. <verse eid="ACT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22"/>Biki bifwani? Bayúka kaka ni wísikini. <verse eid="ACT 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23"/>Disongidila, sala kaka mana tukuzimbwadi. Henina ha kati dya betu yi bayakala baya básidiki lusilu. <verse eid="ACT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24"/>Babonga, disemisa ha kimosi yi bawu amana bafutila mbongu, ndangu badikulula mutwa. Hanga boosu bazáya ni heku kima kya kyedika muna khululuka yina báyukiki kikuma kya ngeyi, kaasi ngeyi phi wisi lunda mitsiku. <verse eid="ACT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25"/>Kikuma kya Baphani bana bakituki bakwikidi, betu, tumoniki ni mboti twabasonikina ni bayambula kudya mbisi batambiki kwena biteki, keti ba menga, yi bambisi ba bithitu, bayambula phi kindumba.»<verse eid="ACT 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26"/>Kilumbu kyalanda, Pholu wábonga batu meni babana, wádisemisa ha kimosi yi bawu amana wákota kuna nzu ya Nzambi mu kusamuna keti khi tangwa byamánisa bilumbu bya kudisemisa, keti khi tangwa phi batámbika kabu dya mosi yi mosi wa bawu.<verse eid="ACT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu bamukwati muna Nzu ya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27"/>Ku tsuka ya bilumbu bina tsambwadi, Bayuta ba ku kinzunga kya Aziya, bana bámumona mu nzu ya Nzambi, bálundika mulumba-lumba wa batu wosu amana bámukwata. <verse eid="ACT 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28"/>Bakala kalunga: «Bisi Kiseledi, tusadisenu! Mutu yandi, yandi wisi longa kwena boosu yi muma mwosu, mambu ma mbi matadidi betu Bayuta kikuma kya mitsiku mya Moyize yi kizika kyaki! Wukotisi phi bisi Ngeleki muna nzu ya Nzambi yi kusumunaka kizika kyaki kyatoma!» <verse eid="ACT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29"/>Mukuma ku luyandiku bámona Thofimi mwisi Efeso ha kimosi yi yandi muna mbanza ya Yelusalemi, amana bakala yindula ni Pholu wámukotisa mu nzu ya Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30"/>Mbanza yosu yekina mu mvwalangani, amana batu bálubuka muma mwosu. Bámukwata Pholu amana bámulubula mu nzu ya Nzambi, kunima dya bwabuna, báyafikila mwelu. <verse eid="ACT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31"/>Bwosu bakala sanda mu kumuhonda, kindanda kiditi kwena tudibeni<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tudibeni kenina Pfumu wa kibuka kya basuta funda dimosi ba Loma. Haha kenina hanga pfumu wa mbuta bibuka bya basuta khama tsambwadi ba Loma kuna Yelusalemi. </char></note> ni mvwalangani yikoti mu Yelusalemi dyosu. <verse eid="ACT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32"/>Muna mbala mosi, yandi wábonga baphumbulu yi basatudiyoni amana wákulumuka thinu. Buna bámona tudibeni yi baphumbulu, báyambula kumubeta Pholu. <verse eid="ACT 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33"/>Hanga tudibeni wubwesuki amana wásenda ni bamukwata amana bamukasa mu miyololu myodi. Kunima wáhyula keti nani kákala yi biki káhanga. <verse eid="ACT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34"/>Muna mulumba-lumba wa batu, kosu mutu kakala kalunga muna phila yandi amana pfumu wa baphumbulu funda ba Loma, kálendaku mu kuzaya kikuma kya kyedika muna mambu mana, wásenda ni bamunata ku Kaa dya baphumbulu<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaa dya baphumbulu: dyákala ku mazyokidi ma tangwa ma nzu ya Nzambi. Bisi Loma bakaladya sadila, Ka medina, kikuma kya kutanina nzu ya Nzambi. Mbala za hika, bakaladya bongila phi hanga boloku.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35"/>Buna kátula Pholu mu sikadiye, baphumbulu bámuthuta, kikuma kya mvwalangani ya mulumba-lumba wa batu, <verse eid="ACT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36"/>kikuma kibuka kya batu kyakala mulanda yi kukalungaka: «Kafwa!»<verse eid="ACT 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu wusambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37"/>Buna bázola kumukotisa mu Kaa dya basuta, Pholu wázimbula kwena tudibeni: «Pfwani yikuzimbwala dyambu?» Pfumu wa baphumbulu wumuvutwadi: «Wuzayiya kuzonza Ngeleki? <verse eid="ACT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38"/>Ka ngeyi ku mwisi Ngiphiti wuna wákotisa mvwalangani mu bilumbu bilutiki amana wátini mu nganga yi bandwandwa mafunda maya kikuma kya kunwanisa ngemba ya ku Loma?» <verse eid="ACT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39"/>Pholu wumuvutwadi: «Meni yenina Muyuta wa ku Talasi dya ku kinzunga kya Sidisi, yíbutukila mu mbanza yina yizayakani. Yikubokwadidi, pheka muswa wa kuzonza kwena batu.» <verse eid="ACT 21:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40"/>Pfumu wa baphumbulu funda ba Loma wámuheka muswa. Pholu, wátelama muna sikadiye, wusongidi kidimbu kuna koku kwena batu. Talala dyákota. Hanga wuzimbudi kwena bawu mu ndinga ya Bayuta:<verse eid="ACT 21:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1"/>«Baphangi bama yi batata bama, yukenu buthwena mana yenina mawu mu kuluzimbwala kikuma kya kudikutumuna kwama.» <verse eid="ACT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2"/>Buna báyuka ni kakala bazonzila mu ndinga ya Bayuta, talala dyekina hika dya lawu. Pholu wuzimbudini: <verse eid="ACT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3"/>«Meni, yenina Muyuta. Yíbutwakila ku Talasi muna kinzunga kya Sidisi; kaasi muna mbanza meni yayi tsatsukidini, ndongwakidi phi, muna malu ma Ngamadyedi, yandi wuna wándonga mboti-mboti mitsiku mya batata betu. Yíkala mutu wabasa yi tsambu yiluti kitesu kikuma kya Nzambi, bwosu lweninabwa benu boosu lelu. <verse eid="ACT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4"/>Yínyokuna yi kuna lufwa bana bakala landa Nzila yayi, mu kukwatisaka bakhetu yi bayakala yi kubakotisa mu boloku. <verse eid="ACT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5"/>Keti mbuta wa banganga Nzambi yi kibuka kya mbuta kya malemba bafwani mu kuta kimbangi kyama. Yítambula phi kuna moku ma bawu mikanda mya nzila kikuma kya baphangi ba bayuta bana bisi landa Nzila yayi kuna Tamasi. Yenda kwakuna ndangu yikwata bana bákala kuna amana yibanata ku Yelusalemi ndangu babaheka ndola.»<verse eid="ACT 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu wutendudini buna kábalwala mbundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6"/>«Mu nzila yíkala amana yikala bwesuka ku Tamasi, muna mbala mosi, muna mwinyakati, mitsyenzya mya lawu myátuka kuna zilu, myákyenzula homa hosu hana yíkala. <verse eid="ACT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7"/>Hanga mbwini ha tsi amana ngyuki ndinga yimosi yakala nzimbwala: "Sawulu, Sawulu, kikuma kya biki wubati ndyokwanina?" <verse eid="ACT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8"/>Hanga mvutudini: "Nati wenina ngeyi Pfumu?" Yandi wunzimbwadini: "Meni, yenina Yesu mwisi Nazaleti, wuna wubati nyokuna ngeyi." <verse eid="ACT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9"/>Bana bákala yi meni bámona mitsyenzya, kaasi bábakulayoku ndinga ya wuna wakala nzonzisa. <verse eid="ACT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10"/>Hanga nzimbudini: "Biki pfwani mu kuhanga, Pfumu?" Pfumu wunzimbwadini: "Telama, ndawenda kuna Tamasi, amana kwakuna bakúzimbwala moosu mana wufwana mu kuhanga." <verse eid="ACT 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11"/>Bwosu yikalaku mona hika, kikuma kya khembu ya mitsyenzya mina, bana bákala kumosi yi meni bátsimba kuna koku mu kundatisa, amana yítula ku Tamasi.<verse eid="ACT 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12"/>«Kinga hákala yi mutu mosi khumbu yandi Ananiya, mutu wakwikama mu mitsiku, wuna bakala hanina kimbangi kya mboti kwena Bayuta boosu bana bisi zingila kwakuna, <verse eid="ACT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13"/>wísa kwena meni amana wunzimbwadi: "Sawulu, phangi wama, mona hika!" Muna tangwa medina, ngyandiki kumona hika, amana yimumoni. <verse eid="ACT 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14"/>Amana wunzimbwadi hika: "Nzambi wa batata betu wákusola mu kuzaya luzolu lwandi, ndangu wamona mutu wa Masonga amana wayuka ndinga yandi. <verse eid="ACT 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15"/>Mukuma wakála mbangi kikuma kya yandi, ku thwala boosu, muna mambu mana wumonini yi mana wuyukini. <verse eid="ACT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16"/>Amana buthwena, biki wahánga? Telama, tambula mbotika, tumbula zina dya Pfumu ndangu wasukuka mu masumu maku."»<verse eid="ACT 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu wutendudini buna bámutuma kwena baphani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17"/>«Mu kuvutuka ku Yelusalemi, tangwa yikala lombila muna nzu ya Nzambi, mboni mbona mesu. <verse eid="ACT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18"/>Amana yimumoni Pfumu, wuna wánzimbwala: "Hanga tswatsu, katuka tswatsu ku Yelusalemi, mukuma batu bana batámbwasakyoku kimbangi kyaki wathíla." <verse eid="ACT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19"/>Meni mvutudini: "Pfumu, bazayi mboti ni yikala kwenda muna kosu nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta mu kusya yi kubetisa bana bisi kwikila mwena ngeyi. <verse eid="ACT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20"/>Amana tangwa bánokisa menga ma mbangi waku Kitsyeni, hana yíkala meni-meni, yíbatambwasa, yikala simba miledi mya batu bana bámuhonda<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Khaphu ya 7:58; 8:1.</char></note>." <verse eid="ACT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21"/>Hanga wunzimbwadini: «Ndawenda, meni yikútuma kwena baphani!"»<verse eid="ACT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu yi pfumu wa baphumbulu funda ba Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22"/>Bámuhyinikina tii yi kuna ndinga yayi; kaasi hanga bathuti ndinga amana bazimbudi: «Kafwa! Ka mboti ku mu kusisa mutu wa mutindu wawu ni kazinga mu tsi yayi!» <verse eid="ACT 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23"/>Bakala kalunga, kulosa miledi mya bawu yi kutimbulaka mufututu muna zilu. <verse eid="ACT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24"/>Tudibeni wásenda ni bamukotisa mu kaa dya baphumbulu amana bamubeta kikuma kya kumuzonzisa, ndangu bazaya kikuma kina bakala mukalwangina bwabuna kikuma kya yandi. <verse eid="ACT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25"/>Bwosu bakala mukasa yi tsibu, Pholu wázimbula kwena satudiyoni wuna wákala hana: «benu, lufwani kubetisa fimbu mwisi mbedi ya Loma yandu bakondi sambisa<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala disongidila dya kyufu kya Pholu muna khaphu ya 16:37. </char></note>?» <verse eid="ACT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26"/>Tangwa káyuka bwabuna, satudiyoni wenda menika kwena tudibeni, wumuzimbwadi: «Biki wahánga? Mudyambu mutu yandu kenina mwisi Loma!» <verse eid="ACT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27"/>Tudibeni wísa kwena Pholu amana wumuzimbwadi: «Nzimbwala, ngeyi, mwisi Loma wenina?» «Eeh», wuvutudi bwabuna. <verse eid="ACT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28"/>Tudibeni wuvutwakidi hika: «Meni, mu mbongu za lawu yíbongila muswa wawu!» Pholu wuvutudini: «Meni, tukidila lubutuku lwama.<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yísumba mu mbongu za lawu: Mu mitindu mitatu myáfwana mu kukituka mwisi Loma: </char><char style="fp" closed="false">1. Kubutuka, yuka ni bibuti byaku byawu byodi mu menga ma Loma benina. 2. Lufutu lwa kisalu kimosi kina wásala kuna Loma, amana phi batu boosu bana bisikwa zingila bátambwasakya. 3. Kufuta kwa mbongu za lawu. </char></note>» <verse eid="ACT 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29"/>Muna tangwa medina, batu bana bázola mu kumuzonzisa, báhaluka kyana; amana tudibeni wáyuka bweya, kikuma kya buna kábakula ni mwisi Loma wuna kakasisikini.<verse eid="ACT 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu ku thwala kimvuka kyambuta kya Bayuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30"/>Kilumbu kyalanda, mu kusanda kazaya kyedika kina bakala mufundila, Pholu, kwena Bayuta, wámukutwamisa misinga amana wásenda kwena bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi kimvuka kyosu mu kukutakana; kunima, wámukulumuna Pholu amana wámusya kuna thwala ya bawu.<verse eid="ACT 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1"/>Pholu wábatala kuna mbunzu batu bákala ha mbasi, wuzimbudi: «Baphangi bama, kikuma kya meni, yi katsatsa ka bukheti kosu yisi zingila ku mesu ma Nzambi, yi kuna lelu dyadi.» <verse eid="ACT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2"/>Mbuta wa banganga Nzambi Ananiya<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ananiya yandu, mbuta wa banganga Nzambi kákala tukidila mu mvula ya 47 yi kuna mvula ya 59. </char></note> wásenda kwena bana bákala bela-bela yi yandi ni bamubetila ku munwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3"/>Hanga Pholu wumuzimbwadi: «Nzambi wakúbeta ngeyi, kibaka basiti phemba<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bibaka bya bisi Phalesitini byákala bya kunenga mu phembi kikuma kya kubwisisa ni batu basimbabya nana mu phipha. Bwosu bázonzila mazyamu mu mukanda wa Mth 23:27. Kibaka básita phemba disongidila ni "mutu wambi".</char></note>! Ngeyi wenina wasikuka haka kikuma kya kupfundisa buna bulombi mitsiku yi mana matadidiku mitsiku, wubati senda ni bambeta!» <verse eid="ACT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4"/>Bana bákala bela-bela yi yandi bázimbula: «Wubati tukwana mbuta wa banganga Nzambi!» <verse eid="ACT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5"/>Pholu wuvutudi: «Nzayikiku, baphangi bama, ni mbuta wa banganga Nzambi kákadiki. Kikuma, básonika bwabu muna Masonuku: "Wazónzilaku mbi ya pfumu wa kanda dyaku!"»<verse eid="ACT 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6"/>Bwosu kázaya ni ha kati dya kimvuka kyambuta hákala yi Basadise yi Bafwadisi, hanga Pholu wuyandiki kukalunga: «Baphangi bama, meni yenina Mufwadisi, mwana wa Bafwadisi! Yukani meni babati pfundisa, kikuma kya kivuvu mu lufutumuku lwa bamvumbi.» <verse eid="ACT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7"/>Tangwa kázonza bwabuna, ngyuma zábwa hana kati dya Bafwadisi yi Basadise, amana kimvuka kyádikabisa. <verse eid="ACT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8"/>Kikuma Basadise, bawu, bisi zimbula ni kweku lufutumuku, keti wanzyo, keti kitembu kaasi Bafwadisi, bawu, bisi kwikila muna byosu bina. <verse eid="ACT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9"/>Báthuta hika ndinga, hanga ndambu ya balongi ba mitsiku bana bákala ku mukanzu wa Bafwadisi bátelama amana bábwisa mu ndinga ya ngolu: «Tumoniku keti mbi mwena mutu yandu. Amana yukani kitembu kondilo wanzyo wumuzonzidikini!» <verse eid="ACT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10"/>Bwosu zakala vula ngyuma, tudibeni wáyuka bweya ni bamubukununa nana Pholu, hanga wusendi kwena baphumbulu bandi ni bakulumuka amana bamukatula Pholu ha kati dya bawu amana bamukotisa mu kati dya kaa dya baphumbulu. <verse eid="ACT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11"/>Phipha yalanda, Pfumu wisa mulubwakila amana wuzimbudi: «Kikesa! Bwosu buna wuthidi kimbangi ku Yelusalemi, bwabuna phi wánata kimbangi ku Loma.»<verse eid="ACT 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kifwandu kikuma kya Pholu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12"/>Tangwa kwakya kuma, Bayuta bákasa kifwandu amana balabi ni badyáku, banwáku phi keti kima yukani khaku kedi bamuhonda Pholu. <verse eid="ACT 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13"/>Bakasi ba kifwandu kina bákala thalu kuluta makumaya. <verse eid="ACT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14"/>Bénda bamona bapfumu ba banganga Nzambi yi bambuta ba dibundu ndangu babazimbwala: «Tudikini thiti ni twadyáku kedi kima yukani khaku bamuhonda Pholu. <verse eid="ACT 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15"/>Buthwena, benu, yukanenu yi bakwa mukanzu wambuta ndangu balomba kwena tudibeni, ni bamukulumuna Pholu ku thwala ya benu. Hanga mbedi ni lubati zola lwalonguka yi masingitini dyambu dyandi. Amana betu, hanga tuswamini ndangu twamuhonda konda katula kedi.»<verse eid="ACT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16"/>Kaasi mwana khasi wa Pholu wáyuka kuzonzila kifwandu mekina amana wénda kuna kaa dya baphumbulu, wákota kwakuna mu kumuzimbwala Pholu. <verse eid="ACT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17"/>Pholu wátela mosi wa basatudiyoni amana wumuzimbwadi: «Munata mwana yakala yandi kwena tudibeni, mukuma kenina yi ndinga ya kumuzimbwala.» <verse eid="ACT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18"/>Satudiyoni wuna wámubonga, wámunata phi kwena tudibeni amana wuzimbudi: «Pholu wuna wenina mu boloku, káthedini amana wundombi ni yisa kunatina mwana yakala yandi wenina yi ndinga ya kukuzimbwala.» <verse eid="ACT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19"/>Tudibeni wámusimba muna koku, wénda ku phengu amana wámuhyula: «Biki wuzodi wanzimbwala?» <verse eid="ACT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20"/>Yandi wávutula: «Bayuta báyukani ndangu bakulomba ni mbasi wamúkulumuna Pholu ku thwala kimvuka kyambuta, hanga mbedi ni yandi zodi kalonguka mboti dyambu dyandi. <verse eid="ACT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21"/>Kaasi ngeyi, wubayukilaku, mukuma, batu kuluta makumaya, hana kati dya bawu, bamúleka mutambu. Bádikini thiti ni badyaku kima keti kunwa yuka ni khaku kedi bamuhonda Pholu. Buthwena, bayilama benina amana dibanza dya ngeyi babati hingila.» <verse eid="ACT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22"/>Kunima dya kumukandikisa mwana yakala wuna ni kamenikinaku kwena mutu, mambu mana kámuzimbwala, hanga tudibeni wumuvutudini.<verse eid="ACT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu bamuhitiki ku Sezale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23"/>Kunima, tudibeni wátedisa basatudiyoni boodi amana wubazimbwadi: «Bongenu baphumbulu khama zoodi yi bakwawu makumi tsambwadi bana bisi zanza ha thandu ya baphunda yi bakwawu hika khama zoodi bana benina yi madyonga ndangu bayilama mu kukwenda ku Sezale mu tangwa dya vwa dya phipha. <verse eid="ACT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24"/>Yidikenu phi baphunda kikuma kya kumunatina Pholu kwena pfumu wa kinzunga Fidikisi<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Atonyusi Fidikisi: yandi wákala pfumu wa mbanza mu kinzunga kya Yuteya ha kati dya mvula 52 yi 59 holo 60. </char></note>.» <verse eid="ACT 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25"/>Hanga wusoniki kisyati bwabu: <verse eid="ACT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26"/>«Kodiyusi Dizyasi, kwena mutu wa mayedi pfumu wa kinzunga Fidikisi, mboti. <verse eid="ACT 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27"/>Mutu yandu, Bayuta bámukwati, amana bázodikini ni bamuhonda wadi yendiku yakidilaka yi kibuka kya baphumbulu bama; ngyukiki ni mwisi mbedi ya Loma kenina. <verse eid="ACT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28"/>Bwosu nzodikini mu kuzaya kikuma kina bakamufundilaka, yímukulumuna kuna thwala ya kimvuka kya bawu kyambuta. <verse eid="ACT 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29"/>Mbakisi ni muna mambu matadidi mitsiku mya bawu bakadi mufundila, kaasi hákalaku keti kima kifwani kumunatina lufwa holo miyololu. <verse eid="ACT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30"/>Buna bándwengisiki ni bakasi kifwandu kikuma kya mutu yandu, yikuhitiki yandi mbala mosi, yibazimbwadiki bana bamufundiki, ni benda mufunda kwena ngeyi.» <verse eid="ACT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31"/>Baphumbulu báhanga bwosu kituma kina bátambula, bámubonga Pholu amana bámunata phipha-phipha yikuna Atiphatisi. <verse eid="ACT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32"/>Kilumbu kyálanda, bávutuka ku kaa dya baphumbulu básisa lwesi bakwa baphunda mu kukwenda yi Pholu. <verse eid="ACT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33"/>Buna bátula ku Sezale, hanga bahani mukanda kwena pfumu wa mbanza amana bamusongidi yandi Pholu. <verse eid="ACT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34"/>Kunima dya kutanga mukanda, pfumu wa kinzunga wumuhyudi Pholu keti mwisi khi kinzunga kákala. Buna káyuka ni mwisi Sidisi kákala, <verse eid="ACT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35"/>hanga wumuzimbwadini: «Yikuyuka nana tangwa bakwísa bana bákufundikini.» Amana wásenda ni bamuphatila mu nganda ya Eloti<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzu meni yina, bátungilaya kuna Sezale kwena Eloti wambuta amana pfumu wa mbanza ya Loma wásolaya hanga nzu yandi ya luyalu. </char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Bayuta bamufundi Pholu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1"/>Kunima bilumbu bitanu, nganga Nzambi wa mbuta Ananiya wákulumuka ku Sezale ha kimosi yi ndambu ya malemba yi nganzi mosi, khumbu yandi Teditulusi. Bámufunda Pholu kwena pfumu wa kinzunga Fidikisi<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fidikisi: Yandi wuna bazonzidini mu khaphu ya 23:24 yi kisona kina banamikikwa. </char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2"/>Bámutedisa Pholu amana Teditulusi wáyandika mu kumufunda bwabu: «Pfumu, kikuma kya kisalu kyaku yi buna wubati yidikila mambu ma tsi yayi, hahana thwenina yi ngemba ya singu yayi. <verse eid="ACT 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3"/>Thwisibya zaya kosu tangwa yi muma mwosu yi mbundu yimosi, pfumu wambuta Fidikisi. <verse eid="ACT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4"/>Kaasi, mukusya ni yikuhitisaku tangwa ngeyi, yikubokwadidi ni watambwasa mu kutuhinikina yi kyesi kyosu muna koma ka tangwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5"/>Kikuma tumoniki ni, mutu yandu kenina mvwanzi. Ngyuma kisi sanda hana kati dya Bayuta boosu, hana tsi yina bisi zingila; kenina mutwadisi wa dingumba dya bisi Nazaleti<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bisi Nazaleti: muhowu wawu, bisiwa sadila kikuma kya bakidisitu bana batheti amana muna Mth 21:11 bázonzilawa kikuma kya Yesu. Kaasi kuna káwanawa Mathayi, kuzayakaniku. </char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6"/>Kázodiki phi ni kasumuna nzu ya Nzambi, hahana twámukwatidini. [Tuzodiki ni twamufungwasa bwosu mibati lombila mitsiku myetu, <verse eid="ACT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7"/>kaasi Dizyasi pfumu wa baphumbulu wisi yakidila amana wumubotudi mu moku ma betu, <verse eid="ACT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8"/>hangi tutumi thwisa mufunda ku thwala ya ngeyi<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bisona byabi byenina mu khunga, tukidila ku tsuka ya nzila ya 6 yi kuna luyandiku lwa nzila ya 8, byeninamwoku mu masonuku ma lawu mana ma khulu. </char></note>.] Wufwani kumuhyula ngemeni, ndangu wazikisa moosu mana tubati mufundila.» <verse eid="ACT 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9"/>Bayuta boosu bátambwasa hanga mbedi ni bwa bukheti bwákala bwabuna.<verse eid="ACT 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu wusambi kwena pfumu Fidikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10"/>Kunima dya kumusongila mu kidimbu ndangu kazonza kwena pfumu wa kinzunga, Pholu wátambula ndinga, wuzimbudini: «Nzayibwa ni tukidila ndambu ya mvula za lawu wenina zusi wa tsi yayi, yi kivuvu kyosu yisámbila ku mesu ma ngeyi. <verse eid="ACT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11"/>Bwosu wufwani wazikisabwa ngeyi-meni, khaku kedi hahita bilumbu kumi yi byodi, tukidila buna yitombukidi ku Yelusalemi mu kufukamina Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12"/>Bángwanaku keti muna nzu ya Nzambi, keti muna nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta, keti muna mbanza ni mbati finda phaka yi mutu kondilo kulundika mulumba-lumba wa batu. <verse eid="ACT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13"/>Baléndaku, buthwena bwabu, mu kukusongila kima kina babati pfundila. <verse eid="ACT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14"/>Kaasi, nzayibwa ku thwala ya ngeyi ni muna Nzila meni yayina, babati tela bawu ni yambi, mwamuna phi yisi sambidila Nzambi wa batata betu; yisi kwikila phi muna mambu mana básonika mu Mitsiku yi Bambikudi. <verse eid="ACT 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15"/>Yenina yi kivuvu mwena Nzambi, bawu meni phi bazayibwa ni lufutumuku lwakála kikuma kya batu ba masonga yi batu ba mbi. <verse eid="ACT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16"/>Yihakana, meni phi, yisi sila ngolu ni yikala yi katsatsa ka bukheti, ku mesu ma Nzambi keti kwena batu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17"/>«Kunima mvula za lawu yísa ku Yelusalemi mu kuhana mulambu wa khenda kikuma kya batu ba tsi yama yi kutambika makabu kwena Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18"/>Hahana bángwana mu nzu ya Nzambi. Wakasemi, konda kulumbika batu keti mvwalangani. <verse eid="ACT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19"/>Kaasi ndambu ya Bayuta lwesi bátuka ku Aziya bákala hana, bawu bafwaniki kwisa telama ku thwala ngeyi mu kupfunda, yukani kima benina kyawu kitadidi meni. <verse eid="ACT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20"/>Kondilo, baba bazimbula keti khi kifu bakhwatiki kyawu tangwa batsambisiki ku thwala ya kibuka kyambuta. <verse eid="ACT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21"/>Akolu yakala ndinga yina yíthuta, wa mutendendi kuna thwala bawu: "Kikuma kya lufutumuku lwa bafwa, meni, tsambidi lelu, ku thwala ya benu!"»<verse eid="ACT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22"/>Fidikisi, yandi, wátekila dizayila mambu mana matadidi Nzila, wávutulakya kinzonzi mu kilumbu kyahika. Wubazimbwadi: «Tangwa kakwísa tudibeni Dizyasi, hanana yítaladya dyambu dya benu.» <verse eid="ACT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23"/>Kásenda kwena satudiyoni ni kamutalaka amana kamusisila ndambu ya tangwa dya kusala luzolu lwandi, konda kukandikisa ni bakwawu khunda bamusadisa.<verse eid="ACT 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu ku thwala ya Fidikisi yi Thusila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24"/>Kunima dya ndambu ya bilumbu, Fidikisi wísa yi mukhetu wandi Thusila<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Thusila: mwana mukhetu watsuka wa kyamvu Eloti Angidipha (khaphu ya 12:1); Fidikisi wámuyiba kwena yakala dyandi wuna watheti, kyamvu Emesi. </char></note>, wuna wákala muyuta. Amana wátuma ni benda mubonga Pholu. Wámuhinikina buna kakala zonzila mambu matadidini lukwikilu mwena Yesu Kidisitu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25"/>Kaasi bwosu kakala zonzila, pholu, mu mambu matadidi khadidi ya masonga yi kusipha kwa mbundu yi pfundusu yina yakwísa, Fidikisi, bweya bwámukwata, wumuzimbwadi: «Buthwena, awenda kwaku; Ha yimóna tangwa, yikútedisa.» <verse eid="ACT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26"/>Kakala yi kivuvu ni ngatu Pholu makuta kamuheka; yihana kakala muzyetisila ndangu basolulaka yi yandi. <verse eid="ACT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27"/>Mvula zodi záhita bwabuna, kunima Fidikisi bámuhingana kwena Phokuyusi Fesitusi. Bwosu kázola ni kabasephidisa Bayuta, Fidikisi wámusisa Pholu muna boloku.<verse eid="ACT 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Pholu wulombi kenda samba kwena Khayisala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1"/>Tangwa káyandika Fesitusi kisalu muna kinzunga, bilumbu bitatu byáhita. Wákatuka ku Sezale mu kukwenda ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2"/>Bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi bapfumu ba Bayuta bisa mufunda Pholu kwena yandi. Bakala mubokwadila <verse eid="ACT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3"/>mu kulomba lusadisu lwa kumutedisa ku Yelusalemi. Bakala mukasila fwongu balenga muhondila mu nzila. <verse eid="ACT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4"/>Kaasi Fesitusi wávutula ni Pholu mu boloku dya ku Sezadi kákala amana ka thama ku, yandi meni kákhana vutukisa kuna Sezadi. <verse eid="ACT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5"/>Hanga wuyikini: «Bambuta, hana kati dya benu, bakulumuka yi meni; amana yukani mutu meni wuna dyambu dya mbi káhanga, bamufunda.» <verse eid="ACT 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6"/>Fesitusi kánangaku bilumbu nana keti kumi kwena bawu, kunima wávutuka ku Sezale. Kilumbu kyalanda, wásikuka kuna nganda ya bazusi amana wásenda ni bisa yandi Pholu. <verse eid="ACT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7"/>Buna kátula Pholu, Bayuta bana bátuka ku Yelusalemi bámuzyeta amana bámukasila misamu mya lawu mya mbi mina balendaku keti bawu meni mu kubangumuna. <verse eid="ACT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8"/>Kaasi Pholu wádikutumuna mu kuzimbula: «Tsumuniku kima, keti mu mutsiku wa Bayuta, keti mana matadidi nzu ya Nzambi, keti mana matadidi Khayisala.»<verse eid="ACT 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9"/>Bwosu kázola Fesitusi mu kusephidisa Bayuta, hanga wuhyudi kwena Pholu: «Wutambwasi mu kutombuka ku Yelusalemi ndangu wenda samba dyambu meni dina ku thwala ya meni?» <verse eid="ACT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10"/>Pholu wuvutudini: «Watelama yenina ha mbasi ya bazusi ya Khayisala, amana kwakuku kwa fwani batsambisila. Phangiku kima kyambi kwena Bayuta, bwosu wuzayididibwa ngeyi-meni. <verse eid="ACT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11"/>Yukani mu kibela yenina, kina kifwani kundatina lufwa, mbwisiku kufwa. Kaasi yukani mweku dyambu dya mukwandi muna moosu mana babati pfundila batu baba, heku mutu wenina yi muswa wa kundambula kwena bawu. Ihana ni ndombi mu kukwenda samba kwena Khayisala.» <verse eid="ACT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12"/>Hanga Fesitusi, kunima kuyambila yi batu bandi, wuvutudi: «Bwosu wulombikibwa ngeyi meni mu kukwenda samba kwena Khayisala, wakwénda phi kuna thwala Khayisala.»<verse eid="ACT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu ku thwala Angidipha yi Belenisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13"/>Kunima ndambu ya bilumbu, kyamvu Angidipha yi Belenisi bátula kuna Sezale ndangu bamuheka mboti Fesitusi<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Angidipha: kenina kyamvu Angidipha wa zodi, mwana wa kyamvu wuna babati zonzila muna khaphu ya 12. Yandi wákala kyamvu wa kinzunga kya Kadisisi, kina kyenina ku londi dya Phalesitini, yi milambu myahika. </char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14"/>Bwosu bálutisa ndambu ya bilumbu kwakuna, Fesitusi wámenika dyambu dya Pholu kwena kyamvu, mu kuzimbula: «Fidikisi mutu mosi kasala kwatisa muna boloku. <verse eid="ACT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15"/>Buna yenda ku Yelusalemi, bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi bambuta ba Bayuta bámufunda mu kulomba ndola ya yandi. <verse eid="ACT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16"/>Yíbavutwala ni bisi Loma bisiku kala yi kikalulu kya kulambula mutu mosi, konda kukhundikisa musambi yi bafundi amana kabonga tangwa dya kudikutumuna ku mambu ma bawu mana mabati muyangisa. <verse eid="ACT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17"/>Hanga bísa yi kwaku nzila mosi yi meni. Konda kuhitisa tangwa, kilumbu meni kina kyalanda, nzakadi kuna nganda ya bazusi, amana tsendi ni bamunata mutu wuna. <verse eid="ACT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18"/>Tangwa bátelama bafundi bandi, bamufundaku keti mu dyambu dimosi dya mbi dina yikala mubanzila meni. <verse eid="ACT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19"/>Phaka lwesi bakala findana kikuma kya mambu ma bunzambi bwa bawu yi kikuma kya mutu mosi wuna bisi tela Yesu, wáfwa amana Pholu kisi tambwasa ni moya kenina. <verse eid="ACT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20"/>Kwena meni, yíkala tsukungu ku thwala ya dyambu dya mutindu wuna, yímuhyula ni yuka katónda mu kukwenda ku Yelusalemi ndangu benda musambisila dyambu meni dina kwakuna. <verse eid="ACT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21"/>Kaasi Pholu wálomba, ndangu dyambu dyandi bazengiladya kwena pfumu wa mbuta wa Loma. Hangi phani muswa ni bamusya mu boloku yikuna yimúhitikila kwena Khayisala.» <verse eid="ACT 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22"/>Angidipha wuzimbudi kwena Fesitusi: «Meni phi, yitonda kumuhinikina mutu meni wuna.» Fesutusi wumuvutwadini: «Mbasi wamúhinikina.»<verse eid="ACT 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23"/>Kilumbu kyalanda, Angidipha yi Belenisi bátula yi lukumu lwosu amana bákota muna suku dya nganda, kumosi yi batudibeni yi batu ba luzitu ba mu mbanza. Bisa yandi Pholu, bwosu kásenda Fesitusi. <verse eid="ACT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24"/>Hanga Fesitusi wuzimbudini: «Kyamvu Angidipha, yi benu boosu lwenina haka kumosi yi betu, talenu mutu yandu bisa funda kwena meni! Kibuka kyosu kya Bayuta, kwakala ku Yelusalemi, kwakala kwaku, boosu babati kalunga ni káfwanaku hika mu kuzinga. <verse eid="ACT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25"/>Kwena meni, yímona ni kahangiku keti kima kafwani kufwila. Kaasi bwosu kálombi yandi meni ni pfumu wa mbuta wa Loma kenda musambisa, meni phi yímonibwa bukheti mu kumuhitika yandi. <verse eid="ACT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26"/>Bwosu yeku yi dyambu dya tsikiningi pfwani yimusonikina pfumu wa mbuta mu mana mamutadi; yimutelamisi ku thwala ya benu, theti kwena ngeyi kyamvu Angidipha, ndangu kunima dya byufu byaku, yibonga kima kya kusonika. <verse eid="ACT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27"/>Mukuma, mbonibwoku bukheti mu kuhitika mutu wa boloku konda kutendula dyambu dina babati mufundila.»<verse eid="ACT 25:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Pholu wusambini ku thwala Angidipha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1"/>Angidipha<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Khaphu ya 25:13. </char></note> wázimbula kwena Pholu: «Tendula dyambu dyaku.» Hanga Pholu wáthuta koku kuna zilu, amana wáyandika mu kusamba: <verse eid="ACT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2"/>«Mu kyesi yenina, kyamvu Angidipha, mu kusamba lelu ku thwala ya ngeyi kikuma kya mambu moosu mana bisi pfundila Bayuta, <verse eid="ACT 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3"/>mukuma wuzayimya bukheti, mikiku mya Bayuta yi phaka za bawu. Yikubokwadidi ni wangyuka yi sipha dya mbundu.<verse eid="ACT 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4"/>«Bayuta boosu bazayilwa luzingu lwama buna lwákala tuka kileki; yi buna yízingila tukidila luyandiku ha kati dya tsi yama, kuna Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5"/>Banzayi tuka thama amana bafwani mu kuta kimbangi, yuka batyebwa, ni yízingila hanga Mufwadisi, muna dingumba dina dyákala yi nziki-nziki ya kulunda bunzambi bwetu kuluta batu boosu. <verse eid="ACT 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6"/>Amana, buthwena, babati tsambisa kikuma kivuvu kyama kyenina muna kilangi kina kásila Nzambi kwena batata betu. <verse eid="ACT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7"/>Kilangi kina bisi sila mbundu bikanda byetu kumi yi byodi, bisi sungamina phipha yi mwini ni kilangi kina kyalúngila. Kikuma kya kivuvu mekina, oh kyamvu, babati pfundila kwena Bayuta! <verse eid="ACT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8"/>Kikuma kya biki lwisiku kwikidila ni Nzambi kisi futumuna bafwa? <verse eid="ACT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9"/>Meni-meni yikala banza theti ni bwáfwana mu kunwanisa mu phila yosu khumbu ya Yesu mwisi Nazaleti. <verse eid="ACT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10"/>Yibwana yíhanga ku Yelusalemi. Yíkotisa mu boloku, meni-meni, bakwikidi lawu, muna hamu dina yíbonga kwena bambuta ba banganga Nzambi; amana tangwa bakala zola kubahonda, meni yikala hana mukhala wama. <verse eid="ACT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11"/>Muna nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta zoosu, yikala hita mu kunyokuna bakwikidi ndangu balewula lukwikilu lwa bawu. Khabu za mukwandi zina yíkala zawu kikuma kya bawu, yikala banyokuna yi muna mbanza za kinzenza.»<verse eid="ACT 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Meni dya Pholu kábalwamina mbundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12"/>«Yi bwabuna yikala kwendila ku Tamasi yi hamu yi muswa wuna bápheka bambuta ba banganga Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13"/>Kilumbu kimosi, muna kati kya mwini, oh kyamvu, yímona muna nzila, myesi mimosi myátuka kuna zilu; mitsyenzya meni mina, mikenzudi hana yíkala meni hosu yi batu bana bakala kwenda tsindikila. Myakala kedyamina kuluta tangwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14"/>Betu boosu twabwa ha tsi, amana yíyuka ndinga yimosi yakala nzimbwala muna ndinga ya Bayuta: "Sawulu, Sawulu, kikuma kya biki wisi ndyokwanina? Phasi bwena kikuma kya ngeyi mu kutsitanana meni. Hanga kibulu bathumbikidi muhangu kwena pfumu wandi." <verse eid="ACT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15"/>Meni mvutudini: "Nati wenina ngeyi Pfumu?" Pfumu wumvutwadi: "Meni, yenina Yesu wuna wubati nyokuna ngeyi. <verse eid="ACT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16"/>Kaasi vumbuka, telama. Tala kikuma kina yikulubwakidini; yítekilakusola mu kukala musadi yi mbangi wa mambu mana wumoni kwena meni yi kikuma kya mana yikúsongila hika. <verse eid="ACT 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17"/>Yikútanina ha kati dya kanda dyadi dya bayuta yi kwena Baphani kuna yikutumini meni. <verse eid="ACT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18"/>Kikuma kya kubatemuna mesu, ndangu bakatuka mu phipha amana bisa ku mwini; bakatuka mu hamu dya Satana amana bisa kwena Nzambi. Amana yuka ni bakwíkila mwena meni, batámbula ndoluka ya masumu ma bawu yi ndambu ya kuvwa ha kati dya bana básolama."»<verse eid="ACT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu wuzonzidini muhangu wandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19"/>«Yi bwabuna, kyamvu Angidipha, yíkolamaku ku mbona mesu yina yátuka ku zilu. <verse eid="ACT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20"/>Kaasi kwena bisi Tamasi theti, yi ku Yelusalemi, yi muna Yuteya dyosu, yi kwena Baphakanu, yísamuna ni bulungi basoba bikalulu amana bisa kwena Nzambi, yi mihangu mina mibati songila ni basobi bikalulu. <verse eid="ACT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21"/>Yi kyakina kikuma bákhwatila Bayuta kuna nzu ya Nzambi, bámeka phi kuphondila. <verse eid="ACT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22"/>Kaasi bwosu kátsweka Nzambi, yízingila yi kuna lelu dyadi amana mbati ta kimbangi ku thwala baleki yi bambuta, konda kuzimbula kima kyahika katula lwesi mana básamuna bambikudi yi Moyize: <verse eid="ACT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23"/>Kidisitu wáfwana mu kunyokuka, amana wáfwana kukala watheti mu kufutumuka ha kati dya bafwa, káfwana mu kusamuna mwini kwena Bayuta yi Baphani.»<verse eid="ACT 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu wumulombi ni Angidipha kakwikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24"/>Bwosu kakala samba bwabuna, Fesitusi wákalunga: «Kilawu wenina, Pholu! Kulonguka kwa lawu kukukitudi kilawu!» <verse eid="ACT 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25"/>Pholu wávutula: «Yeku kilawu, mbuta-mutu Fesitusi; zenina ndinga za kyedika, za mupfunu phi zina yisi zimbula. <verse eid="ACT 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26"/>Kyamvu wuzayima yi tsikiningi mambu mana, amana yibatibwa muzimbwala yi singu dyosu. Mukuma khwikidini ni kazimbakaniku kima, kikuma moosu mana máhangaminaku mu kitsweki. <verse eid="ACT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27"/>Kyamvu Angidipha, wisi kwikila mwena bambikudi? Nzayi mboti ni wisi kwikila mwena bawu!» <verse eid="ACT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28"/>Angidipha wázimbula kwena Pholu: «Ka thama ku wakhwíkisa amana wákhitula mukidisitu!» <verse eid="ACT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29"/>Pholu wávutula: «Kwasala tangwa dya khunda holo dya lawu, yizóla ni, yuka ni Nzambi katyabwa, hakalaku lwesi ngeyi kaasi yi boosu bana babati phinikina lelu, lwakituka bwosu yenina meni; katula lwesi miyololu myami.»<verse eid="ACT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30"/>Hanga kyamvu Angidipha, pfumu wa kinzunga Fesitusi, Belenisi yi boosu bana bázakala kumosi yi bawu bátelama. <verse eid="ACT 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31"/>Mu kuyekuka, bakala dizimbwala bawu yi bawu: «Mutu wuna kahangiku kima kyamunatina lufwa kondilo boloku.» <verse eid="ACT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32"/>Angidipha, kikuma kya yandi, wázimbula kwena Fesitusi: «Mutu wuna, bakhani muyambwadila, wadi kálombikiku ni bamuzengila mukanu kwena Khayisala.»<verse eid="ACT 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Pholu bamuhitiki ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1"/>Bwosu dyákala ni thwedila mu masuwa ku Kitadi, bamuhani Pholu yi batu bahika ba boloku ha moku ma satudiyoni mosi khumbu yandi Zudiwusi, wákala mu kibuka kya baphumbulu kina bakala tela «kibuka kya baphumbulu Okisiti.» <verse eid="ACT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2"/>Buna twákota muna masuwa mamosi mátuka ku Andalamiti, makala kwenda ku mbungu ya kinzunga kya Aziya, hanga thwendi. Hana kati dya betu hákala yi Adisitadiki mwisi Masetwani wa ku Tesalonika. <verse eid="ACT 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3"/>Kilumbu kyalanda, twátula ku Sitoni. Zudiwusi, yandi wakala musadisa Pholu yi maweti moosu; wámusenda mu kwenda kinda banduku bandi ndangu kabonga bina kenina byawu mupfunu. <verse eid="ACT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4"/>Ha twákatuka hakana, twáhitila ku mukinda wa zawala dya Siphe, kikuma pfunzi yakala kwisa kuna twakala kwendila betu. <verse eid="ACT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5"/>Kunima dya kusabuka yanga dya mbuta bela-bela yi Sidisi yi Phafidiya, twátula ku Mila dya Disi. <verse eid="ACT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6"/>Kuna, satudiyoni káwana masuwa ma ku Alekizandi makala kwenda ku Kitadi, amana wátukotisa mwamuna. <verse eid="ACT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7"/>Bilumbu byalawu twánanga mu nzila kikuma masuwa makala tika malembi-malembi. Mu phasi twátudila ku thwala ya mbanza ya Kinidi. Pfunzi yatuhekaku nzila, hanga thweka kwendisa ku zawala dya Kheleti, twáhitila ku Salumoni. <verse eid="ACT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8"/>Mu phasi za lawu twakala kwendila amana twátula homa hamosi bakala tela ni Mbungu Yabukheti, bela-bela yi mbanza ya Lazeya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9"/>Bwosu twálutisa tangwa dya lawu amana phila ya kukwendila yákuma kihonza, tangwa dya kuzila kudya<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuzila kudya mu tangwa dya tsuka ya mvula yi luyandiku lwa mbangala: yenina khumbu yikwawu ya mukinzi wa bayuta "kikuma kya kudifyongununa". Muna tangwa medina, mbuta wa banganga Nzambi kakala tambika kimenga kikuma kya masumu ma bisi Kiseledi (Lev 16:29-34). Bakalawa ta mu ngonda ya vwa, kondilo ku luyandiku lwa ngonda ya kumi, muna tangwa dina, mamba kakala kihonza mu kusabuka.</char></note> dyáhita. Pholu watekila bazimbwala: <verse eid="ACT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10"/>«Banduku bama, mboni ni nzila yayi, yakalaku lwesi yambi kikuma kya masuwa yi bilekwa byenina mu kati; kaasi kikuma kya moya myetu phi.» <verse eid="ACT 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11"/>Kaasi satudiyoni kákwikilaku mu mambu ma Pholu, hanga wuyukidi lwesi wuna wakala natisa masuwa yi mukwa mawu. <verse eid="ACT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12"/>Kikuma mbungu yákalaku mboti mu kuzakala mu tangwa dya kyosi, bahika báyandika mu kukatuka kuna, bazola ni batula ku Fenikisi, mbungu yikwawu ya Kheleti, yina yátala kuna mazyokidi ma tangwa, ndangu balutisila kwakuna tangwa dya kyosi.<verse eid="ACT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pfunzi yitukudi hana yanga dya mbuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13"/>Koma ka muphephi kátuka ku banda, káhita; bábanza ni balungisa lukanu lwa bawu. Báthuta kima kya zitu kina kyakala zyamisa masuwa ku thwala pfunzi hanga masuwa mekakwendila ku kabeta ka sambwa dya Kheleti. <verse eid="ACT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14"/>Kaasi ku manima ma tangwa dya khunda, pfunzi yimosiyátuka ku zawala, yina bisi tela «kimbongila kya ku tunda yi ku tsosu» yátukula. <verse eid="ACT 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15"/>Masuwa mahunguluka, hakalaku mutindu wa kuzyamina ku kimbongila; hanga tudiyambwadidi kwetu twatika. <verse eid="ACT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16"/>Bwabuna twakala hitila kuna kabeta ka koma ka zawala kamosi bisi tela ni Khota, twahita, mu phasi twákwatikisila mudimba wuna wákala wakuzitikila ku manima ma masuwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17"/>Kunima dya kukoka masuwa, basadi ba masuwa bákasama misinga ndangu mamwangalakanaku. Bweya bákalabwawu ni basangamina nana mu zelu dya Siditi, amana básula muna mamba kima kya zitu kina kyambuta kyakala simba masuwa bayandika mu kutika. <verse eid="ACT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18"/>Kilumbu kyalanda, bwosu yakala tuningisa ngolu pfunzi, bátimbula mu mamba ndambu ya bilekwa bina byákala mu masuwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19"/>Kilumbu kyatatu, bálosa hika bisalulu bya bina byákala mu masuwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20"/>Keti tangwa keti thetimbwa kálubukaku, muna bilumbu byalawu, amana pfunzi yakala tukula ngolu. Hanga tukatudini kivuvu kya kuhuluka.<verse eid="ACT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21"/>Bádyaku keti kima kimosi tuka thama. Hanga Pholu, wátelama hana kati dya bawu, wábazimbwala: «Banduku bama, wadi lwangyukilaka ni tukatukaku ku Kheleti, wadi lumonikiniku phasi za bwabu. <verse eid="ACT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22"/>Kaasi buthwena yilulombi ni lwakala yi khwakasu; mukuma ka mosi ku wa benu watotisa luzingu; kaasi masuwa lwesi. <verse eid="ACT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23"/>Kikuma muna phipha ya lelu, wanzyo mosi wa Nzambi wuna wumvini yi wuna yisi sadila kándubwakidini <verse eid="ACT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24"/>amana kánzimbwadini: "Wuyukaku bweya, Pholu! Bufwani wenda samba ku thwala Khayisala, amana Nzambi wukuheki kabu dya boosu bana babati tika mu mamba kumosi yi ngeyi." <verse eid="ACT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25"/>Kikuma kya buna, dikasikisenu, bakhunda bama, mukuma mbati kwikila mwena Nzambi ni dyakála bwosu kánzimbwala. <verse eid="ACT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26"/>Batútimbula ku sambwa dya zawala dimosi.»<verse eid="ACT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27"/>Yákala phipha ya kumi yi ya wakala tunatisa muphephi muna yanga dya Adiyatiki. Muna kati kya phipha, basadi ba masuwa bakala mona ni tubwesuki mu tsekengi. <verse eid="ACT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28"/>Bázitikila kisengu kya zitu kuna musinga ndangu batesila dingu, bamoni ni kuleya kwa dingu kwákala kitesu kya metele makumaya. Kunima dya kuphusana koma, bátesa hika, bámona ni dingu dyekina kitesu kya metele makumatatu. <verse eid="ACT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29"/>Bweya bwábakwata ni masuwa madibunda nana ku matadi, yihana bátimbwala bima biya bya zitu byákala kuna manima ma masuwa, mu kuhingila ni kuma kwakhya tswatsu. <verse eid="ACT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30"/>Kaasi, bwosu bákala yi sunga dya kutina, basadi ba masuwa, bakala hunikisa mu kukulumuna mudimba wa luhulusu muna mamba hanga bana bendi zitikila bima bya zitu ku thwala ya masuwa, <verse eid="ACT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31"/>Pholu wázimbula kwena satudiyoni yi kwena baphumbulu: «Yukani batu baba benamwoku mu kati kya masuwa, lufwaniku lwahúlukaku.» <verse eid="ACT 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32"/>Hanga baphumbulu batabudi misinga mina myakala zyamisa mudimba wa luhulusu amana báyambwadilawa ni wabwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33"/>Buna bakala hingila ni kuma kwakhya, Pholu wábaheka kikesa boosu ndangu badya, wuzimbudini: «Lelu kilumbu kya kumi yi ya tuka buna lubati hingila, amana konda kudya kima. <verse eid="ACT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34"/>Yihana mbati lubokwadila ni lwatambula madya, mukuma mupfunu maluyenina kikuma kya luhulusu lwenu. Ka mosi ku hana kati dya benu watótisa lusuki lumosi lwa mutwa wandi.» <verse eid="ACT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35"/>Kunima dya kuzimbula bwabuna, wátambula dipha, wávutula matondu kwena Nzambi ku thwala boosu, kunima wábukunadya amana wáyandika mu kudya. <verse eid="ACT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36"/>Hanga, bwosu kyabavutwakisa kikesa, boosu bátambula madya. <verse eid="ACT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37"/>Muna masuwa, batu boosu, twákala khama zoodi yi makumi tsambwadi yi sambanu. <verse eid="ACT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38"/>Tangwa bádya boosu bayukuti, bálosa bule mu yanga dya mbuta ndangu masuwa makuma hengi-hengi.<verse eid="ACT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Masuwa mazangani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39"/>Buna kwakya kuma, bábakulayoku tsi, kaasi bámona lwesi homa hana kákotila mamba mu mafu, amana bámeka kununguna masuwa yi kuna khungu ya mamba. <verse eid="ACT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40"/>Bákutumuna misinga mya bima bya zitu ndangu basulabya mu mamba amana bákutumuna muna mbala mosi bima bya zitu bina byákala ku yenda dya masuwa; kunima bátelamisa muledi wa yenda wahika kuna thwala ya masuwa ndangu muphephi wanatisa masuwa ku sambwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41"/>Kaasi bábwa ha tumba dimosi dya tsekengi ha kati kya phuphu zodi, amana masuwa mábatakana. Mutwa wa masuwa wakalaku nikana hika, hanga mayo misi bula manima ma masuwa yi ngolu zoosu. <verse eid="ACT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42"/>Baphumbulu bázola mu kuhonda batu ba boloku boosu ndangu keti mosi wa bawu katinaku mu kusaya. <verse eid="ACT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43"/>Kaasi satudiyoni, yandi kázola kamuhulula Pholu, hanga wubakandisi mu kulungisa dibanza dya bawu. Wásenda kwena bana bázaya kusaya ni baditimbula batheti mu mamba ndangu balubuka ku tseki; <verse eid="ACT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44"/>Bakwawu báfwana kubalanda mu kusadila mabaya yi bitini bya masuwa. Yibwabuna bálubwakila batu boosu ku tseki konda kima kya mbi.<verse eid="ACT 27:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Pholu ku zawala dya Madita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1"/>Buna twalubuka konda kihonza, bátuzimbwala ni zawala dina khumbu ya dyawu Madita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2"/>Bisi zawala meni dina bátuyamba yi mbundu yimosi. Bwosu kakala noka mvula yi kikuma kya kyosi, hanga bawiki kalunga ziku dya mbawu, batutedini betu boosu twayetila. <verse eid="ACT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3"/>Pholu kátonguna mukuta wa mitsosu ndangu kasya hana mbawu, kaasi, muna kyungila kya mbawu, sawa mosi wálubukamwa amana wánama kuna koku dyandi. <verse eid="ACT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4"/>Tangwa bámona nyoka wanama kuna koku dyandi, bisi zawala dina bádizimbwala bawu yi bawu: «Mu kyedika mutu yandu muhondisi kenina, mbatanana kahuluki ku yanga dya mbuta konda kihonza, nzambi wuna wisi futa batu ku mbi ya bawu, katondiku ni kazinga hika.» <verse eid="ACT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5"/>Kaasi Pholu wákhukumuna koku, nyoka wábwa hana ziku dya mbawu amana káyukaku keti ndunza. <verse eid="ACT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6"/>Batu báhingila ni bamumona kuvimba holo kabwa amana kafwa muna mbala mosi; kaasi bwosu bahingila lawu, mu kumona ni keti kima kimosi kyambi kyamubwilaku, hanga babaludi mabanza ma bawu amana báyandika mu kuzimbula ni nzambi mosi kákala.<verse eid="ACT 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7"/>Mwákala, muna bela-bela, yi mukombu wumosi wa pfumu wa zawala, khumbu yandi Phubidiyusi. Yandi wátutambula yi mbundu yimosi amana twánanga kuna nzu yandi bilumbu bitatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8"/>Tata wa Phubidiyusi walambalala kákala hana thangi; mbawu ya mulutu kákala yawu yi phulu-phulu ya menga. Hanga Pholu wukoti muna nzu yandi, wámulombila Nzambi, wámusya moku amana wábeluka. <verse eid="ACT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9"/>Hanga bwabuna, bambefu bahika bákala muna zawala bísa bawu phi amana bábeluka. <verse eid="ACT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10"/>Luzitu lwalawu bátuheka, amana mu kukatuka kwetu, bátukana byosu bina twákalabyawu mupfunu.<verse eid="ACT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu wutudini ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11"/>Kunima munangu wa ngonda tatu, tukoti mu masuwa mana ma bisi Alekizandi mana malutisa tangwa dya kyosi muna zawala, básonika: «Dyosikidi<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dyosikidi: yenina khumbu ya bamaphasa, Kasitolu yi Pholukusi, bázayakana lawu muna mikhenda mya banzambi ba bisi ngeleti. Batu bana bisi saya mu mamba bakala babongila hanga banzambi bana bisi tanina batu boosu bisi kangadila mu mamba.</char></note>.» <verse eid="ACT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12"/>Buna twátula ku Silakusi, twánanga kwakuna bilumbu bitatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13"/>Ha twákatuka kuna, tulandi mukinda wa zawala yikuna twatudila ku Lekyo. Pfunzi ya kubanda buna yátukula amana mu kilumbu kyalanda, twátula ku Phuzolesi kunima bilumbu byodi. <verse eid="ACT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14"/>Twáwana, muna mbanza meni yayina, baphangi bahika bana bátulomba ndangu twananga phosa mosi kwena bawu. Bwabuna thwendila ku Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15"/>Baphangi bana bákala mu mbanza, bana báyuka khululuka ni tubati kwisa, bisa tutundakana yikuna Zandu dya Haphiyusi yi kuna nzu mosi ya banzenza bisi tela: "Ku nzu tatu." Buna kábamona, Pholu wávutula matondu kwena Nzambi amana wábonga kikesa. <verse eid="ACT 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16"/>Kunima kutula kwetu ku Loma, bámusenda Pholu ni kadikadila homa hahika kumosi yi phumbulu mosi wuna wakala mutadikila.<verse eid="ACT 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu wulongi malongi ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17"/>Kunima bilumbu bitatu, Pholu wátedisa bambuta ba Bayuta. Tangwa bákhokama, wábazimbwala: «Baphangi bama, konda kuhanga kima kitadidi betu-betu, holo kitadidi mikuku mya batata betu, meni, yenina mukwa boloku, tukidila ku Yelusalemi bándambula kwena bisi Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18"/>Kunima dya kuphyula byufu, bawu bázola ni bangyambwadila, kikuma mwákalaku kima, mwena meni, kyálunga kundatina lufwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19"/>Kaasi Bayuta bátambwasabwoku amana bándundika ni yílombabwa kwena Khayisala, konda kukala kwama yi dibanza dya kufunda kanda dyama. <verse eid="ACT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20"/>Kikuma kya bwabuna ndombidikini ni yilumona amana yiluzonzisa, mukuma miyololu myami, bakhasimya kikuma kya kivuvu kya bisi Kiseledi.» <verse eid="ACT 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21"/>Bamuvutwadini: «Twátambudiku keti kisyati kimosi kyátuka ku Yuteya, kikuma kya ngeyi amana phi keti phangi mosi kísakwoku mu kuzonzila holo kuzimbula kifu kya ngeyi. <verse eid="ACT 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22"/>Kaasi twazóla ni twakuhinikina mu kuzonza ngeyi meni buna wubati banza, mukuma tuzayibwa ni muma mwosu babatidya telamina dingumba dina wadinama dyawu ngeyi.»<verse eid="ACT 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23"/>Báyukana kilumbu kimosi amana bisa muwana kwakuna kákala nimba yi batu balawu kuluta. Muna kinzonzi kyandi, kakala ta kimbangi kya Kipfumu kya Nzambi yi kudiyangisa muna mitsiku mya Moyize yi Bambikudi, mu kubakwikisa mu mambu mana matadidini Yesu; tukidila suka yi kuna masikidika. <verse eid="ACT 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24"/>Bamosi bámuyukila mu mana kakala zonza, kaasi bahika bábwisa mu kukwikila. <verse eid="ACT 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25"/>Bwosu bámwangana, konda kuyukana bawu yi bawu, Pholu wáyika ndinga yimosi: «Kitembu Kyatoma, wánunga kwandi, tangwa kázonza kwena batata benu, mwena mbikudi Yesaya!" <verse eid="ACT 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26"/>Tangwa kázimbula:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">"Ndawenda kwena kanda dina amana zimbula:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Lwayukiki kwenu mboti, lwabakudikiku keti kima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">lwasimbuludiki, kaasi lwamonikiku keti koma.<verse eid="ACT 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27"/>Mukuma mbundu ya batu baba yizitamini;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">bazindini matu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">amana bazibikini mesu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">hanga bamona nana yi mesu ma bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">bayuka nana yi matu ma bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">babakula nana yi mbundu ya bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">amana bavútwakisaku kwena meni ndangu yibábelula."<verse eid="ACT 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28"/>zayenubwoku phi ni luhulusu luna lwa Nzambi, kwena baphani báhitikalwa: bawu, bayúkalwa.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 28:28">[ <verse eid="ACT 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29"/>Buna kázimbula bwabuna, Pholu, Bayuta bénda mu kutendana ngolu bawu yi bawu.]<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna masonuku mahika, nzila yayi yeninamwoku. </char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30"/>Mvula zodi za muthu kánanga muna nzu yina káluwa. Kakala yamba boosu bana bakala kwisa mutala. <verse eid="ACT 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31"/>Kakala samuna mambu ma Kipfumu kya Nzambi, yi kulonga mana matadidi Pfumu Yesu Kidisitu, yi kikesa kyosu, konda kumukandikisa.<verse eid="ACT 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28"/>
</usx>
